<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JOB" style="id">- Biblica® Open Asante Twi Contemporary Bible 2020</book>
  <para style="h">Hiob</para>
  <para style="toc1">Hiob Nwoma</para>
  <para style="toc2">Hiob</para>
  <para style="toc3">Hiob</para>
  <para style="mt1">Hiob Nwoma</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JOB 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 1:1"/>Ɔbarima bi tenaa ase wɔ Us<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Us yɛ ɔman bi a na ɛda Yordan apueeɛ fam. Na Hiob nyɛ Israelni.</char></note> asase so a na ne din de Hiob. Na ne ho nni asɛm na ɔyɛ pɛ; na ɔsuro Onyankopɔn, na ɔtwe ne ho firi bɔne ho. <verse eid="JOB 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 1:2"/>Na ɔwɔ mmammarima baason ne mmammaa baasa, <verse eid="JOB 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 1:3"/>na ɔwɔ nnwan mpem nson, nyoma mpem mmiɛnsa, anantwie mpamho ahanum ne mfunumu bereɛ aha enum, na ɔwɔ asomfoɔ bebree. Na ɔyɛ onipa kɛseɛ paa wɔ nnipa a wɔwɔ Apueeɛ fam nyinaa no mu.<verse eid="JOB 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 1:4"/>Na ne mmammarima no to ɛpono nnidisoɔ nnidisoɔ wɔ wɔn afie mu, na wɔto nsa frɛ wɔn nnuammaa baasa no ne wɔn bɔ mu didi, nom. <verse eid="JOB 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 1:5"/>Sɛ apontoɔ nna no twam a, Hiob soma kɔfrɛ wɔn na wɔdwira wɔn ho. Ɔsɔre anɔpahema bɔ ɔhyeɛ afɔdeɛ ma wɔn mu biara, ɛfiri sɛ ɔdwene sɛ, “Ebia na me mma no ayɛ bɔne na wɔadome Onyankopɔn wɔ wɔn akoma mu.” Yei yɛ dwuma a na Hiob di no ɛberɛ-ano-berɛ ano.<verse eid="JOB 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hiob Sɔhwɛ A Ɛdi Ɛkan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 1:6"/>Ɛda bi, abɔfoɔ no de wɔn ho bɛkyerɛɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, na Satan kaa wɔn ho baeɛ. <verse eid="JOB 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 1:7"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> bisaa Satan sɛ, “Wofiri he na wobaa ha?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 1:7">Satan buaa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> sɛ, “Mefiri asase so akyinkyinakyinkyini ne emu akɔneabadie mu.”<verse eid="JOB 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 1:8"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bisaa Satan sɛ, “Wadwene me ɔsomfoɔ Hiob ho anaa? Obiara nte sɛ ɔno wɔ asase so, ne ho nni asɛm na ɔtene, ɔyɛ onipa a ɔsuro Onyankopɔn na ɔkyiri bɔne.”<verse eid="JOB 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 1:9"/>Satan buaa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> sɛ, “Hiob suro Onyankopɔn kwa anaa? <verse eid="JOB 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 1:10"/>Wonnyee ban mfaa ɔno, ne fie ne biribiara a ɔwɔ ho anaa? Woahyira ne nsa ano adwuma so, enti ne nnwan ne nʼanantwie ase atrɛ asase no so. <verse eid="JOB 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 1:11"/>Na wo deɛ, tene wo nsa na sɛe deɛ ɔwɔ nyinaa, na ɔbɛgyina wʼanim na wadome wo.”<verse eid="JOB 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 1:12"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Satan sɛ, “Ɛyɛ, deɛ ɔwɔ nyinaa wɔ wo nsam, nanso ɔno ankasa deɛ, mfa wo nsateaa nka no.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 1:12">Na Satan firii <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim kɔeɛ.<verse eid="JOB 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 1:13"/>Ɛda bi a Hiob mmammarima ne ne mmammaa redidi na wɔrenom bobesa wɔ wɔn nuabarima panin fie no, <verse eid="JOB 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 1:14"/>ɔbɔfoɔ bi baa Hiob hɔ, bɛkaa sɛ, “Anantwie no refɛntɛm na mfunumu no redidi wɔ wɔn nkyɛn no, <verse eid="JOB 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 1:15"/>Sebafoɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Na Sabafoɔ yɛ atukɔtenafoɔ a na wɔte Arabia anafoɔ fam.</char></note> bɛto hyɛɛ yɛn so, sesaa wɔn kɔɔeɛ. Wɔde afena kunkumm apaafoɔ no, na me nko ara na medwaneeɛ a merebɛbɔ wo saa amaneɛ yi.”<verse eid="JOB 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 1:16"/>Ɛberɛ a ɔgu so rekasa no, ɔbɔfoɔ foforɔ bi ba bɛkaa sɛ, “Onyankopɔn ogya firi soro abɛhye wo nnwan ne wo nnwanhwɛfoɔ no nyinaa, na me nko ara na medwaneeɛ a merebɛbɔ wo amaneɛ yi.”<verse eid="JOB 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 1:17"/>Ɔgu so rekasa no, ɔbɔfoɔ foforɔ bi bɛkaa sɛ, “Kaldeafoɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Na Kaldeafoɔ yɛ atukɔtenafoɔ a wɔte ɛserɛ a ɛwɔ Mesopotamia so. Wɔn ara na wɔbɛtenaa Babilonia yɛɛ no ahemman.</char></note> de akorɔmfoɔ akuo mmiɛnsa baa wo nyoma so bɛsoaa wɔn kɔeɛ. Wɔde afena kunkumm asomfoɔ no na me nko ara na medwaneeɛ a merebɛbɔ wo amaneɛ yi.”<verse eid="JOB 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 1:18"/>Ɛberɛ a ɔgu so rekasa no, ɔbɔfoɔ foforɔ bi ba bɛkaa sɛ, “Na wo mmammarima ne wo mmammaa redidi na wɔrenom bobesa wɔ wɔn nuabarima panin fie, <verse eid="JOB 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 1:19"/>na prɛko pɛ, ahum bi bɔ firii ɛserɛ no so bɛdwiraa efie no ntwea ɛnan no. Efie no dwiri guu wɔn so na akunkum wɔn, na me nko ara na medwaneeɛ a merebɛbɔ wo amaneɛ yi.”<verse eid="JOB 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 1:20"/>Yei maa Hiob sɔre gyinaa hɔ, sunsuanee nʼatadeɛ mu na ɔyii ne tirinwi. Afei ɔtenaa fam sɔree <char style="nd">Awurade</char> <verse eid="JOB 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 1:21"/>kaa sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 1:21">“Adagya na mede mefiri me maame yam baeɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 1:21">na adagya na mede bɛsane akɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 1:21">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de maeɛ, na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> afa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 1:21">nhyira nka <char style="nd">Awurade</char> din!”<verse eid="JOB 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 1:22"/>Yei nyinaa mu no, Hiob anyɛ bɔne sɛ ɔbɛbɔ Onyankopɔn soboɔ.<verse eid="JOB 1:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JOB 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Hiob Sɔhwɛ A Ɛtɔ So Mmienu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 2:1"/>Ɛda foforɔ bi, abɔfoɔ no baa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim bio na Satan nso kaa wɔn ho baeɛ. <verse eid="JOB 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 2:2"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> bisaa Satan sɛ, “Wofiri he na wobaa ha?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 2:2">Satan buaa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> sɛ, “Mefiri asase so akyinkyinakyinkyini ne emu akɔneabadie mu.”<verse eid="JOB 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 2:3"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bisaa Satan sɛ, “Woadwene mʼakoa Hiob ho anaa? Obiara nte sɛ ɔno wɔ asase so, ne ho nni asɛm na ɔtene. Ɔyɛ onipa a ɔsuro Onyankopɔn na ɔkyiri bɔne. Ɛwom sɛ wohyɛɛ me sɛ mensɛe no a menni nnyinasoɔ biara deɛ, nanso ɔda so gyina ne pɛpɛyɛ no mu.”<verse eid="JOB 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 2:4"/>Satan buaa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> sɛ, “Wedeɛ pere wedeɛ. Onipa de deɛ ɔwɔ nyinaa bɛma de apere ne nkwa. <verse eid="JOB 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 2:5"/>Sɛ ɛbɛtumi a tene wo nsa fa ka ne honam ne ne nnompe, na ɔbɛdome wo wɔ wʼanim!”<verse eid="JOB 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 2:6"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Satan sɛ, “Ɛyɛ, ɔwɔ wo nsam na ne nkwa deɛ, gyaa mu ma no.”<verse eid="JOB 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 2:7"/>Enti, Satan firii <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim, na ɔmaa akuro a ɛyɛ yea totɔɔ Hiob ho firi ne nan ase kɔsii nʼapampam. <verse eid="JOB 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 2:8"/>Afei, na kyɛmferɛ na Hiob de dwi ne ho, ɛberɛ a ɔte nsõ mu.<verse eid="JOB 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 2:9"/>Ne yere bisaa no sɛ, “Woda so kura wo pɛpɛyɛ no mu ara? Dome Onyankopɔn, na wu!”<verse eid="JOB 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 2:10"/>Na Hiob buaa no sɛ, “Wokasa sɛ ɔbaa a ɔyɛ ɔkwasea. Ade pa deɛ, yɛagye afiri Onyankopɔn nsam na ade bɔne na yɛmpo anaa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 2:10">Yei nyinaa mu, Hiob anka asɛm bɔne.<verse eid="JOB 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hiob Nnamfo Baasa No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 2:11"/>Ɛberɛ a Hiob nnamfo baasa bi a wɔne Temanni Elifas,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Na Elifas yɛ Edomni a ɔfiri Teman.</char></note> Suhini Bildad ne Naamani Sofar tee amanehunu a aba Hiob so no, wɔfirii wɔn afie mu, hyia yɛɛ adwene sɛ wɔbɛkɔ akɔhwɛ no na wɔakyekye ne werɛ. <verse eid="JOB 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 2:12"/>Wɔhunuu Hiob firii akyiri no, wɔanhunu sɛ ɛyɛ ɔno; wɔhyɛɛ aseɛ twaa agyaadwoɔ, sunsuanee wɔn ntadeɛ mu, tuu mfuturo guu wɔn tiri so. <verse eid="JOB 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 2:13"/>Na wɔne no tenaa fam nnanson, awia ne anadwo. Na obiara ankasa, ɛfiri sɛ, wɔhunuu sɛ nʼamanehunu no nyɛ asɛmwa.<verse eid="JOB 2:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JOB 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Hiob Kasa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 3:1"/>Akyire no, Hiob kasaeɛ, na ɔdomee ɛda a wɔwoo no. <verse eid="JOB 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 3:2"/>Ɔkaa sɛ,<verse eid="JOB 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 3:3"/>“Ma ɛda a wɔwoo me no nyera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:3">ne anadwo a wɔkaa sɛ, ‘Wɔawo ɔbabarima no!’<verse eid="JOB 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 3:4"/>Saa ɛda no nnuru sum;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:4">mma Ɔsoro Onyankopɔn nhwehwɛ akyire kwan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:4">mma hann biara ntɔ ngu so.<verse eid="JOB 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 3:5"/>Ma esum ne owusum nnye no mfa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:5">ma omununkum nkata so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:5">na esum mmunkam ne hann so.<verse eid="JOB 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 3:6"/>Ma esum kabii nnye saa anadwo no mfa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:6">ma wɔnyi saa anadwo no mfiri asranna so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:6">na wɔmmfa nhyɛ ɔbosome biara mu.<verse eid="JOB 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 3:7"/>Saa anadwo no nyɛ obonini;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:7">mma wɔnnte anigyeɛ nteam wɔ mu.<verse eid="JOB 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 3:8"/>Ma wɔn a wɔdome nna no nnome saa ɛda no;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:8">wɔn a wɔayɛ krado sɛ wɔbɛkanyane dɛnkyɛmmirampɔn no.<verse eid="JOB 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 3:9"/>Ma nʼanɔpa nsoromma nnuru sum;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:9">na ɔntwɛne adekyeeɛ kwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:9">a ɔnhunu anɔpa owia nsensaneɛ a ɛdi ɛkan,<verse eid="JOB 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 3:10"/>ɛfiri sɛ anto deɛ ɔwoo me awotwaa mu ama wawo me,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:10">anka mʼani nhunu saa abɛbrɛsɛ yi.<verse eid="JOB 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 3:11"/>“Adɛn enti na manwu awoeɛ hɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:11">ɛberɛ a mefiri me maame awotwaa mu no?<verse eid="JOB 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 3:12"/>Adɛn enti na nkotodwe gyee me</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:12">ne nufoɔ sɛ mennum?<verse eid="JOB 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 3:13"/>Anka sɛsɛɛ meda hɔ asomdwoeɛ mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:13">anka mada regye mʼahome<verse eid="JOB 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 3:14"/>me ne ewiase ahemfo ne fotufoɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:14">wɔn a wɔsisii adan maa wɔn ho na ɛnnɛ yi abubuo no,<verse eid="JOB 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 3:15"/>me ne sodifoɔ a na wɔwɔ sika kɔkɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:15">wɔn a wɔde dwetɛ hyɛɛ wɔn afie mu ma.<verse eid="JOB 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 3:16"/>Anaasɛ adɛn enti na wɔansie me sɛ ɔpɔn ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:16">te sɛ abadomaa a wanhunu adekyeeɛ hann da?<verse eid="JOB 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 3:17"/>Ɛhɔ na amumuyɛfoɔ gyae basabasayɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:17">na abrɛfoɔ nya ahomegyeɛ.<verse eid="JOB 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 3:18"/>Nneduafoɔ nso nya wɔn ahofadie;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:18">na wɔnte nnommumfoɔ wuranom ateatea bio.<verse eid="JOB 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 3:19"/>Nketewa ne akɛseɛ wɔ hɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:19">na akoa de ne ho firi ne wura nsam.<verse eid="JOB 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 3:20"/>“Adɛn enti na wɔma mmɔborɔfoɔ hann,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:20">na ɔkra mu ahohiahiafoɔ nya nkwa?<verse eid="JOB 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 3:21"/>Wɔn kɔn dɔ owuo, nanso ɛmma.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:21">Wɔbrɛ hwehwɛ owuo sene sɛdeɛ wɔhwehwɛ akoradeɛ.<verse eid="JOB 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 3:22"/>Sɛ wɔwu a, wɔn ani gye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:22">na wɔduru damena mu a, wɔdi ahurisie.<verse eid="JOB 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 3:23"/>Adɛn enti na wɔde nkwa ma onipa a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:23">ɔnni daakye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:23">deɛ Onyankopɔn aka no ahyɛ mu?<verse eid="JOB 3:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 3:24"/>Ahomekokoguo adane mʼaduane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:24">na mʼapinisie gu te sɛ nsuo.<verse eid="JOB 3:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 3:25"/>Deɛ na mesuro no aba me so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:25">deɛ na ɛbɔ me hu no ato me.<verse eid="JOB 3:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 3:26"/>Menni ahotɔ, menni asomdwoeɛ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:26">menni ahomegyeɛ na mmom, ɔhaw nko ara.”<verse eid="JOB 3:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JOB 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Elifas Mmuaeɛ A Ɛdi Ɛkan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 4:1"/>Na Temanni Elifas buaa Hiob sɛ,<verse eid="JOB 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 4:2"/>“Sɛ obi pɛ sɛ ɔne wo kasa a, worennya ntoboaseɛ mma no anaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:2">Hwan na wɔbɛtumi aka nʼano ato mu?<verse eid="JOB 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 4:3"/>Dwene sɛdeɛ wakyerɛkyerɛ nnipa bebree,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:3">sɛdeɛ woahyɛ nsa a emu ayɛ mmerɛ den.<verse eid="JOB 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 4:4"/>Wo nsɛm ahyɛ wɔn a wɔasunti no den;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:4">woahyɛ nkotodwe a ayɛ mmerɛ mu den.<verse eid="JOB 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 4:5"/>Na afei a ɔhaw aba no, wʼaba mu abu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:5">aba wo so, na wo ho adwiri wo.<verse eid="JOB 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 4:6"/>Wo nyamesuro mma wo ahotosoɔ anaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:6">na wʼakwan a ɛho nni asɛm mma wo anidasoɔ anaa?<verse eid="JOB 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 4:7"/>“Dwene ho: Wɔasɛe obi a ne ho nni asɛm pɛn anaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:7">Ɛhefa na wɔsɛee obi a ɔyɛ pɛ?<verse eid="JOB 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 4:8"/>Sɛdeɛ mahunu no, wɔn a wɔfɛntɛm bɔne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:8">ne wɔn a wɔdua ɔhaw no, wɔtwa so aba.<verse eid="JOB 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 4:9"/>Sɛ Onyankopɔn home a, wɔsɛe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:9">nʼabufuo ma wɔyera.<verse eid="JOB 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 4:10"/>Agyata bɛtumi abobom na wɔapɔ so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:10">nanso wɔbɛbubu gyata akɛseɛ no se.<verse eid="JOB 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 4:11"/>Gyata annya haboa a ɔwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:11">na gyatabereɛ mma no bɔ hwete.<verse eid="JOB 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 4:12"/>“Wɔbɛkaa kokoamsɛm bi kyerɛɛ me</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:12">na mʼaso tee no sɛ asomusɛm.<verse eid="JOB 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 4:13"/>Wɔ anadwo daeɛso basabasa mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:13">ɛberɛ a nnipa adeda nnahɔɔ no,<verse eid="JOB 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 4:14"/>ehu ne nketenkete kyeree me.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:14">Ɛmaa me nnompe nyinaa wosoeɛ.<verse eid="JOB 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 4:15"/>Honhom bi twaa mʼani so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:15">na me ho nwi sɔre gyinaeɛ.<verse eid="JOB 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 4:16"/>Ɛgyinaeɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:16">nanso, manhunu nʼabɔsuo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:16">Biribi bɛgyinaa mʼanim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:16">na metee nne bɔkɔɔ bi a ɛrebisa sɛ,<verse eid="JOB 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 4:17"/>‘Onipa dasani bɛtumi atene asene Onyankopɔn?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:17">Onipa bɛtumi ayɛ kronn asene ne Yɛfoɔ anaa?<verse eid="JOB 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 4:18"/>Sɛ Onyankopɔn ntumi mfa ne ho nto nʼankasa asomfoɔ so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:18">na sɛ ɔka nʼabɔfoɔ mpo anim a,<verse eid="JOB 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 4:19"/>hwan ne onipa a wɔde dɔteɛ anwene no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:19">a ne fapem sisi mfuturo mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:19">na wɔdwerɛ no ntɛm so sene abubummabaa?<verse eid="JOB 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 4:20"/>Ɛfiri anɔpahema kɔsi anwummerɛ wɔbubu wɔn mu nketenkete;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:20">na wɔyera korakora a obiara nhunu wɔn bio.<verse eid="JOB 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 4:21"/>Wɔtete wɔn ntomadan nhoma mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:21">ɛno enti wɔwuwu a wɔnnim.’<verse eid="JOB 4:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="JOB 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JOB 5"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 5:1"/>“Wopɛ a frɛ, na hwan na ɔbɛgye wo soɔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:1">Akronkronfoɔ no mu hwan nkyɛn na wobɛkorɔ?<verse eid="JOB 5:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 5:2"/>Ahisɛm kum ɔkwasea,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:2">na anibereɛ kum atetekwaa.<verse eid="JOB 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 5:3"/>Mʼankasa mahunu ɔkwasea a ɔrefefɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:3">nanso, mpofirim, wɔdomee ne fie.<verse eid="JOB 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 5:4"/>Ne mma ne banbɔ ntam ɛkwan ware,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:4">wɔdwerɛ wɔn wɔ asɛnniiɛ a wɔnnya ɔkamafoɔ.<verse eid="JOB 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 5:5"/>Deɛ ɛkɔm de noɔ no di ne nnɔbaeɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:5">na ɔfa firi nkasɛɛ mu mpo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:5">na deɛ osukɔm de noɔ no pere di nʼahodeɛ akyi.<verse eid="JOB 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 5:6"/>Ahokyere mmpue mfiri dɔteɛ mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:6">na ɔhaw nso mmpue mfiri fam.<verse eid="JOB 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 5:7"/>Nanso wɔwo nnipa to ɔhaw mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:7">mpɛn dodoɔ a ogyaframa turi kɔ ɔsoro.<verse eid="JOB 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 5:8"/>“Nanso sɛ ɛyɛ me a, anka mɛdwane atoa Onyankopɔn;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:8">na mede mʼasɛm ato nʼanim.<verse eid="JOB 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 5:9"/>Ɔyɛ anwanwadeɛ a wɔntumi nhwehwɛ mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:9">ne nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ a wɔntumi nkan ne dodoɔ.<verse eid="JOB 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 5:10"/>Ɔtɔ nsuo gu asase so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:10">na ɔde kɔ wira mu.<verse eid="JOB 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 5:11"/>Ɔde ahobrɛasefoɔ si deɛ ɛkorɔn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:11">na ɔma wɔn a wɔdi awerɛhoɔ nya asomdwoeɛ.<verse eid="JOB 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 5:12"/>Ɔsɛe anifirefoɔ nhyehyɛeɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:12">ma wɔn nsa si fam.<verse eid="JOB 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 5:13"/>Ɔkyere anyansafoɔ wɔ wɔn anifire mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:13">na ɔbɔ anitefoɔ nhyehyɛeɛ gu.<verse eid="JOB 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 5:14"/>Esum duru wɔn awia ketee;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:14">na wɔkeka owigyinaeɛ te sɛ anadwo.<verse eid="JOB 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 5:15"/>Ɔgye ahiafoɔ firi afena a ɛhyɛ wɔn anomu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:15">ɔgye wɔn firi ahoɔdenfoɔ nkyehoma mu.<verse eid="JOB 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 5:16"/>Enti, ahiafoɔ wɔ anidasoɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:16">na ntɛnkyea ka nʼano to mu.<verse eid="JOB 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 5:17"/>“Nhyira ne onipa a Onyankopɔn tene no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:17">enti mmu Otumfoɔ ntenetene no animtiaa.<verse eid="JOB 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 5:18"/>Ɛfiri sɛ, ɔno na ɔpira na ɔno ara akyekyere;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:18">ɔpira nanso ne nsa sa yadeɛ.<verse eid="JOB 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 5:19"/>Ɔbɛgye wo afiri ɔhaw ahodoɔ nsia mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:19">nson so, a bɔne biara renka wo.<verse eid="JOB 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 5:20"/>Ɛkɔm ba a, ɔbɛgye wo afiri owuo mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:20">na ɔko mu nso, ɔbɛgye wo afiri afena ano.<verse eid="JOB 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 5:21"/>Wɔbɛbɔ wo ho ban afiri kasatwie ho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:21">na sɛ ɔsɛeɛ ba a, ɛnsɛ sɛ wosuro.<verse eid="JOB 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 5:22"/>Wobɛsere ɔsɛeɛ ne ɔkɔm;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:22">na ɛnsɛ sɛ wosuro asase so mmoa.<verse eid="JOB 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 5:23"/>Wo ne afuo so aboɔ bɛyɛ apam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:23">na emu nkekaboa nso ne wo bɛtena asomdwoeɛ mu.<verse eid="JOB 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 5:24"/>Wobɛhunu sɛ wo ntomadan wɔ banbɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:24">na sɛ wosese wʼahodeɛ a, wobɛhunu sɛ hwee nyeraeɛ.<verse eid="JOB 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 5:25"/>Wobɛhunu sɛ wo mma bɛyɛ bebree;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:25">na wʼasefoɔ bɛdɔre sɛ ɛserɛ.<verse eid="JOB 5:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 5:26"/>Wode ahoɔden bɛkɔ damena mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:26">te sɛ afiafi a wɔaboa ano wɔ otwa berɛ mu.<verse eid="JOB 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 5:27"/>“Yɛahwehwɛ yei mu, na ɛyɛ nokorɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:27">ɛno enti tie na fa toto wʼabrabɔ ho.”<verse eid="JOB 5:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JOB 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Hiob Bua Elifas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 6:1"/>Na Hiob buaa sɛ,<verse eid="JOB 6:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 6:2"/>“Sɛ wɔbɛtumi akari mʼawerɛhodie</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:2">na me haw nso wɔde agu nsania so a,<verse eid="JOB 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 6:3"/>anka emu bɛyɛ duru asene anwea a ɛwɔ ɛpo mu nyinaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:3">enti ɛnyɛ nwanwa sɛ me nsɛm ayɛ hagyahagya.<verse eid="JOB 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 6:4"/>Otumfoɔ agyan no awɔ me mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:4">me honhom nom ano awuduro no;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:4">wɔahyehyɛ Onyankopɔn ahunahuna nyinaa atia me.<verse eid="JOB 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 6:5"/>Wiram afunumu su wɔ ɛberɛ a wanya ɛserɛ anaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:5">na nantwie nso su wɔ ɛberɛ a wanya nʼaduane anaa?<verse eid="JOB 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 6:6"/>Wɔdi aduane a nkyene nni mu anaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:6">na kosua mu fufuo nso ɔdɛ bi wɔ mu anaa?<verse eid="JOB 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 6:7"/>Mempɛ sɛ mede me nsa ka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:7">aduane a ɛte saa no bɔ me yadeɛ.<verse eid="JOB 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 6:8"/>“Ao sɛ me nsa bɛka mʼabisadeɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:8">sɛ Onyankopɔn bɛyɛ deɛ mʼani da so ama me.<verse eid="JOB 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 6:9"/>Mepɛ sɛ Onyankopɔn dwerɛ me,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:9">sɛ ɔbɛtwe ne nsa na wakum me,<verse eid="JOB 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 6:10"/>ɛnneɛ anka mɛkɔ so anya saa awerɛkyekyerɛ yi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:10">Nanso, ɔyea yi nyinaa akyi no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:10">memmuu Ɔkronkronni no nsɛm so da.<verse eid="JOB 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 6:11"/>“Ahoɔden bɛn na mewɔ a enti ɛsɛ sɛ menya anidasoɔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:11">Daakye nneɛma pa bɛn enti na ɛsɛ sɛ menya ntoboaseɛ?<verse eid="JOB 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 6:12"/>Mewɔ ahoɔden sɛ ɛboɔ anaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:12">Me honam yɛ kɔbere mfrafraeɛ anaa?<verse eid="JOB 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 6:13"/>Mewɔ tumi a mede bɛboa me ho anaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:13">Saa ɛberɛ yi a nkonimdie apare me yi?<verse eid="JOB 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 6:14"/>“Deɛ nʼanidasoɔ asa no hia ne nnamfonom mpaeɛbɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:14">ɛnyɛ saa a, ɔbɛpa aba wɔ Otumfoɔ no suro ho.<verse eid="JOB 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 6:15"/>Nanso ahotosoɔ nni me nuanom mu. Wɔte sɛ nsuwa nsuwa a ɛyirie na ɛweɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:15">wɔte sɛ nsuwa nsuwa a ɛyirie<verse eid="JOB 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 6:16"/>ɛberɛ a sukyerɛmma renane</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:16">na asukɔtweaa nso redane nsuo,<verse eid="JOB 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 6:17"/>nanso owiaberɛ mu no, ɛntene bio</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:17">na ɔhyew enti nsuo no tu yera.<verse eid="JOB 6:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 6:18"/>Akwantufoɔ mane firi wɔn akwan so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:18">wɔforo kɔ nsase bonini so na wɔwuwu.<verse eid="JOB 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 6:19"/>Tema akwantufoɔ hwehwɛ nsuo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:19">adwadifoɔ akwantufoɔ a wɔfiri Seba de anidasoɔ hwehwɛ nsuo.<verse eid="JOB 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 6:20"/>Wɔn ho yera wɔn, ɛfiri sɛ na wɔwɔ awerɛhyɛmu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:20">wɔduruu hɔ, nanso wɔn anidasoɔ yɛ ɔkwa.<verse eid="JOB 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 6:21"/>Afei wo nso woakyerɛ sɛ wo ho nni mfasoɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:21">Woahunu mʼamanehunu no, na ama woasuro.<verse eid="JOB 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 6:22"/>Maka sɛ, ‘Momma me biribi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:22">Maka sɛ momfiri mo ahodeɛ ntua me tiri so sika,<verse eid="JOB 6:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 6:23"/>anaasɛ monnye me mfiri mʼatamfoɔ nsam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:23">ne atirimuɔdenfoɔ nkyehoma mu anaa?’<verse eid="JOB 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 6:24"/>“Monkyerɛkyerɛ me, na mɛyɛ komm;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:24">monkyerɛ me mfomsoɔ a mayɛ.<verse eid="JOB 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 6:25"/>Nokorɛka yɛ yea,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:25">na mo adwenkyerɛ no, ɛkɔsi sɛn?<verse eid="JOB 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 6:26"/>Mokyerɛ sɛ deɛ maka no nnyɛ nokorɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:26">mofa obi a nʼabamu abu asɛm sɛ mframa anaa?<verse eid="JOB 6:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 6:27"/>Mpo mobɛbɔ awisiaa so ntonto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:27">na mode mo adamfo adi nsesa dwa.<verse eid="JOB 6:27"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 6:28"/>“Afei momfa ahummɔborɔ nhwɛ me.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:28">Mɛtumi adi atorɔ wɔ mo anim anaa?<verse eid="JOB 6:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 6:29"/>Monto mo bo ase, mommu ntɛnkyea;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:29">monsane nnwene ho, ɛfiri sɛ me pɛpɛyɛ ho aba akyinnyegyeɛ.<verse eid="JOB 6:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 6:30"/>Amumuyɛsɛm wɔ mʼano anaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:30">Mennim papa ne bɔne ntam nsonsonoeɛ anaa?<verse eid="JOB 6:30"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="JOB 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JOB 7"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 7:1"/>“Asase so som nyɛ den mma onipa anaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:1">Ne nkwa nna nte sɛ ɔpaani deɛ?<verse eid="JOB 7:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 7:2"/>Sɛdeɛ akoa ani gyina anwummerɛ sunsumma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:2">anaasɛ ɔpaani ho pere no nʼakatua ho no,<verse eid="JOB 7:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 7:3"/>saa ara na wɔatwa abosome hunu ato me hɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:3">ne anadwo a ɔhaw wɔ mu ama me.<verse eid="JOB 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 7:4"/>Sɛ meda a, medwene bisa sɛ, ‘Ɛberɛ bɛn na adeɛ bɛkye?’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:4">Nanso anadwo twam nkakrankakra, na mepere kɔsi ahemadakye.<verse eid="JOB 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 7:5"/>Asonsono ne aporɔporɔ ahyɛ me honam ma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:5">me honam asɛe na ɛrefiri nsuo.<verse eid="JOB 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 7:6"/>“Me nna kɔ ntɛm sene ɔnwomfoɔ akurokurowa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:6">na ɛkɔ awieeɛ a anidasoɔ biara nni muo.<verse eid="JOB 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 7:7"/>Ao Onyankopɔn, kae sɛ me nkwanna te sɛ ahomeɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:7">na merennya anigyeɛ bio da.<verse eid="JOB 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 7:8"/>Ani a ɛhunu me seesei renhunu me bio;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:8">mobɛhwehwɛ me, nanso na menni hɔ bio.<verse eid="JOB 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 7:9"/>Sɛdeɛ omununkum yera na ɛtu korɔ no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:9">saa ara na deɛ ɔkɔ damena mu no nsane mma bio.<verse eid="JOB 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 7:10"/>Ɔrensane mma ne fie da biara da;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:10">nʼatenaeɛ renkae no bio.<verse eid="JOB 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 7:11"/>“Ɛno enti meremmua mʼano;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:11">mɛfiri me honhom ahoyera mu akasa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:11">mɛfiri me kra ɔyea mu anwiinwii.<verse eid="JOB 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 7:12"/>Meyɛ ɛpo anaa aboa kɛseɛ a ɔwɔ ebunu mu anaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:12">na mode me ahyɛ ɔwɛmfoɔ nsa yi?<verse eid="JOB 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 7:13"/>Sɛ medwene sɛ menya awerɛkyekyerɛ wɔ me mpa so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:13">na mʼakonwa adwodwo mʼanwiinwii ano a,<verse eid="JOB 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 7:14"/>ɛno mpo na wode adaeɛso yi me hu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:14">na wode anisoadehunu hunahuna me,<verse eid="JOB 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 7:15"/>ɛno enti mepɛ akɔmfohyɛ ne owuo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:15">sene me onipadua yi.<verse eid="JOB 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 7:16"/>Memmu me nkwa; mentena ase afebɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:16">Monnyaa me; na me nna nka hwee.<verse eid="JOB 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 7:17"/>“Ɔdasani ne hwan a ne ho hia wo sei,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:17">na wʼani ku ne ho,<verse eid="JOB 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 7:18"/>na wohwehwɛ ne mu anɔpa biara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:18">na wosɔ no hwɛ ɛberɛ biara?<verse eid="JOB 7:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 7:19"/>Worenyi wʼani mfiri me so da,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:19">anaasɛ worennyaa me ɛberɛ tiawa bi mpo anaa?<verse eid="JOB 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 7:20"/>Sɛ mayɛ bɔne a, ɛdeɛn na mayɛ woɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:20">Ao adasamma so wɛmfoɔ?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:20">Adɛn enti na watu wʼani asi me soɔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:20">Mayɛ adesoa ama wo anaa?<verse eid="JOB 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 7:21"/>Adɛn enti na wonkata me mmarato so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:21">na womfa me bɔne nkyɛ me?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:21">Ɛrenkyɛre biara, mɛda mfuturo mu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:21">Wobɛhwehwɛ me nanso na menni hɔ bio.”<verse eid="JOB 7:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JOB 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Bildad Asɛnka A Ɛdi Ɛkan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 8:1"/>Ɛnna Suhini Bildad buaa sɛ:<verse eid="JOB 8:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 8:2"/>“Wobɛkɔ so aka saa nsɛm yi akɔsi da bɛn?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:2">Wo nsɛm yɛ mframa huhuo.<verse eid="JOB 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 8:3"/>Onyankopɔn kyea atɛntenenee anaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:3">Otumfoɔ kyea deɛ ɛtene anaa?<verse eid="JOB 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 8:4"/>Ɛberɛ a wo mma yɛɛ bɔne tiaa noɔ no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:4">ɔgyaa wɔn maa wɔn bɔne so akatua.<verse eid="JOB 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 8:5"/>Nanso sɛ wode wʼani bɛto Onyankopɔn so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:5">na woabɔ Otumfoɔ no mpaeɛ,<verse eid="JOB 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 8:6"/>sɛ woyɛ kronn, na wotene a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:6">wo enti, ɔbɛma ne ho so seesei</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:6">na wama wo asi wo dada mu.<verse eid="JOB 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 8:7"/>Wo ahyɛaseɛ bɛyɛ nkakra nkakra</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:7">na daakye woanya ama abu so.<verse eid="JOB 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 8:8"/>“Bisa awoɔ ntoatoasoɔ a atwam no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:8">na hwehwɛ deɛ wɔn agyanom hunuiɛ.<verse eid="JOB 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 8:9"/>Na wɔwoo yɛn nkyɛreeɛ na yɛnnim hwee.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:9">Yɛn nna wɔ asase yi so te sɛ sunsumma.<verse eid="JOB 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 8:10"/>Nanso adikanfoɔ no bɛkyerɛkyerɛ wo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:10">Wɔbɛfiri wɔn nteaseɛ mu akyerɛ wo nyansa.<verse eid="JOB 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 8:11"/>Paparɔs bɛtumi anyini akɔ soro wɔ baabi a ɛnyɛ ɔwora?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:11">Demmire bɛtumi afifiri baabi a nsuo nni anaa?<verse eid="JOB 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 8:12"/>Ɛberɛ a ɛrenyini a wɔntwaeɛ no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:12">ɛdwane ntɛm so sene ɛserɛ.<verse eid="JOB 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 8:13"/>Saa na wɔn a wɔn werɛ firi Onyankopɔn no awieeɛ teɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:13">saa na wɔn a wɔnni nyamesu no anidasoɔ nkɔsi hwee.<verse eid="JOB 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 8:14"/>Biribiara a nʼani da so no nni ahoɔden;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:14">deɛ ɔde ne ho to soɔ yɛ ananse ntontan.<verse eid="JOB 8:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 8:15"/>Ɔtwere ne ntontan, nanso ɛtete;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:15">ɔsɔ mu denden nanso ɛnyɛ yie.<verse eid="JOB 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 8:16"/>Ɔte sɛ afifideɛ a wɔgugu so nsuo yie a ɛsi owia mu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:16">Ɛtrɛtrɛ ne mman mu wɔ turo no so;<verse eid="JOB 8:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 8:17"/>Ne nhini nyini fa abotan ho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:17">na ɛhwehwɛ ɛkwan kɔ aboɔ mu.<verse eid="JOB 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 8:18"/>Nanso sɛ wɔtu firi ne siberɛ a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:18">saa beaeɛ no nnim no bio na ɛka sɛ, ‘Menhunuu wo da.’<verse eid="JOB 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 8:19"/>Ampa ara ne nkwa twam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:19">na afifideɛ foforɔ nyini asase no so.<verse eid="JOB 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 8:20"/>“Ampa ara Onyankopɔn mpo onipa a ne ho nni asɛm</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:20">na ɔnhyɛ amumuyɛfoɔ nsa mu dene.<verse eid="JOB 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 8:21"/>Ɔbɛma woasere bio,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:21">na wode ahosɛpɛ ateateam.<verse eid="JOB 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 8:22"/>Wɔde aniwuo bɛfira wɔn a wɔtan woɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:22">na amumuyɛfoɔ ntomadan bɛsɛe.”<verse eid="JOB 8:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JOB 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Hiob Bua Bildad</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 9:1"/>Na Hiob kasaa bio sɛ:<verse eid="JOB 9:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 9:2"/>“Aane, menim sɛ yei yɛ nokorɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:2">Na ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na ɔdasani bɛtene wɔ Onyankopɔn anim?<verse eid="JOB 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 9:3"/>Sɛ obi pɛ sɛ ɔne Onyankopɔn yiyi a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:3">ɔrentumi nyi nsɛm apem mu baako mpo ano.<verse eid="JOB 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 9:4"/>Ne nyansa mu dɔ, na ne tumi so.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:4">Hwan na ɔne no adi asie na ne ho baabiara anti?<verse eid="JOB 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 9:5"/>Ɔtutu mmepɔ a wɔnnim ho hwee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:5">ɔbubu wɔn fa so wɔ nʼabufuo mu.<verse eid="JOB 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 9:6"/>Ɔwoso asase firi ne siberɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:6">na ɔma ne nnyinasoɔ woso biribiri.<verse eid="JOB 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 9:7"/>Ɔkasa kyerɛ owia na ɛnhyerɛn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:7">na ɔsɔ nsoromma hyerɛn ano.<verse eid="JOB 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 9:8"/>Ɔno nko ara na ɔtrɛ ɔsoro mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:8">na ɔnante ɛpo asorɔkye so.<verse eid="JOB 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 9:9"/>Ɔno ne Nwenwenente, Akokɔbaatan ne ne mma Yɛfoɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:9">Nsorommabafan ne ewiem anafoɔ fam nsorommakuo no.<verse eid="JOB 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 9:10"/>Ɔyɛ anwanwadeɛ a wɔntumi nte aseɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:10">nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ a wɔntumi nkan.<verse eid="JOB 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 9:11"/>Sɛ ɔnam me ho a, menhunu no;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:11">sɛ ɔsene a, menhunu no.<verse eid="JOB 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 9:12"/>Sɛ ɔhwim kɔ a, hwan na ɔsi no kwan?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:12">Hwan na ɔbɛtumi abisa no sɛ, ‘Ɛdeɛn na woreyɛ yi?’<verse eid="JOB 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 9:13"/>Onyankopɔn nkora nʼabufuo so;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:13">Rahab aboafoɔ mpo ho popo wɔ nʼanim.<verse eid="JOB 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 9:14"/>“Na me ne hwan a me ne no bɛyiyi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:14">Mɛyɛ dɛn anya nsɛm a me ne no de bɛgye akyinnyeɛ?<verse eid="JOB 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 9:15"/>Sɛ menim mpo a, merentumi nyi nʼano;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:15">ɛno ara ne sɛ mɛsrɛ ahummɔborɔ afiri me ɔtemmufoɔ nkyɛn.<verse eid="JOB 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 9:16"/>Mpo, sɛ mefrɛ no na ɔba a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:16">mennye nni sɛ ɔbɛtie mʼasɛm.<verse eid="JOB 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 9:17"/>Ɔde asorɔkye bɛdwerɛ me</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:17">ama mʼapirakuro adɔɔso kwa.<verse eid="JOB 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 9:18"/>Ɔremma menya mʼahome, bio.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:18">Ɔde awerɛhoɔ bɛhyɛ me ma tɔ.<verse eid="JOB 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 9:19"/>Sɛ ɛba no ahoɔden a, ɔyɛ ɔhoɔdenfoɔ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:19">Na sɛ ɛba atɛntenenee nso a, hwan na ɔbɛsamane no?<verse eid="JOB 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 9:20"/>Sɛ medi bem mpo a, mʼano bɛbu me kumfɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:20">sɛ me ho nni asɛm a, ɛbɛbu me fɔ.<verse eid="JOB 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 9:21"/>“Ɛwom sɛ medi bem deɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:21">nanso memmu me ho;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:21">abrabɔ afono me.<verse eid="JOB 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 9:22"/>Ne nyinaa yɛ pɛ; ɛno enti na meka sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:22">‘Ɔsɛe deɛ ne ho nni asɛm ne omumuyɛfoɔ.’<verse eid="JOB 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 9:23"/>Ɛberɛ a amanehunu de owuo aba no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:23">ɔsere deɛ ne ho nni asɛm no akomatuo.<verse eid="JOB 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 9:24"/>Ɛberɛ a asase akɔ amumuyɛfoɔ nsam no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:24">ɔfira ɛso atemmufoɔ ani.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:24">Sɛ ɛnyɛ ɔno a, na ɛyɛ hwan?<verse eid="JOB 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 9:25"/>“Me nna ho yɛ herɛ sene ommirikatufoɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:25">ɛsene kɔ a anigyeɛ kakra mpo nni mu.<verse eid="JOB 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 9:26"/>Ɛtwam kɔ sɛ akodoɔ a wɔde paparɔs ayɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:26">te sɛ akɔdeɛ a wɔreto akyere wɔn ahaboa.<verse eid="JOB 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 9:27"/>Sɛ meka sɛ, ‘Me werɛ mfiri mʼanwiinwii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:27">mɛsesa me nsɛm ka, na masere a,’<verse eid="JOB 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 9:28"/>me yea ahodoɔ no bɔ me hu ara.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:28">Na menim sɛ, woremmu me bem.<verse eid="JOB 9:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 9:29"/>Woabu me fɔ dada enti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:29">adɛn na ɛsɛ sɛ meha me ho kwa?<verse eid="JOB 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 9:30"/>Mpo sɛ ɛba sɛ mede samina dware</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:30">na mede samina hohoro me nsa ho a,<verse eid="JOB 9:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 9:31"/>wobɛto me atwene atɛkyɛ amena mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:31">ama mʼatadeɛ mpo akyiri me.<verse eid="JOB 9:31"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 9:32"/>“Ɔnyɛ onipa te sɛ me na mayi nʼano,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:32">na yɛakɔgyina asɛnniiɛ abobɔ yɛn nkuro.<verse eid="JOB 9:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 9:33"/>Sɛ anka obi wɔ hɔ a ɔbɛsiesie yɛn ntam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:33">na waka yɛn baanu abɔ mu a,<verse eid="JOB 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 9:34"/>obi a ɔbɛyi Onyankopɔn abaa afiri me so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:34">sɛdeɛ nʼahunahuna mmɔ me hu bio a,<verse eid="JOB 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 9:35"/>anka mɛkasa a merensuro no,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:35">nanso saa tebea a mewɔ mu yi deɛ, mentumi.<verse eid="JOB 9:35"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="JOB 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JOB 10"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 10:1"/>“Abrabɔ afono me;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:1">enti mɛka mʼasɛm a meremfa hwee nsie</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:1">na mɛkasa afiri me kra yeadie mu.<verse eid="JOB 10:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 10:2"/>Mɛka akyerɛ Onyankopɔn sɛ: Mmu me kumfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:2">na mmom kyerɛ kwaadu a wobɔ me.<verse eid="JOB 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 10:3"/>Sɛ wohyɛ me so a, ɛdeɛn na wonya?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:3">Adɛn enti na wopo wo nsa ano adwuma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:3">na wosere hwɛ amumuyɛfoɔ nhyehyɛeɛ?<verse eid="JOB 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 10:4"/>Wowɔ ɔhonam mu ani anaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:4">Wohunu adeɛ te sɛ ɔdasani anaa?<verse eid="JOB 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 10:5"/>Wo nkwa nna te sɛ ɔdasani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:5">anaa wo mfeɛ te sɛ onipa,<verse eid="JOB 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 10:6"/>a enti ɛsɛ sɛ wohwehwɛ me mfomsoɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:6">na wopɛɛpɛɛ me bɔne mu?<verse eid="JOB 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 10:7"/>Ɛwom sɛ wonim sɛ menni fɔ deɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:7">nanso obiara nso rentumi nnye me mfiri wo nsam.<verse eid="JOB 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 10:8"/>“Wo nsa na ɛnwonoo me na ɛbɔɔ me.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:8">Afei wobɛdane wo ho asɛe me anaa?<verse eid="JOB 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 10:9"/>Kae sɛ wonwonoo me sɛ dɔteɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:9">Na wobɛdane me ayɛ me mfuturo bio?<verse eid="JOB 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 10:10"/>Woanhwie me sɛ nufosuo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:10">no womaa me mu piiɛ sɛ kyiisi,<verse eid="JOB 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 10:11"/>amfa wedeɛ ne honam ankata me ho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:11">ankeka nnompe ne ntini antoatoa mu anaa?<verse eid="JOB 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 10:12"/>Womaa me nkwa, yii ayamyɛ kyerɛɛ me,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:12">na ɔhwɛsie mu, wohwɛɛ me honhom so.<verse eid="JOB 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 10:13"/>“Nanso yei na wode siee wʼakoma mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:13">na menim sɛ na yei wɔ wʼadwene mu.<verse eid="JOB 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 10:14"/>Sɛ meyɛɛ bɔne a anka wobɛhwɛ me</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:14">na wobɛma me ɛso asotwe.<verse eid="JOB 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 10:15"/>Na sɛ medi fɔ a, nnome nka me!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:15">Na sɛ mpo medi bem a, merentumi mpagya me ti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:15">ɛfiri sɛ aniwuo ahyɛ me ma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:15">na mʼamanehunu amene me.<verse eid="JOB 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 10:16"/>Na sɛ mepagya me ti a, wodɛɛdɛɛ me sɛ gyata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:16">na bio woda wo tumi nwanwa no adi tia me.<verse eid="JOB 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 10:17"/>Wode adansefoɔ foforɔ bɛtia me</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:17">na woma wʼabofuo ano yɛ den wɔ me so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:17">wʼakodɔm tu ba me so ɛberɛ biara.<verse eid="JOB 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 10:18"/>“Adɛn enti na woma wɔwoo me?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:18">Ɛkaa me nko a anka mewuiɛ ansa na ani bi rehunu me.<verse eid="JOB 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 10:19"/>Anka mamma nkwa yi mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:19">anaasɛ wosoaa me firi awotwaa mu de me kɔɔ damena mu tee a, anka ɛyɛ.<verse eid="JOB 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 10:20"/>Aka kakra na me nna atwam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:20">gyaa me na menya anigyeɛ ɛberɛ tiawa bi<verse eid="JOB 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 10:21"/>ansa na makɔ koransane</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:21">kusuuyɛ ne sunsumma kabii asase so,<verse eid="JOB 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 10:22"/>asase a ɛyɛ anadwo sum kabii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:22">sunsumma tumm ne sakasaka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:22">baabi a ɛhɔ hann mpo te sɛ esum.”<verse eid="JOB 10:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JOB 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Sofar Mmuaeɛ A Ɛdi Ɛkan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 11:1"/>Na Naamani Sofar buaa sɛ,<verse eid="JOB 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 11:2"/>“Ɛnsɛ sɛ wɔyi saa nsɛm yi ano anaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:2">Ɛsɛ sɛ wɔbu saa ɔkasafoɔ yi bem anaa?<verse eid="JOB 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 11:3"/>Wo nsɛm hunu no bɛma nnipa ayɛ komm anaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:3">Sɛ wodi fɛ a obiara renka wʼanim anaa?<verse eid="JOB 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 11:4"/>Woka kyerɛ Onyankopɔn sɛ, ‘Me gyidie ho nni asɛm</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:4">na meyɛ pɛ wɔ wʼani so.’<verse eid="JOB 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 11:5"/>Ao, anka mepɛ sɛ Onyankopɔn kasa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:5">anka ɔnkasa ntia wo<verse eid="JOB 11:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 11:6"/>na ɔmmue nyansa mu ahintasɛm so nkyerɛ wo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:6">ɛfiri sɛ nyansa turodoo yɛ afanu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:6">Hunu yei sɛ, Onyankopɔn werɛ afiri wo bɔne no bi mpo.<verse eid="JOB 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 11:7"/>“Wobɛtumi ate Onyankopɔn anwanwadeɛ ase anaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:7">Wobɛtumi abɔre ahunu deɛ Otumfoɔ no tumi kɔpem anaa?<verse eid="JOB 11:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 11:8"/>Ɛkorɔn sene ɔsoro, ɛdeɛn na wobɛtumi ayɛ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:8">Emu dɔ sene damena ase tɔnn, ɛdeɛn na wobɛtumi ahunu?<verse eid="JOB 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 11:9"/>Ne nsusuiɛ mu ware sene asase</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:9">na ɛtrɛ sene ɛpo.<verse eid="JOB 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 11:10"/>“Sɛ ɔba na ɔde wo to nneduadan mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:10">ansa na wasi nkonnwa a, hwan na ɔbɛtumi asi no ɛkwan?<verse eid="JOB 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 11:11"/>Ampa ara ɔhyɛ nnipa nnaadaafoɔ nso;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:11">na sɛ ɔhunu amumuyɛ a, ɔnhyɛ ne nso anaa?<verse eid="JOB 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 11:12"/>Nanso ogyimifoɔ rentumi nyɛ onyansafoɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:12">sɛdeɛ wɔrentumi nwo afunumu ba sɛ onipa no.<verse eid="JOB 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 11:13"/>“Na sɛ wode wʼakoma ma no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:13">na wopagya wo nsa kyerɛ no,<verse eid="JOB 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 11:14"/>sɛ wogyaa bɔne a wokura no mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:14">na woamma amumuyɛ antena wo ntomadan mu a,<verse eid="JOB 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 11:15"/>ɛnneɛ, wobɛpagya wo ti a womfɛre;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:15">wobɛgyina pintinn a wonsuro.<verse eid="JOB 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 11:16"/>Wo werɛ bɛfiri wʼahokyere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:16">na ɛbɛyɛ wo sɛ nsuo a asene korɔ.<verse eid="JOB 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 11:17"/>Wʼabrabɔ bɛhyerɛn asene owigyinaeɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:17">na esum bɛyɛ sɛ adekyeɛ hann.<verse eid="JOB 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 11:18"/>Wobɛnya banbɔ, ɛfiri sɛ anidasoɔ wɔ hɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:18">wobɛhwɛ wo ho ahyia, na wahome asomdwoeɛ mu.<verse eid="JOB 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 11:19"/>Wobɛda ahome, na obi renhunahuna wo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:19">na bebree bɛhwehwɛ mmoa afiri wo nkyɛn.<verse eid="JOB 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 11:20"/>Amumuyɛfoɔ ani bɛfira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:20">wɔrentumi nnwane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:20">na wɔn anidasoɔ bɛdane owuo ahomeguo.”<verse eid="JOB 11:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JOB 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Hiob Bua Sofar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 12:1"/>Na Hiob buaa sɛ,<verse eid="JOB 12:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 12:2"/>“Ampa ara mone nnipa no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:2">na mowu a na nyansa asa!<verse eid="JOB 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 12:3"/>Nanso mewɔ adwene sɛ mo ara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:3">na monnsene me.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:3">Hwan na ɔnnim saa nneɛma yi nyinaa?<verse eid="JOB 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 12:4"/>“Mayɛ aseredeɛ ama me nnamfonom,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:4">mefrɛɛ Onyankopɔn na ɔbuaeɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:4">Mayɛ aseredeɛ tata, nanso metene, na me ho nni asɛm.<verse eid="JOB 12:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 12:5"/>Nnipa a wɔn ho tɔ wɔn bu amanehunu animtiaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:5">sɛdeɛ wɔbu wɔn a wɔn nan rewatiri no awieeɛ animtiaa.<verse eid="JOB 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 12:6"/>Wɔmmfa wɔn nsa nka akorɔmfoɔ ntomadan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:6">na wɔn a wɔma Onyankopɔn bo fuo no wɔ banbɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:6">na Onyankopɔn bɔ deɛ ɔde ma wɔn ho ban.<verse eid="JOB 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 12:7"/>“Bisa mmoa no, na wɔbɛkyerɛ wo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:7">anaasɛ ewiem nnomaa no, na wɔbɛka akyerɛ wo<verse eid="JOB 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 12:8"/>anaasɛ kasa kyerɛ asase, na ɛbɛkyerɛ wo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:8">anaasɛ ma ɛpo mu mpataa nka nkyerɛ wo.<verse eid="JOB 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 12:9"/>Wɔn nyinaa mu hwan na ɔnnim sɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:9">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nsa na ayɛ yei.<verse eid="JOB 12:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 12:10"/>Ne nsam na abɔdeɛ nyinaa ahome wɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:10">ne adasamma nyinaa ahome.<verse eid="JOB 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 12:11"/>Aso nsɔ nsɛm nnhwɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:11">sɛdeɛ tɛkrɛma ka aduane hwɛ no anaa?<verse eid="JOB 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 12:12"/>Wɔnnya nyansa mfiri mpanin nkyɛn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:12">na ɛnyɛ ɔnyinkyerɛ na ɛde nteaseɛ ba anaa?<verse eid="JOB 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 12:13"/>“Nyansa ne tumi yɛ Onyankopɔn dea;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:13">afotuo ne nteaseɛ yɛ ne dea.<verse eid="JOB 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 12:14"/>Deɛ ɔbubu guo no, obiara rentumi nsi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:14">deɛ ɔde no to nneduadan mu no, obiara rentumi nyi no.<verse eid="JOB 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 12:15"/>Sɛ ɔma osuo gyae tɔ a, asase no so yɛ wesee;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:15">sɛ ɔgyaa osutɔ mu a, ɛsɛe asase no.<verse eid="JOB 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 12:16"/>Ahoɔden ne nkonimdie wɔ no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:16">osisifoɔ ne deɛ wɔsisi noɔ nso wɔ no.<verse eid="JOB 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 12:17"/>Ɔpa afotufoɔ ho ntoma ma wɔkɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:17">na ɔma atemmufoɔ yɛ nkwasea.<verse eid="JOB 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 12:18"/>Ɔworɔ ahemfo nkyehoma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:18">na ɔde abɔsoɔ bɔ wɔn asene.<verse eid="JOB 12:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 12:19"/>Ɔpa asɔfoɔ ho ntoma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:19">na ɔtu nnipa a wɔn ase atim akyɛre gu.<verse eid="JOB 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 12:20"/>Ɔka afotufoɔ a wɔgye wɔn die no kasaboa hyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:20">na ɔgye mpanimfoɔ nhunumu.<verse eid="JOB 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 12:21"/>Ɔde animguaseɛ gu atitire so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:21">na ɔtintim gye ahoɔdenfoɔ nsam akodeɛ.<verse eid="JOB 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 12:22"/>Ɔda esum mu nneɛma a ahinta adi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:22">na ɔde esum kabii ba hann mu.<verse eid="JOB 12:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 12:23"/>Ɔyɛ aman akɛseɛ, na ɔsɛe wɔn;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:23">ɔtrɛ aman mu, na ɔhwete wɔn mu.<verse eid="JOB 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 12:24"/>Ɔgye ewiase akannifoɔ adwene firi wɔn nsam;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:24">na ɔma wɔkyinkyini asase wesee a ɛkwan nna soɔ so.<verse eid="JOB 12:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 12:25"/>Wɔhwehwɛ wɔ esum mu a wɔnni kanea;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:25">na ɔma wɔtɔ ntintan sɛ asabofoɔ.<verse eid="JOB 12:25"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="JOB 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JOB 13"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 13:1"/>“Mʼani ahunu yeinom nyinaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:1">mʼaso ate, na ate aseɛ nso.<verse eid="JOB 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 13:2"/>Deɛ wonim no, me nso menim;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:2">wo nsene me.<verse eid="JOB 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 13:3"/>Nanso mepɛ sɛ mekasa kyerɛ Otumfoɔ no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:3">na me ne Onyankopɔn toatoa adwene wɔ mʼasɛm ho.<verse eid="JOB 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 13:4"/>Mode atorɔ mmom na afɔre me ho;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:4">mo nyinaa moyɛ ayaresafoɔ a mo ho nni mfasoɔ!<verse eid="JOB 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 13:5"/>Sɛ mobɛyɛ komm koraa a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:5">ɛno na ɛbɛyɛ nyansa ama mo!<verse eid="JOB 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 13:6"/>Afei montie mʼano asɛm;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:6">montie mʼanoyie.<verse eid="JOB 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 13:7"/>Mobɛka amumuyɛsɛm ama Onyankopɔn anaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:7">Mobɛka nnaadaasɛm ama no anaa?<verse eid="JOB 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 13:8"/>Mobɛkyea mo aso ama no?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:8">Mobɛka Onyankopɔn asɛm ama no anaa?<verse eid="JOB 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 13:9"/>Sɛ ɔhwehwɛ mo mu a, ɛbɛsi mo yie anaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:9">Mobɛtumi adaadaa no sɛdeɛ modaadaa nnipa no anaa?<verse eid="JOB 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 13:10"/>Sɛ mokyeaa mo aso wɔ kɔkoam a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:10">sɛdeɛ ɛteɛ biara, ɔbɛka mo anim.<verse eid="JOB 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 13:11"/>Nʼanimuonyam mmɔ mo hu anaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:11">Ne ho suro nntɔ mo so anaa?<verse eid="JOB 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 13:12"/>Mo kasatɔmmɛ yɛ mmɛbuo a ɛte sɛ nsõ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:12">mo anoyie yɛ dɔteɛ.<verse eid="JOB 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 13:13"/>“Monyɛ dinn, na menkasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:13">na deɛ ɛbɛyɛ me biara mmra me so.<verse eid="JOB 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 13:14"/>Adɛn enti na mede me ho to amaneɛ mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:14">na mede me nkwa to me nsam?<verse eid="JOB 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 13:15"/>Ɛwom sɛ ɔkumm me deɛ, nanso ne so na mʼani bɛda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:15">ampa ara mɛdi mʼakwan ho adanseɛ wɔ nʼanim.<verse eid="JOB 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 13:16"/>Nokorɛm, yei na ɛbɛyɛ me nkwagyeɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:16">ɛfiri sɛ deɛ ɔnsuro Onyankopɔn no rentumi nkɔ nʼanim!<verse eid="JOB 13:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 13:17"/>Montie me nsɛm yi yie;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:17">monyɛ aso mma deɛ meka.<verse eid="JOB 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 13:18"/>Afei a masiesie me nkurobɔ yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:18">menim sɛ mɛdi bem.<verse eid="JOB 13:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 13:19"/>Obi bɛtumi abɔ me kwaadu anaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:19">Sɛ ɛte saa deɛ a, anka mɛyɛ komm na mawu.<verse eid="JOB 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 13:20"/>“Ao Onyankopɔn, yɛ saa nneɛma mmienu yi pɛ ma me,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:20">na afei meremfa me ho nsuma wo:<verse eid="JOB 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 13:21"/>Yi wo nsa firi me so kɔ akyirikyiri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:21">na gyae wo ho hu a wode hunahuna me no.<verse eid="JOB 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 13:22"/>Afei samena me na mɛba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:22">anaa ma menkasa na bua me.<verse eid="JOB 13:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 13:23"/>Mfomsoɔ ne bɔne dodoɔ ahe na mayɛ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:23">Kyerɛ me me mfomsoɔ ne me bɔne.<verse eid="JOB 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 13:24"/>Adɛn enti na wode wʼanim asie me</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:24">na wodwene sɛ meyɛ wo ɔtamfoɔ?<verse eid="JOB 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 13:25"/>Wobɛyɛ ahahan a mframa rebɔ no ayayadeɛ anaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:25">Wobɛtaa ntɛtɛ a awoɔ anaa?<verse eid="JOB 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 13:26"/>Wotwerɛ soboɔ a ɛyɛ yea tia me,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:26">na woka me mmabunuberɛ mu bɔne nyinaa gu me so.<verse eid="JOB 13:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 13:27"/>Wode nkyehoma gu me nan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:27">wohwɛ mʼanammɔnkwan nyinaa so yie</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:27">na wode ahyɛnsodeɛ ayeyɛ mʼanammɔn mu.<verse eid="JOB 13:27"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 13:28"/>“Enti onipa nkwa sa te sɛ biribi a aporɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:28">te sɛ atadeɛ a nweweboa adie.<verse eid="JOB 13:28"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="JOB 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JOB 14"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 14:1"/>“Onipa a ɔbaa awo no no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:1">ne nna yɛ tiaa bi na ɔhaw dɔɔso wɔ mu.<verse eid="JOB 14:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 14:2"/>Ɔfefɛ te sɛ nhwiren na ɛtwintwam;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:2">ɔte sɛ sunsum a ɛretwam akɔ, ɔntena hɔ nkyɛ.<verse eid="JOB 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 14:3"/>Woma wʼani kɔ saa onipa yi so?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:3">Wode no bɛba wʼanim abɛbu no atɛn anaa?<verse eid="JOB 14:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 14:4"/>Hwan na ɔbɛtumi ayi deɛ ɛyɛ kronn afiri efi mu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:4">Obiara nni hɔ.<verse eid="JOB 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 14:5"/>Woahyehyɛ onipa nkwa nna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:5">woahyɛ nʼabosome dodoɔ ato hɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:5">na woahyɛ no ɛberɛ a ɔrentumi ntra.<verse eid="JOB 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 14:6"/>Enti, yi wʼani firi ne so na ɔnyɛ deɛ ɔpɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:6">kɔsi sɛ ɔbɛwie nʼadwuma sɛ ɔpaani.<verse eid="JOB 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 14:7"/>“Dua mpo anidasoɔ wɔ hɔ ma no:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:7">Sɛ wɔtwa a, ɛbɛfefɛ bio,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:7">na ne mman foforɔ no rempempan.<verse eid="JOB 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 14:8"/>Ne nhini bɛtumi anyini akyɛre asase mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:8">na ne dunsini nso awu wɔ dɔteɛ mu,<verse eid="JOB 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 14:9"/>nanso, ɔnya nsuo a ɛfefɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:9">na ɛyiyi mman sɛ dua a wɔatɛ.<verse eid="JOB 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 14:10"/>Nanso, sɛ nnipa wu a wɔde no hyɛ fam;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:10">ɔhome deɛ ɛtwa toɔ a, na afei ɔnni hɔ bio.<verse eid="JOB 14:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 14:11"/>Sɛdeɛ nsuo tu yera wɔ ɛpo mu no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:11">anaa sɛdeɛ nsuka mu weɛ no,<verse eid="JOB 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 14:12"/>saa ara na onipa tɔ fam na ɔnsɔre bio;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:12">ɛnkɔsi sɛ ɔsoro bɛtwam no, nnipa rensɔre</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:12">na wɔrennyane wɔn mfiri wɔn nna mu.<verse eid="JOB 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 14:13"/>“Sɛ anka wode me bɛsie damena mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:13">de me ahinta kɔsi sɛ wʼabofuo bɛtwam!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:13">Sɛ anka wobɛhyɛ me berɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:13">na afei woakae me!<verse eid="JOB 14:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 14:14"/>Sɛ onipa wu a, ɔbɛba nkwa mu bio anaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:14">Mʼaperedie nna mu nyinaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:14">mɛtwɛn akɔsi sɛ me foforɔyɛ bɛba.<verse eid="JOB 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 14:15"/>Wobɛfrɛ na mɛgye wo so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:15">wʼani bɛgyina abɔdeɛ a wo nsa ayɛ.<verse eid="JOB 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 14:16"/>Afei wobɛkan mʼanammɔntuo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:16">na worenni me bɔne akyi.<verse eid="JOB 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 14:17"/>Wɔbɛsɔ me bɔne ano wɔ kotokuo mu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:17">na woakata mʼamumuyɛ so.<verse eid="JOB 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 14:18"/>“Nanso, sɛdeɛ mmepɔ so hohoro na ɛdwirie</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:18">na abotan nso twe firi ne siberɛ no,<verse eid="JOB 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 14:19"/>sɛdeɛ nsuo yiyi aboɔ ho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:19">na osutɔ brane twe dɔteɛ kɔ no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:19">saa ara na wosɛe onipa anidasoɔ.<verse eid="JOB 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 14:20"/>Wotintim ne so prɛko pɛ, na ɔtwam kɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:20">wosakyera ne nipasu na wogya no kwan.<verse eid="JOB 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 14:21"/>Sɛ wɔhyɛ ne mmammarima animuonyam a, ɔnnim;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:21">na sɛ wɔbrɛ wɔn ase a, ɔnhunu.<verse eid="JOB 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 14:22"/>Ɔno ara wedeɛ mu yea na ɔteɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:22">na ɔno ara ne ho na ɔgyam.”<verse eid="JOB 14:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JOB 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Elifas Mmuaeɛ A Ɛtɔ So Mmienu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 15:1"/>Na Temanni Elifas buaa sɛ,<verse eid="JOB 15:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 15:2"/>“Enti onyansafoɔ de nsɛm a aba biara nni muo bɛyi nʼano</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:2">anaasɛ ɔde apueeɛ mframa a emu yɛ hye bɛhyɛ nʼafuru ma?<verse eid="JOB 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 15:3"/>Ɔde nsɛm huhuo bɛdi anobaabaeɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:3">aka nsɛm a ɛntu bunu biara anaa?<verse eid="JOB 15:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 15:4"/>Wototo onyamesuro ase mmom</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:4">na wosi Onyankopɔn mu ahotosoɔ ho ɛkwan.<verse eid="JOB 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 15:5"/>Wo bɔne kyerɛ wʼano deɛ ɔnka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:5">na woafa aniteɛ tɛkrɛma.<verse eid="JOB 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 15:6"/>Wo ankasa wʼano bu wo kumfɔ, ɛnyɛ me deɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:6">wʼankasa wʼano di adanseɛ tia wo.<verse eid="JOB 15:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 15:7"/>“Wone onipa a wɔwoo wo dii ɛkan?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:7">Wɔwoo wo ansa na wɔrewo nkokoɔ?<verse eid="JOB 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 15:8"/>Wotie Onyankopɔn afotuo anaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:8">Wo nko ara na wonim nyansa anaa?<verse eid="JOB 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 15:9"/>Ɛdeɛn na wonim a, yɛnnim?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:9">Nhunumu bɛn na wowɔ a yɛnnie?<verse eid="JOB 15:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 15:10"/>Deɛ wafu dwono ne akɔkoraa wɔ yɛn afa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:10">wɔn a wɔanyini sene wʼagya mpo.<verse eid="JOB 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 15:11"/>Onyankopɔn awerɛkyekyerɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:11">ne nsɛm a wɔka no brɛoo kyerɛ wo no sua ma wo anaa?<verse eid="JOB 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 15:12"/>Adɛn enti na wʼakoma atwe wo korɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:12">adɛn enti na wʼani asɔ ogya,<verse eid="JOB 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 15:13"/>na woadane wʼabofuo agu Onyankopɔn so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:13">na woma saa nsɛm yi pue firi wʼano?<verse eid="JOB 15:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 15:14"/>“Ɔdasani ne hwan a ɔbɛtumi ayɛ pɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:14">anaasɛ deɛ ɔbaa awo noɔ bɛn na ɔbɛtumi ayɛ ɔteneneeni?<verse eid="JOB 15:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 15:15"/>Onyankopɔn nni ahotosoɔ wɔ nʼakronkronfoɔ mu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:15">Ɔsorosoro mpo nnyɛ kronn wɔ nʼani so,<verse eid="JOB 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 15:16"/>na nkantom onipa bɔnefoɔ ne omumuyɛfoɔ a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:16">ɔnom awurukasɛm sɛ nsuo.<verse eid="JOB 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 15:17"/>“Tie me, na mɛkyerɛ wo mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:17">ma menka deɛ mahunu nkyerɛ wo,<verse eid="JOB 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 15:18"/>deɛ anyansafoɔ apae mu aka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:18">a wɔamfa biribiara a wɔnya firii wɔn agyanom hɔ no ansie<verse eid="JOB 15:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 15:19"/>(wɔn a wɔde asase no maa wɔn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:19">ɛberɛ a ananafoɔ biara nni hɔ):<verse eid="JOB 15:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 15:20"/>Omumuyɛfoɔ kɔ ahohiahia mu ne nkwanna nyinaa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:20">Na basabasayɛni nso, wɔahyehyɛ ne mfeɛ nyinaa ama no.<verse eid="JOB 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 15:21"/>Nnyegyeɛ a ɛyɛ hu hyɛ nʼasom ma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:21">na sɛ ɛyɛ sɛ nneɛma rekɔ yie ma no a, akorɔmfoɔ to hyɛ ne so.<verse eid="JOB 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 15:22"/>Ɔpa aba sɛ ɔbɛdwane afiri esum mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:22">wɔabɔ no ato hɔ ama akofena.<verse eid="JOB 15:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 15:23"/>Ɔkyinkyini hwehwɛ aduane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:23">ɔnim sɛ esum da no abɛn.<verse eid="JOB 15:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 15:24"/>Ɔhaw ne ahoyera yi no hu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:24">ɛhyɛ ne so sɛ ɔhene a wasiesie ne ho ama ɔko,<verse eid="JOB 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 15:25"/>ɛfiri sɛ ɔtenetene ne nsa kyerɛ Onyankopɔn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:25">na ɔma ne ho so tia Otumfoɔ.<verse eid="JOB 15:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 15:26"/>Wɔde akokyɛm a emu pi na ɛyɛ den</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:26">kɔ ne so a wɔnsuro no.<verse eid="JOB 15:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 15:27"/>“Ɛwom sɛ sradeɛ ama wɔn afono atotɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:27">na wɔn asene mu ɛnam agu mmɛbɛ deɛ,<verse eid="JOB 15:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 15:28"/>nanso wɔbɛtena nkuro a aguo so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:28">na wɔatena afie a obi nte mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:28">afie a ɛrebubu mu.<verse eid="JOB 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 15:29"/>Wɔrenkɔ so nyɛ adefoɔ bio, na wɔn ahonya rennyina,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:29">na wɔn agyapadeɛ so bɛte na ayera wɔ asase so.<verse eid="JOB 15:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 15:30"/>Esum bɛduru wɔn;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:30">ogyaframa bɛkusa wɔn mman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:30">na Onyankopɔn anom ahomeguo bɛsoa wɔn akɔ.<verse eid="JOB 15:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 15:31"/>Ɛnsɛ sɛ wɔde wɔn ho to nneɛma huhuo so de daadaa wɔn ho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:31">ɛfiri sɛ wɔrennya hwee mfiri mu.<verse eid="JOB 15:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 15:32"/>Ansa na wɔn da bɛduru no, wɔbɛtua wɔn ka a ebi renka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:32">na wɔn mman renyɛ frɔmfrɔm.<verse eid="JOB 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 15:33"/>Wɔbɛyɛ sɛ bobedua a wɔapore so aba a ɛnnyiniiɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:33">te sɛ ngo dua a ne nhyerɛnne repore gu fam.<verse eid="JOB 15:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 15:34"/>Na abɔnefoɔ fekuo a wɔnnim Onyankopɔn no renso aba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:34">na ogya bɛhye wɔn a wɔdɔ kɛtɛasehyɛ no ntomadan.<verse eid="JOB 15:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 15:35"/>Wɔnyinsɛn ɔhaw na wɔwo amumuyɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:35">wɔn awotwaa siesie nnaadaa.”<verse eid="JOB 15:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JOB 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Hiob Mmuaeɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 16:1"/>Afei Hiob buaeɛ sɛ,<verse eid="JOB 16:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 16:2"/>“Mate nsɛm bebree a ɛte sɛ yeinom;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:2">na mo nyinaa moyɛ gyamserefoɔ!<verse eid="JOB 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 16:3"/>Mo kasa tentene no mma awieeɛ anaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:3">Ɛdeɛn na ɛha mo enti a mogu so redi anobaabaeɛ yi?<verse eid="JOB 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 16:4"/>Sɛ mo na mowɔ me tebea yi mu a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:4">anka me nso mɛtumi akasa sɛ mo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:4">anka mɛtumi akeka nsɛm a ɛyɛ dɛ atia mo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:4">na mabu mo animtiaa.<verse eid="JOB 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 16:5"/>Nanso, anka mɛhyɛ mo den;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:5">anka awerɛkyekyerɛ nsɛm a ɛbɛfiri mʼanomu no bɛma mo ahotɔ.<verse eid="JOB 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 16:6"/>“Nanso sɛ mekasa a, ɔyea a mete no remmoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:6">na sɛ mankasa nso a, ɛrennyae.<verse eid="JOB 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 16:7"/>Ao Onyankopɔn, ampa ara woama mabrɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:7">woasɛe me fie pasaa.<verse eid="JOB 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 16:8"/>Woakyekyere me, ma abɛyɛ adansedie;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:8">me so teɛ ara na ɛreteɛ, na ɛdi adanseɛ tia me.<verse eid="JOB 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 16:9"/>Onyankopɔn to hyɛ me so tete me wɔ nʼabufuo mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:9">na ɔtwɛre ne se gu me so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:9">deɛ ɔne me anya no pɔkyere nʼani hwɛ me.<verse eid="JOB 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 16:10"/>Nnipa bue wɔn ano di me ho fɛw;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:10">wɔbɔ me sotorɔ de bu me animtiaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:10">na wɔka wɔn ho bɔ mu de tia me.<verse eid="JOB 16:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 16:11"/>Onyankopɔn de me ama abɔnefoɔ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:11">Wato me atwene amumuyɛfoɔ nsam.<verse eid="JOB 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 16:12"/>Na biribiara kɔ yie ma me, nanso ɔdwerɛɛ me;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:12">ɔsɔɔ me kɔn mu, too me hwee hɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:12">Ɔde me asi nʼani so;<verse eid="JOB 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 16:13"/>nʼagyantofoɔ atwa me ho ahyia,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:13">ɔhwiree me sawa mu a wanhunu me mmɔbɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:13">maa me bɔnwoma pete guu fam.<verse eid="JOB 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 16:14"/>Ɔba me so ɛberɛ biara;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:14">na ɔto hyɛ me so sɛ ɔkofoɔ.<verse eid="JOB 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 16:15"/>“Mapam ayitoma akata me wedeɛ so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:15">na masie mʼanintɔn wɔ mfuturo mu.<verse eid="JOB 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 16:16"/>Agyaadwotwa ama mʼani ayɛ kɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:16">sunsum kabii atwa mʼani ho ahyia.<verse eid="JOB 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 16:17"/>Nanso, me nsa nyɛɛ basabasayɛ biara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:17">na me mpaeɛbɔ yɛ kronn.<verse eid="JOB 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 16:18"/>“Ao asase, nkata me mogya so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:18">na mma wɔnsie me sufrɛ!<verse eid="JOB 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 16:19"/>Seesei mpo, me danseni wɔ soro;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:19">Me ɔkamafoɔ wɔ soro hɔ.<verse eid="JOB 16:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 16:20"/>Me ɔdimafoɔ yɛ mʼadamfo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:20">ɛberɛ a mesu gu Onyankopɔn soɔ yi;<verse eid="JOB 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 16:21"/>ɔgyina onipa anan mu di ma no wɔ Onyankopɔn anim</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:21">sɛdeɛ obi di ma nʼadamfo no.<verse eid="JOB 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 16:22"/>“Mfeɛ kakra bi akyi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:22">mɛtu kwan akɔ koransane.<verse eid="JOB 16:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JOB 17"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 17:1"/>Me sunsum atɔ piti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:1">me nna so atwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:1">na damena retwɛn me.<verse eid="JOB 17:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 17:2"/>Ampa ara fɛdifoɔ atwa me ho ahyia;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:2">ɛsɛ sɛ mehwɛ wɔn atutupɛ.<verse eid="JOB 17:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 17:3"/>“Ao Onyankopɔn, hyɛ me ɛbɔ a wopɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:3">Hwan bio na ɔbɛma me banbɔ?<verse eid="JOB 17:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 17:4"/>Woato wɔn adwene mu a wɔnte asɛm ase;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:4">enti woremma wɔnni nkonim.<verse eid="JOB 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 17:5"/>Sɛ obi sopa ne nnamfonom de nya akatua a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:5">ne mma ani bɛfira.<verse eid="JOB 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 17:6"/>“Onyankopɔn de me ayɛ asɛm a ɛda obiara ano,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:6">obi a wɔte ntasuo gu nʼani so.<verse eid="JOB 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 17:7"/>Awerɛhoɔ ama mʼani ayɛ samoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:7">me bɔberɛ nyinaa yɛ sunsumma.<verse eid="JOB 17:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 17:8"/>Ateneneefoɔ hunu me a, ɛyɛ wɔn nwanwa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:8">Wɔn a wɔdi bem no bɛsɔre atia wɔn a wɔnni nyamesu.<verse eid="JOB 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 17:9"/>Ateneneefoɔ bɛkɔ wɔn anim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:9">na wɔn a wɔn nsa ho teɛ bɛkɔ so anya ahoɔden.<verse eid="JOB 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 17:10"/>“Mo nyinaa mo nsane mmra mmɛsɔ me nhwɛ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:10">Na merennya onyansafoɔ wɔ mo mu.<verse eid="JOB 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 17:11"/>Me nna atwam, me nhyehyɛeɛ apansam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:11">saa ara na mʼakoma apɛdeɛ nso ayɛ.<verse eid="JOB 17:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 17:12"/>Saa nnipa yi ma anadwo dane awia;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:12">esum mu koraa no, wɔka sɛ, ‘Hann abɛn,’<verse eid="JOB 17:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 17:13"/>Sɛ efie baako pɛ a mʼani da so ne damena,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:13">sɛ mesɛ me kɛtɛ wɔ esum mu,<verse eid="JOB 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 17:14"/>sɛ meka kyerɛ porɔeɛ sɛ, ‘Woyɛ mʼagya,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:14">na me kyerɛ ɔsonsono sɛ, ‘Me maame’ anaa ‘Me nuabaa’ a,<verse eid="JOB 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 17:15"/>na afei mʼanidasoɔ wɔ he?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:15">Hwan na ɔbɛtumi anya anidasoɔ bi ama me?<verse eid="JOB 17:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 17:16"/>Ɛbɛsiane akɔ owuo ɛpono ano anaa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 17:16">Yɛn nyinaa bɛsiane akɔ mfuturo mu anaa?”<verse eid="JOB 17:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JOB 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Bildad Mmuaeɛ A Ɛtɔ So Mmienu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 18:1"/>Na Suhini Bildad buaa sɛ,<verse eid="JOB 18:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 18:2"/>“Ɛberɛ bɛn na wobɛgyae kasa tenten yi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:2">Dwene ho yie, na afei yɛbɛtumi akasa.<verse eid="JOB 18:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 18:3"/>Adɛn enti na wofa yɛn sɛ anantwie</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:3">na wosusu sɛ yɛnnim nyansa yi?<verse eid="JOB 18:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 18:4"/>Wo a wode abufuo tete wo mu nketenkete,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:4">wo enti, ɛsɛ sɛ yɛfiri asase yi so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:4">anaasɛ wo enti, wɔnnwiri mmotan mfiri wɔn siberɛ anaa?<verse eid="JOB 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 18:5"/>“Omumuyɛfoɔ kanea adum;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:5">na ne ogya nnɛre bio.<verse eid="JOB 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 18:6"/>Hann a ɛwɔ ne ntomadan mu duru sum;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:6">kanea a ɛsi ne ho no dum.<verse eid="JOB 18:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 18:7"/>Nʼanammɔntuo mu ahoɔden ano bɛbrɛ ase;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:7">nʼankasa nhyehyɛeɛ bɛhwe nʼase.<verse eid="JOB 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 18:8"/>Nʼanammɔn de no kɔ afidie mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:8">na ɔkyinkyini kɔtɔ nʼatena mu.<verse eid="JOB 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 18:9"/>Afidie sɔ ne nantin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:9">na ɛsɔ ne mu denden.<verse eid="JOB 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 18:10"/>Wɔasum no afidie ahinta wɔ fam;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:10">afidie wɔ ne kwan mu.<verse eid="JOB 18:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 18:11"/>Ahunahuna ma ɔbɔ huboa wɔ ne ho nyinaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:11">na ɛha no wɔ nʼanammɔntuo biara mu.<verse eid="JOB 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 18:12"/>Atoyerɛnkyɛm kɔn dɔ no;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:12">na sɛ ɔhwe ase a, amanehunu retwɛn no.<verse eid="JOB 18:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 18:13"/>Ɛwewe ne honam ani baabi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:13">na owuo di ɛkan sɛe nʼakwaa.<verse eid="JOB 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 18:14"/>Wɔtwe no firi ne ntomadan banbɔeɛ mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:14">na wɔde no brɛ ahunahunahene.<verse eid="JOB 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 18:15"/>Ogya te ne ntomadan mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:15">na wɔabɔ sɔfe a ɛrederɛ apete nʼatenaeɛ.<verse eid="JOB 18:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 18:16"/>Ne nhini wuwu wɔ aseɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:16">na ne mman nso wu wɔ ɔsoro.<verse eid="JOB 18:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 18:17"/>Wɔrenkae no asase so bio;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:17">na ɔrennya edin wɔ asase so.<verse eid="JOB 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 18:18"/>Wɔka no firi hann mu kɔ sum mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:18">na wɔpam no firi ewiase.<verse eid="JOB 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 18:19"/>Ɔnni mma anaa nananom wɔ ne nkurɔfoɔ mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:19">na nʼase ni biara renka wɔ baabi a ɔtenaeɛ.<verse eid="JOB 18:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 18:20"/>Nnipa a wɔfiri atɔeɛ fam ho adwiri wɔn wɔ deɛ ato noɔ no ho;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:20">na wɔn a wɔwɔ apueeɛ fam abɔ huboa.<verse eid="JOB 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 18:21"/>Ampa ara sei na omumuyɛfoɔ atenaeɛ teɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:21">sei ne beaeɛ a deɛ ɔnnim Onyankopɔn teɛ.”<verse eid="JOB 18:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JOB 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Hiob Bua Bildad</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 19:1"/>Na Hiob kasaa bio sɛ,<verse eid="JOB 19:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 19:2"/>“Mobɛhyɛ me aniɛyaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:2">na mode nsɛm abubu me akɔsi da bɛn?<verse eid="JOB 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 19:3"/>Mpɛn edu nie a moasopa me;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:3">mo ani nwu sɛ moto hyɛ me so.<verse eid="JOB 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 19:4"/>Sɛ ɛyɛ nokorɛ sɛ mafom ɛkwan a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:4">me mfomsoɔ yɛ me nko ara asɛm.<verse eid="JOB 19:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 19:5"/>Sɛ ampa sɛ mobɛma mo ho so wɔ me so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:5">na mode mʼanimguaseɛ ayɛ adanseɛ atia me a,<verse eid="JOB 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 19:6"/>ɛnneɛ monhunu sɛ Onyankopɔn ayɛ me bɔne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:6">na ɔde nʼatena atwa me ho ahyia.<verse eid="JOB 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 19:7"/>“Ɛwom sɛ mesu sɛ, ‘Wɔafom me’ deɛ, nanso obiara mmua me;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:7">meteam pɛ mmoa, nanso atɛntenenee biara nni hɔ.<verse eid="JOB 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 19:8"/>Wasi me ɛkwan enti mentumi mensene;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:8">wama mʼakwan so aduru sum.<verse eid="JOB 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 19:9"/>Wayi mʼanimuonyam afiri me so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:9">na watu mʼahenkyɛ afiri me ti so.<verse eid="JOB 19:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 19:10"/>Wasɛe me akwannuasa nyinaa so de awie me;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:10">watu mʼanidasoɔ ase te sɛ dua.<verse eid="JOB 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 19:11"/>Nʼabufuo huru tia me;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:11">na wakan me afra nʼatamfoɔ mu.<verse eid="JOB 19:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 19:12"/>Nʼakodɔm ba anibereɛ so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:12">wɔsisi mpie de tia me</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:12">na wɔtwa me ntomadan ho hyia.<verse eid="JOB 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 19:13"/>“Wayi me nuammarima afiri me ho;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:13">na mʼamanifoɔ nso, watwe wɔn ho koraa.<verse eid="JOB 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 19:14"/>Mʼabusuafoɔ kɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:14">na me nnamfonom werɛ afiri me.<verse eid="JOB 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 19:15"/>Mʼahɔhoɔ ne me mmaawa bu me sɛ ɔhɔhoɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:15">mete sɛ ɔnanani ma wɔn.<verse eid="JOB 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 19:16"/>Mefrɛ me ɔsomfoɔ, na ɔmmua;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:16">mpo, mete mʼano srɛ no.<verse eid="JOB 19:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 19:17"/>Me home bɔn me yere;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:17">me ho afono mʼankasa nuammarima.<verse eid="JOB 19:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 19:18"/>Mpo, mmarimmaa nkumaa bu me animtiaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:18">sɛ mepue a wɔdi me ho fɛw.<verse eid="JOB 19:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 19:19"/>Me nnamfo berɛboɔ kyiri me;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:19">mʼadɔfoɔ asɔre atia me.<verse eid="JOB 19:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 19:20"/>Maka honam ne nnompe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:20">na ɛkaa kakraa bi, anka merewu.<verse eid="JOB 19:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 19:21"/>“Monhunu me mmɔbɔ, me nnamfonom, monhunu mmɔbɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:21">na Onyankopɔn nsa abɔ me.<verse eid="JOB 19:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 19:22"/>Adɛn enti na motaa me so, sɛdeɛ Onyankopɔn yɛ no?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:22">Na mommfa me honam mu yea yi saa ara?<verse eid="JOB 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 19:23"/>“Ao, anka wɔmfa me nsɛm nhyɛ nwoma mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:23">anka wɔntwerɛ wɔ nwoma mmobɔeɛ so,<verse eid="JOB 19:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 19:24"/>anka wɔmfa dadeɛ twerɛdua nyiyi wɔ sumpii so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:24">anaa wɔnkrukyire wɔ abotan so afebɔɔ.<verse eid="JOB 19:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 19:25"/>Menim sɛ me odimafoɔ te ase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:25">na awieeɛ no ɔbɛsɔre agyina asase so.<verse eid="JOB 19:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 19:26"/>Na sɛ me wedeɛ wie sɛe a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:26">mede mʼani bɛhunu Onyankopɔn.<verse eid="JOB 19:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 19:27"/>Me ara mɛhunu no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:27">mede mʼani, na ɛnyɛ obi foforɔ ani, bɛhunu no.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:27">Mʼakoma ho pere no wɔ me mu.<verse eid="JOB 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 19:28"/>“Sɛ moka sɛ, ‘Yɛbɛteetee no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:28">ɛfiri sɛ ɔhaw no firi ɔno ara’ a,<verse eid="JOB 19:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 19:29"/>ɛsɛ sɛ mosuro akofena no.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:29">Abufuo nam akofena so de asotwe bɛba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:29">na mobɛhunu sɛ atemmuo wɔ hɔ.”<verse eid="JOB 19:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JOB 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Sofar Mmuaeɛ A Ɛtɔ So Mmienu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 20:1"/>Na Naamani Sofar buaa sɛ,<verse eid="JOB 20:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 20:2"/>“Me tiri mu ntene me, na ɛhyɛ me sɛ memmua</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:2">ɛfiri sɛ me ho yera me yie.<verse eid="JOB 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 20:3"/>Mate animka bi a ɛgu me ho fi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:3">na nteaseɛ a menya no hyɛ me sɛ memmua.<verse eid="JOB 20:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 20:4"/>“Ampa ara wonim sɛdeɛ nneɛma teɛ firi tete,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:4">ɛfiri ɛberɛ a wɔde nnipa duaa asase so,<verse eid="JOB 20:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 20:5"/>sɛ amumuyɛfoɔ ani gye ɛberɛ tiawa bi mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:5">na wɔn a wɔnnsuro nyame nso anigyeɛ nkyɛ.<verse eid="JOB 20:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 20:6"/>Ɛwom sɛ nʼahohoahoa kɔduru ɔsoro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:6">na ne tiri kɔpem omununkum deɛ,<verse eid="JOB 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 20:7"/>nanso, ɔbɛyera afebɔɔ te sɛ nʼankasa agyanan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:7">na wɔn a wɔhunuu no no bɛbisa sɛ, ‘Ɔwɔ he?’<verse eid="JOB 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 20:8"/>Ɔtu kɔ te sɛ daeɛ, na wɔrenhunu no bio.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:8">Wɔtwam kɔ te sɛ anadwo mu anisoadehunu.<verse eid="JOB 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 20:9"/>Ani a ɛhunu noɔ no renhunu no bio;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:9">na ne siberɛ nso renhunu no bio.<verse eid="JOB 20:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 20:10"/>Ne mma bɛsrɛ adeɛ afiri ahiafoɔ hɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:10">ɛsɛ sɛ nʼankasa de nʼahonya sane ma.<verse eid="JOB 20:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 20:11"/>Ne mmeranteberɛ mu ahoɔden a ahyɛ ne nnompe ma no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:11">ne no bɛkɔ mfuturo mu.<verse eid="JOB 20:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 20:12"/>“Ɛwom sɛ bɔne yɛ nʼanom dɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:12">na ɔde sie ne tɛkrɛma ase;<verse eid="JOB 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 20:13"/>ɛwom sɛ ɔntumi nnyaa mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:13">na ɔma ɛka ne dodom,<verse eid="JOB 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 20:14"/>nanso, nʼaduane bɛyɛ nwono wɔ ne yafunu mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:14">ɛbɛyɛ ɔtweaseɛ ano borɔ wɔ ne mu.<verse eid="JOB 20:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 20:15"/>Ɔbɛfe ahonyadeɛ a ɔmeneeɛ no;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:15">Onyankopɔn bɛma ne yafunu apu agu.<verse eid="JOB 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 20:16"/>Ɔbɛfefe awɔ borɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:16">Ɔnanka se bɛkum no.<verse eid="JOB 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 20:17"/>Ɔrennya nsuwansuwa no nnom</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:17">nsubɔntene a nufosuo ne ɛwoɔ sene wɔ mu no.<verse eid="JOB 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 20:18"/>Ɔbɛdane deɛ ɔbrɛ nyaeɛ no aba a ɔrenni bi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:18">ɔremfa nʼadwadie mu mfasoɔ nnye nʼani.<verse eid="JOB 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 20:19"/>Ɛfiri sɛ ɔhyɛɛ ahiafoɔ so ma wɔdii ohia buruburo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:19">ɔde ne nsa ato afie a ɛnyɛ ɔno na ɔsiiɛ so.<verse eid="JOB 20:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 20:20"/>“Ampa ara ɔrennya ahomegyeɛ mfiri deɛ wapere anya no mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:20">ɔrentumi mfa nʼakoradeɛ nnye ne ho nkwa.<verse eid="JOB 20:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 20:21"/>Wafom nneɛma nyinaa awie;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:21">ne nkɔsoɔ nnuru baabiara.<verse eid="JOB 20:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 20:22"/>Nʼadedodoɔ nyinaa mu no, ɔbɛkɔ ɔhaw mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:22">na amanehunu a emu yɛ den bɛto no.<verse eid="JOB 20:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 20:23"/>Ɛberɛ a nʼafuru ayɛ ma no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:23">Onyankopɔn bɛtɔ nʼabufuo ogya agu ne so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:23">na wabobɔ no basabasa.<verse eid="JOB 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 20:24"/>Ɛwom sɛ ɔdwane firi dadeɛ akodeɛ ano</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:24">nanso bɛmma a ano yɛ kɔbere mfrafraeɛ bɛwɔ no.<verse eid="JOB 20:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 20:25"/>Wɔbɛtwe bɛmma no firi nʼakyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:25">ano hyɛnhyɛn no bɛfiri ne brɛboɔ mu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:25">Ehu bɛba ne so;<verse eid="JOB 20:25"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 20:26"/>esum kabii bɛduru nʼakoradeɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:26">Ogya a wɔmfite mu bɛhye no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:26">na asɛe deɛ aka wɔ ne ntomadan mu.<verse eid="JOB 20:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 20:27"/>Ɔsoro bɛda nʼafɔdie adi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:27">na asase asɔre atia no.<verse eid="JOB 20:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 20:28"/>Nsuyire bɛtwe ne fie akɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:28">saa ara na nsuworosoɔ bɛyɛ Onyankopɔn abufuhyeɛ da no.<verse eid="JOB 20:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 20:29"/>Yei ne hyɛberɛ a Onyankopɔn de ma amumuyɛfoɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:29">awugyadeɛ a Onyankopɔn de ato wɔn hɔ.”<verse eid="JOB 20:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JOB 21"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 21:1"/>Na Hiob buaa sɛ,<verse eid="JOB 21:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 21:2"/>“Montie me nsɛm no yie.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:2">Momma yei nyɛ awerɛkyekyerɛ a mode ma me.<verse eid="JOB 21:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 21:3"/>Monnya ntoboaseɛ mma me ɛberɛ a merekasa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:3">na sɛ mekasa wie a, monkɔso nni fɛ.<verse eid="JOB 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 21:4"/>“Me nwiinwii hyɛ onipa anaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:4">Adɛn enti na ɛsɛ sɛ menya ntoboaseɛ?<verse eid="JOB 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 21:5"/>Monhwɛ me, na mo ho nnwiri mo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:5">momfa mo nsa nkata mo ano.<verse eid="JOB 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 21:6"/>Sɛ medwene yei ho a, mebɔ hu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:6">na me ho popo.<verse eid="JOB 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 21:7"/>Adɛn enti na amumuyɛfoɔ tena nkwa mu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:7">Wɔnyini kyɛ na wɔkɔ so di tumi.<verse eid="JOB 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 21:8"/>Wɔhunu wɔn mma a atwa wɔn ho ahyia no nkɔsoɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:8">wɔhunu wɔn nananom.<verse eid="JOB 21:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 21:9"/>Ɔhaw nni wɔn afie na ehu nni hɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:9">Onyankopɔn asotwe mma wɔn so.<verse eid="JOB 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 21:10"/>Wɔn anantwinini nyɛ akrawa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:10">na wɔn anantwibereɛ wo a, wɔmpɔn.<verse eid="JOB 21:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 21:11"/>Wɔka wɔn mma bɔ mu te sɛ nnwankuo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:11">na emu mmotafowa no hurihuri.<verse eid="JOB 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 21:12"/>Wɔto nnwom wɔ akasaeɛ ne sankuo so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:12">na wɔde atɛntɛbɛn nnyegyeeɛ gye wɔn ani.<verse eid="JOB 21:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 21:13"/>Wɔdi yie wɔn nkwanna mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:13">na wɔkɔ damena mu asomdwoeɛ mu.<verse eid="JOB 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 21:14"/>Nanso wɔka kyerɛ Onyankopɔn sɛ, ‘Firi yɛn so!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:14">Yɛmpɛ sɛ yɛhunu wʼakwan.<verse eid="JOB 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 21:15"/>Hwan ne otumfoɔ no a ɛsɛ sɛ yɛsom no?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:15">Sɛ yɛbɔ no mpaeɛ a mfasoɔ bɛn na yɛbɛnya?’<verse eid="JOB 21:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 21:16"/>Nanso, wɔn nkɔsoɔ no nni wɔn nsam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:16">enti metwe me ho firi amumuyɛfoɔ afutuo ho.<verse eid="JOB 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 21:17"/>“Nanso mpɛn ahe na wɔdum amumuyɛfoɔ kanea?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:17">Mpɛn ahe na amanehunu ba wɔn so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:17">deɛ Onyankopɔn firi nʼabufuo mu de ba no?<verse eid="JOB 21:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 21:18"/>Mpɛn ahe na wɔyɛ sɛ ɛserɛ wɔ mframa ano,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:18">te sɛ ntɛtɛ a mframa den bi apra wɔn?<verse eid="JOB 21:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 21:19"/>Wɔka sɛ, ‘Onyankopɔn kora onipa asotwe so de twɛn ne mma.’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:19">Ɛsɛ sɛ ɔtwe ɔnipa no ankasa aso ma ɔhunu.<verse eid="JOB 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 21:20"/>Ma wɔn ankasa ani nhunu wɔn sɛeɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:20">ma Otumfoɔ abufuhyeɛ no nka wɔn ani.<verse eid="JOB 21:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 21:21"/>Wɔn abusuafoɔ a wɔagya wɔn akyire no renya hwee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:21">nʼagyapadeɛ nyinaa bɛsɛe.<verse eid="JOB 21:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 21:22"/>“Obi bɛtumi akyerɛ Onyankopɔn nyansa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:22">wɔ ɛberɛ a ɔbu atitire mpo atɛn?<verse eid="JOB 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 21:23"/>Obi wu wɔ ɛberɛ a ɔwɔ ahoɔden;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:23">ne ho tɔ no na nʼaso mu adwo no,<verse eid="JOB 21:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 21:24"/>na ne onipadua yɛ frɔmm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:24">na ɛhon ahyɛ ne nnompe ma.<verse eid="JOB 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 21:25"/>Ɔfoforɔ nso de ɔkra mu yeadie wu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:25">a wanka asetena pa anhwɛ da.<verse eid="JOB 21:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 21:26"/>Wɔsie wɔn nyinaa wɔ mfuturo korɔ mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:26">ma asonson korɔ no ara nuka wɔn.<verse eid="JOB 21:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 21:27"/>“Mahunu mo adwene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:27">ɛkwan a mopɛ sɛ mobu me fɔ.<verse eid="JOB 21:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 21:28"/>Mopɛ sɛ moka kyerɛ me sɛdeɛ asikafoɔ ne amumuyɛfoɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:28">wɔn bɔne enti, wɔhwere wɔn agyapadeɛ nyinaa.<verse eid="JOB 21:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 21:29"/>Nanso mommisa wɔn a wɔtu kwan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:29">wɔbɛka akyerɛ mo sɛ<verse eid="JOB 21:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 21:30"/>onipa bɔne nya ne ti didi mu amanehunu da,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:30">na wɔgyaa no ma no dwane abufuhyeɛ da.<verse eid="JOB 21:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 21:31"/>Hwan na ɔtumi kasa nʼanim?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:31">Hwan na ɔtua no deɛ wayɛ so ka?<verse eid="JOB 21:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 21:32"/>Wɔsoa no kɔ damena mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:32">na wɔwɛn nʼaboda.<verse eid="JOB 21:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 21:33"/>Bɔnhwa mu dɔteɛ yɛ no dɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:33">nnipa nyinaa di nʼakyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:33">na ɛdɔm a wɔntumi nkan wɔn di nʼanim.<verse eid="JOB 21:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 21:34"/>“Enti ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na mode mo nsɛnhunu akyekyere me werɛ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:34">Mo mmuaeɛ nyɛ hwee sɛ atorɔ!”<verse eid="JOB 21:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="JOB 22"/>
  <para style="s1">Elifas Mmuaeɛ A Ɛtɔ So Mmiɛnsa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 22:1"/>Na Temanni Elifas buaa sɛ,<verse eid="JOB 22:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 22:2"/>“Onyankopɔn bɛnya onipa ho mfasoɔ anaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:2">Mpo onyansafoɔ ho bɛba no mfasoɔ anaa?<verse eid="JOB 22:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 22:3"/>Sɛ woyɛ ɔteneneeni a, anigyeɛ bɛn na Otumfoɔ no bɛnya?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:3">Sɛ wʼakwan ho nni asɛm a, mfasoɔ bɛn na ɔbɛnya?<verse eid="JOB 22:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 22:4"/>“Wo kronnyɛ enti na ɔka wʼanim</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:4">na ɔbɔ wo kwaadu anaa?<verse eid="JOB 22:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 22:5"/>Ɛnyɛ wʼamumuyɛ na ɛsoɔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:5">Ɛnyɛ wo bɔne na ɛdɔɔso dodo?<verse eid="JOB 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 22:6"/>Wopɛɛ banbɔ firii wo nuanom nkyɛn a ɛnni nteaseɛ biara;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:6">wopaa nnipa ho ntoma ma wɔdaa adagya.<verse eid="JOB 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 22:7"/>Woamma abrɛfoɔ nsuo annom</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:7">na woamfa aduane amma deɛ ɛkɔm de no.<verse eid="JOB 22:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 22:8"/>Nanso na woyɛ obi a ɔwɔ tumi, na ɔwɔ nsase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:8">onimuonyamfoɔ a ɔte so.<verse eid="JOB 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 22:9"/>Wopamoo akunafoɔ ma wɔkɔɔ nsapan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:9">na womaa nwisiaa nso ahoɔden saeɛ.<verse eid="JOB 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 22:10"/>Ɛno enti na mfidie atwa wo ho ahyia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:10">na amanehunu a ɛba ntɛm so abɔ wo hu yi,<verse eid="JOB 22:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 22:11"/>adɛn enti na esum aduru a wonhunu adeɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:11">na asorɔkye akata wo so.<verse eid="JOB 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 22:12"/>“Onyankopɔn nni ɔsoro akyirikyiri?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:12">Hwɛ sɛdeɛ ɔsoro akyirikyiri nsoromma korɔn!<verse eid="JOB 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 22:13"/>Nanso woka sɛ, ‘Ɛdeɛn na Onyankopɔn nim?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:13">Esum yi mu na ɔbu atɛn anaa?<verse eid="JOB 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 22:14"/>Omununkum kabii akata nʼanim enti ɔnhunu yɛn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:14">ɛberɛ a ɔnenam ɔsoro kɔntɔnkurowi mu.’<verse eid="JOB 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 22:15"/>Wobɛkɔ so afa ɛkwan dada a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:15">abɔnefoɔ anante soɔ no so?<verse eid="JOB 22:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 22:16"/>Wɔpraa wɔn kɔɔeɛ ansa na wɔn berɛ reso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:16">na nsuyire hohoroo wɔn fapem.<verse eid="JOB 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 22:17"/>Na wɔka kyerɛɛ Onyankopɔn sɛ, ‘Gyaa yɛn!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:17">Ɛdeɛn na Otumfoɔ bɛtumi ayɛ yɛn?’<verse eid="JOB 22:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 22:18"/>Nanso, ɛyɛ ɔno na ɔde nnepa hyɛɛ wɔn afie mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:18">enti metwe me ho mefiri amumuyɛfoɔ afutuo ho.<verse eid="JOB 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 22:19"/>Teneneefoɔ hunu wɔn asehweɛ ma wɔn ani gye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:19">na wɔn a wɔn ho nni asɛm sere wɔn ka sɛ,<verse eid="JOB 22:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 22:20"/>‘Wɔasɛe yɛn atamfoɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:20">na ogya ahye wɔn agyapadeɛ.’<verse eid="JOB 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 22:21"/>“Fa wo ho ma Onyankopɔn na nya asomdwoeɛ wɔ ne mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:21">saa ɛkwan yi so na yiedie bɛyɛ wo kyɛfa.<verse eid="JOB 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 22:22"/>Tie akwankyerɛ a ɛfiri nʼanom,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:22">na fa ne nsɛm sie wʼakoma mu.<verse eid="JOB 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 22:23"/>Sɛ wosane kɔ Otumfoɔ no nkyɛn a, ɔbɛgye wo atom bio:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:23">sɛ woyi amumuyɛsɛm firi wo ntomadan mu<verse eid="JOB 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 22:24"/>na woto wo sika mpɔ gu mfuturo mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:24">ne Ofir sikakɔkɔɔ gu abotan a ɛwɔ abɔn mu no so a,<verse eid="JOB 22:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 22:25"/>ɛnneɛ Otumfoɔ bɛyɛ wo sikakɔkɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:25">ɔbɛyɛ dwetɛ amapa ama wo.<verse eid="JOB 22:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 22:26"/>Afei nokorɛm wobɛnya anigyeɛ wɔ Otumfoɔ mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:26">na wobɛpagya wʼani akyerɛ Onyankopɔn.<verse eid="JOB 22:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 22:27"/>Wobɛbɔ no mpaeɛ, na ɔbɛtie wo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:27">na wobɛdi wo bɔhyɛ so.<verse eid="JOB 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 22:28"/>Deɛ woyɛ wʼadwene sɛ wobɛyɛ no bɛba mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:28">na hann bɛtɔ wʼakwan so.<verse eid="JOB 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 22:29"/>Sɛ nnipa hwe ase na woka sɛ, ‘Ma wɔn so!’ a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:29">ɔbɛgye wɔn a wɔahwe ase no nkwa.<verse eid="JOB 22:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 22:30"/>Ɔbɛgye abɔnefoɔ mpo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:30">ɔnam wo nsa a ɛho nni fi so bɛgye wɔn.”<verse eid="JOB 22:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="JOB 23"/>
  <para style="s1">Hiob Mmuaeɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 23:1"/>Na Hiob buaa sɛ,<verse eid="JOB 23:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 23:2"/>“Ɛnnɛ mpo, mʼabooboodie mu da so yɛ den;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:2">ne nsa ayɛ den mʼapinisie nyinaa akyi.<verse eid="JOB 23:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 23:3"/>Sɛ menim baabi a mɛhunu no;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:3">anaasɛ mɛtumi akɔ ne tenaberɛ a,<verse eid="JOB 23:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 23:4"/>anka mɛka mʼasɛm wɔ nʼanim</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:4">na magye akyinnyeɛ bebree.<verse eid="JOB 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 23:5"/>Anka mɛte mmuaeɛ a ɔde bɛma me,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 23:5">na madwene deɛ ɔbɛka ho.<verse eid="JOB 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 23:6"/>Ɔde tumi a ɛso bɛtia me anaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:6">Dabi, ɔremmɔ me kwaadu.<verse eid="JOB 23:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 23:7"/>Ɛhɔ deɛ nnipa tenenee bɛtumi aka nʼasɛm wɔ nʼanim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:7">na wɔbɛgye me afiri me ɔtemmufoɔ nsam afebɔɔ.<verse eid="JOB 23:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 23:8"/>“Nanso sɛ mekɔ apueeɛ fam a, ɔnni hɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:8">sɛ mekɔ atɔeɛ fam nso a, menhunu no.<verse eid="JOB 23:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 23:9"/>Sɛ ɔreyɛ adwuma wɔ atifi fam a, menhunu no;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:9">sɛ ɔdane ne ho kɔ anafoɔ fam a, mʼani nhye ne ho.<verse eid="JOB 23:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 23:10"/>Nanso, ɔnim ɛkwan a me nam soɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:10">na sɛ ɔsɔ me hwɛ a, mɛfiri mu aba sɛ sikakɔkɔɔ.<verse eid="JOB 23:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 23:11"/>Madi nʼanammɔn akyi pɛɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:11">na manante nʼakwan so a mammane.<verse eid="JOB 23:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 23:12"/>Mentwee me ho mfirii mmaransɛm a ɛfiri nʼanom ho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:12">mama asɛm a ɛfiri nʼanom ho ahia me asene me daa aduane.<verse eid="JOB 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 23:13"/>“Nanso ɔbiara nni hɔ ka ne ho, na hwan na ɔbɛtumi atia no?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:13">Ɔyɛ biribiara a ɔpɛ.<verse eid="JOB 23:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 23:14"/>Ɔhwɛ ma ne ɔhyɛ nsɛm tia me;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:14">ɔda so kora nhyehyɛeɛ a ɛte sei bebree.<verse eid="JOB 23:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 23:15"/>Ɛno enti na mebɔ hu wɔ nʼanim;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:15">na sɛ medwene yeinom nyinaa ho a, mesuro no.<verse eid="JOB 23:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 23:16"/>Onyankopɔn ama mʼakoma aboto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:16">Otumfoɔ ama mabɔ huboa.<verse eid="JOB 23:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 23:17"/>Nanso esum no mma menka mʼano ntom,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:17">esum kabii a ɛkata mʼanim no mpo.<verse eid="JOB 23:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="JOB 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="JOB 24"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 24:1"/>“Adɛn enti na Onyankopɔn nhyɛ berɛ mma atemmuo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:1">Adɛn enti na ɛsɛ sɛ wɔn a wɔnim noɔ no hwɛ saa da no anim ɛnso ɛmma da?<verse eid="JOB 24:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 24:2"/>Nnipa yiyi aboɔ a wɔde ato hyeɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:2">na wɔde nnwankuo a wɔawia kɔ hɔ adidi.<verse eid="JOB 24:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 24:3"/>Wɔpam nwisiaa mfunumu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:3">na wɔgye akunafoɔ anantwie sɛ awowasideɛ.<verse eid="JOB 24:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 24:4"/>Wɔsum ahiafoɔ firi ɛkwan so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:4">na wɔhyɛ asase no so ahiafoɔ ma wɔkɔtetɛ.<verse eid="JOB 24:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 24:5"/>Ahiafoɔ no yɛ wɔn adwuma pɛ aduane</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:5">te sɛ ɛserɛ so mfunumu no;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:5">asase wesee no so na wɔnya aduane ma wɔn mma.<verse eid="JOB 24:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 24:6"/>Wɔboaboa mmoa aduane ano wɔ mfuo no so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:6">na wɔdi mpɛpɛ wɔ amumuyɛfoɔ bobe nturo mu.<verse eid="JOB 24:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 24:7"/>Wɔnni ntoma, na wɔda kwaterekwa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:7">wɔnni hwee a wɔde kata wɔn ho wɔ awɔ mu.<verse eid="JOB 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 24:8"/>Mmepɔ so osutɔ fɔ wɔn twɔnn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:8">na wɔfomfam mmotan no ho ɛfiri sɛ wɔnni ahatasoɔ.<verse eid="JOB 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 24:9"/>Wɔte awisiaa firi nufoɔ ano;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:9">na wɔfa ohiani abotafoa de si ne ka anan mu.<verse eid="JOB 24:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 24:10"/>Wɔnenam adagya a wɔnni ntoma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:10">wɔsoa ayuo afiafi, nanso ɛkɔm de wɔn ara.<verse eid="JOB 24:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 24:11"/>Wɔkyi ngo wɔn adan mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:11">wɔtiatia nsakyimena mu, nanso osukɔm de wɔn.<verse eid="JOB 24:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 24:12"/>Wɔn a wɔrewuwuo no apinisie firi kuropɔn no mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:12">na apirafoɔ kra su pɛ mmoa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:12">Nanso Onyankopɔn mfa bɔne nto obiara so.<verse eid="JOB 24:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 24:13"/>“Ebinom wɔ hɔ a wɔsɔre tia hann no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:13">wɔn a wɔnnim nʼakwan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:13">anaasɛ wɔnnante nʼatempɔn so.<verse eid="JOB 24:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 24:14"/>Sɛ adekyeɛ hann no kɔ a, owudifoɔ no sɔre</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:14">na ɔkum ohiani ne mmɔborɔni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:14">adesaeɛ mu, ɔwiawia ne ho sɛ ɔkorɔmfoɔ.<verse eid="JOB 24:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 24:15"/>Ɔwaresɛefoɔ twɛn ɛberɛ a adeɛ resa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:15">ɔka sɛ, ‘obiara renhunu me,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:15">na ɔde nʼanim hinta.<verse eid="JOB 24:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 24:16"/>Esum mu na nnipa bubu apono wura afie mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:16">na awiaberɛ mu no, wɔtoto wɔn ho ɛpono mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:16">wɔne hann nni hwee yɛ.<verse eid="JOB 24:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 24:17"/>Esum kabii yɛ adekyeɛ ma wɔn nyinaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:17">wɔne esum mu nneɛma a ɛyɛ hu fa nnamfo.<verse eid="JOB 24:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 24:18"/>“Nanso wɔte sɛ ahuro a ɛtɛ nsuo ani;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:18">wɔadome wɔn kyɛfa wɔ asase no so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:18">enti obiara nnkɔ bobe nturo no mu.<verse eid="JOB 24:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 24:19"/>Sɛdeɛ ɔhyew ne ɔpɛ de sukyerɛmma a anane korɔ no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:19">saa ara na damena de wɔn a wɔayɛ bɔne korɔ.<verse eid="JOB 24:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 24:20"/>Awotwaa werɛ firi wɔn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:20">na ɔsonsono di wɔn nam;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:20">nnipa bɔne deɛ, wɔnnkae wɔn bio</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:20">na mmom wɔbubu te sɛ dua.<verse eid="JOB 24:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 24:21"/>Wɔde ɔbaa bonini a ɔnni ba yɛ haboa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:21">na wɔnhunu akunafoɔ mmɔbɔ.<verse eid="JOB 24:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 24:22"/>Onyankopɔn nam ne tumi so twe atumfoɔ kɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:22">ɛwom sɛ wɔnya asetena pa deɛ, nanso wɔnni nkwa ho bɔhyɛ.<verse eid="JOB 24:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 24:23"/>Ɔtumi ma wɔn tena ase asomdwoeɛ mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:23">nanso nʼani wɔ wɔn akwan so.<verse eid="JOB 24:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 24:24"/>Wɔma wɔn so berɛ tiawa bi, na afei wɔnni hɔ bio;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:24">wɔbrɛ wɔn ase boaboa wɔn ano sɛ nnipa nyinaa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:24">wɔtwitwa wɔn gu te sɛ aburoo ti.<verse eid="JOB 24:24"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 24:25"/>“Sɛ yei nte saa a, hwan na ɔbɛtumi agye me akyinnyeɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:25">na ama deɛ maka ayɛ nsɛnhunu?”<verse eid="JOB 24:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="JOB 25"/>
  <para style="s1">Bildad Mmuaeɛ A Ɛtɔ So Mmiɛnsa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 25:1"/>Na Suhini Bildad buaa sɛ,<verse eid="JOB 25:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 25:2"/>“Tumi ne suro wɔ Onyankopɔn;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:2">ɔno na ɔhyehyɛ pɛpɛyɛ wɔ ɔsorosoro.<verse eid="JOB 25:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 25:3"/>Wɔbɛtumi akan nʼakodɔm anaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:3">Hwan na ne hann nto ngu ne soɔ?<verse eid="JOB 25:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 25:4"/>Ɔdasani bɛtene Onyankopɔn anim sɛn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:4">na ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na deɛ ɔbaa awo no ho bɛteɛ?<verse eid="JOB 25:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 25:5"/>Mpo sɛ ɔsrane nhyerɛn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:5">na nsoromma ho nte wɔ nʼani so a,<verse eid="JOB 25:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 25:6"/>na nkantom onipa a ɔte sɛ nsaama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:6">onipa ba a ɔyɛ ɔsonsono kɛkɛ!”<verse eid="JOB 25:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="JOB 26"/>
  <para style="s1">Hiob Kyerɛ Onyankopɔn Kɛseyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 26:1"/>Na Hiob kasaa bio sɛ,<verse eid="JOB 26:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 26:2"/>“Woaboa deɛ ɔnni tumi!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:2">Woagye basa a ɛnni ahoɔden!<verse eid="JOB 26:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 26:3"/>Woatu deɛ ɔnnim nyansa fo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:3">Na woada nhunumu pa ara adi!<verse eid="JOB 26:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 26:4"/>Hwan na ɔboaa wo ma wokaa saa nsɛm yi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:4">Hwan honhom na ɛkasa faa wo mu?<verse eid="JOB 26:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 26:5"/>“Awufoɔ wɔ ahoyera kɛseɛ mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:5">wɔn a wɔwɔ nsuo ase ne deɛ ɛte mu nyinaa.<verse eid="JOB 26:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 26:6"/>Asamando da adagya Onyankopɔn anim;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:6">Ɔsɛeɛ nso nni nkatasoɔ.<verse eid="JOB 26:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 26:7"/>Ɔtrɛ atifi fam ewiem wɔ deɛ ɛda mpan so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:7">na ɔde asase sensɛn ohunu so.<verse eid="JOB 26:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 26:8"/>Ɔkyekyere nsuo hyɛ ne omununkum mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:8">nanso nsuo no mu duru ntumi mpae no.<verse eid="JOB 26:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 26:9"/>Ɔtrɛ ne omununkum mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:9">de kata ɔsrane ani.<verse eid="JOB 26:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 26:10"/>Ɔhyɛ agyiraeɛ wɔ nsuo so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:10">de to hyeɛ wɔ hann ne esum ntam.<verse eid="JOB 26:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 26:11"/>Ɔsoro nnyinasoɔ woso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:11">na nʼanimka ma wɔn ho dwiri wɔn.<verse eid="JOB 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 26:12"/>Ɔde ne tumi wɔsoo ɛpo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:12">ne nyansa mu, ɔtwitwaa ɛpobɔpɔn mu asinasini.<verse eid="JOB 26:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 26:13"/>Ɔde nʼahomeɛ maa ewiem teeɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:13">na ne nsa wɔɔ ɔtweaseɛ a ɔrewea.<verse eid="JOB 26:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 26:14"/>Yeinom yɛ ne nnwuma mfeafeaho;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:14">ɔka asomusɛm brɛoo kyerɛ yɛn!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:14">Na hwan na ɔbɛtumi ate ne tumi mmobɔmu no ase.”<verse eid="JOB 26:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="JOB 27"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 27:1"/>Hiob toaa nʼasɛm so sɛ,<verse eid="JOB 27:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 27:2"/>“Sɛ Onyankopɔn te ase yi, ɔno a wammu me atɛntenenee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:2">Otumfoɔ a wama madi me kra mu awerɛhoɔ;<verse eid="JOB 27:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 27:3"/>mmerɛ dodoɔ a nkwa wɔ me mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:3">na Onyankopɔn homeɛ wɔ me mu yi,<verse eid="JOB 27:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 27:4"/>mʼano renka amumuyɛsɛm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:4">na me tɛkrɛma rentwa nkontompo.<verse eid="JOB 27:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 27:5"/>Merennye nto mu da sɛ deɛ woka no yɛ nokorɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:5">merenka me mudie nhyɛ, kɔsi sɛ mɛwuo.<verse eid="JOB 27:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 27:6"/>Mɛkura me tenenee mu. Merennyaa mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:6">sɛ mete ase yi, me tiboa remmu me fɔ.<verse eid="JOB 27:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 27:7"/>“Ma mʼatamfoɔ nyɛ sɛ amumuyɛfoɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:7">na wɔn a wɔkyiri me nyɛ sɛ atorofoɔ.<verse eid="JOB 27:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 27:8"/>Anidasoɔ bɛn na deɛ ɔnni nyamesu no wɔ wɔ ne wuo akyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:8">ɛberɛ a Onyankopɔn agye ne nkwa afiri ne nsam?<verse eid="JOB 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 27:9"/>Onyankopɔn tie ne sufrɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:9">ɛberɛ a amanehunu aba ne so anaa?<verse eid="JOB 27:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 27:10"/>Nʼani bɛgye wɔ Otumfoɔ mu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:10">Ɔbɛsu afrɛ Onyankopɔn ɛberɛ biara anaa?<verse eid="JOB 27:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 27:11"/>“Mɛma mo Onyankopɔn tumi ho nkyerɛkyerɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:11">meremfa Otumfoɔ no akwan nhinta.<verse eid="JOB 27:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 27:12"/>Mo ankasa moahunu yeinom nyinaa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:12">Afei nsɛnhunu yi ase ne sɛn?<verse eid="JOB 27:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 27:13"/>“Yei ne deɛ Onyankopɔn ahyɛ ato hɔ ama omumuyɛfoɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:13">agyapadeɛ a otirimuɔdenfoɔ nya firi Otumfoɔ nkyɛn:<verse eid="JOB 27:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 27:14"/>Sɛ ɔwɔ mma dodoɔ sɛn ara, wɔn hyɛberɛ ne akofena;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:14">na nʼasefoɔ rennidi mmee da.<verse eid="JOB 27:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 27:15"/>Ɔyaredɔm bɛsie wɔn a wɔbɛka wɔ nʼakyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:15">na wɔn akunafoɔ rensu wɔn.<verse eid="JOB 27:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 27:16"/>Ɛwom sɛ ɔhɔre dwetɛ te sɛ mfuturo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:16">na ɔboa ntoma ano sɛ dɔteɛ deɛ,<verse eid="JOB 27:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 27:17"/>nanso deɛ ɔpɛ gu hɔ no, ateneneefoɔ na wɔbɛfira</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:17">na pɛpɛfoɔ no nso akyekyɛ dwetɛ no.<verse eid="JOB 27:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 27:18"/>Efie a ɔsi no te sɛ ananse afafa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:18">ɛte sɛ pata bi a ɔwɛmfoɔ abɔ.<verse eid="JOB 27:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 27:19"/>Ɔda hɔ te sɛ ɔdefoɔ, nanso ɔrenna saa bio;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:19">ɔbɛte nʼani no na ne nyinaa atu ayera.<verse eid="JOB 27:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 27:20"/>Ahunahuna ba ne so sɛ nsuyire;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:20">ahum hwim no kɔ anadwo.<verse eid="JOB 27:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 27:21"/>Apueeɛ mframa soa no kɔ, na ɔnni hɔ bio;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:21">ɛtwe no firi ne teberɛ.<verse eid="JOB 27:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 27:22"/>Ɛbɔ no a ahummɔborɔ nni mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:22">ɛberɛ a ɔredwane afiri ne tumi ase.<verse eid="JOB 27:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 27:23"/>Ɔde fɛ bɔ ne nsam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:23">na ɔpamoo no firi ne teberɛ.”<verse eid="JOB 27:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="JOB 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="JOB 28"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 28:1"/>Ɛwɔ deɛ wɔtu dwetɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:1">ne beaeɛ a wɔhoa sika kɔkɔɔ ho.<verse eid="JOB 28:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 28:2"/>Wɔtu dadeɛ firi fam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:2">na wɔnane kɔbere firi dadeben mu.<verse eid="JOB 28:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 28:3"/>Onipa ma esum ba awieeɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:3">na ɔhwehwɛ kɔ akyirikyiri asase mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:3">kɔpɛ dadeben wɔ esum kabii mu.<verse eid="JOB 28:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 28:4"/>Baabi a ɛne deɛ ɔdasani teɛ ntam ɛkwan ware no, ɔtu amena de fagudeɛtuo afidie hyɛ hɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:4">mmeammea a onipa nan sii hɔ akyɛre</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:4">baabi a ɛmmɛn nnipa no, ɛhɔ na ɔdi aforosiane.<verse eid="JOB 28:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 28:5"/>Asase a ɛbɔ aduane no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:5">wɔnane aseɛ no te sɛ deɛ wɔde ogya na ayɛ;<verse eid="JOB 28:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 28:6"/>aboɔdemmoɔ firi nʼabotan mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:6">na sikakɔkɔɔ mpɔ nso wɔ ne mfuturo mu.<verse eid="JOB 28:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 28:7"/>Ɔkɔdeɛ biara nnim saa kwan a ahinta no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:7">akorɔma biara ani nhunuiɛ.<verse eid="JOB 28:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 28:8"/>Mmoa ahantanfoɔ nnante wɔ hɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:8">na agyata nkɔdɛɛdɛɛ wɔ hɔ.<verse eid="JOB 28:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 28:9"/>Onipa nsa paapae abotan denden</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:9">na ɔma mmepɔ ase da hɔ.<verse eid="JOB 28:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 28:10"/>Ɔtwa aka fa abotan mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:10">na ɔhunu nʼademudeɛ nyinaa.<verse eid="JOB 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 28:11"/>Ɔhwehwɛ baabi a nsubɔntene ti wɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:11">na ɔda nneɛma a ahinta adi.<verse eid="JOB 28:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 28:12"/>Nanso ɛhe na yɛbɛhunu deɛ nyansa hyɛ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:12">Ɛhe na nteaseɛ teɛ?<verse eid="JOB 28:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 28:13"/>Onipa renhunu ne bo a ɛsom;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:13">wɔrenhunu wɔ ateasefoɔ asase so.<verse eid="JOB 28:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 28:14"/>Na ebunu ka sɛ, “Ɛnni me mu”;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:14">na ɛpo nso sɛ, “Ɛnni me nkyɛn.”<verse eid="JOB 28:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 28:15"/>Wɔrentumi mfa sikakɔkɔɔ amapa ntɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:15">na wɔrentumi mfa dwetɛ nkari ne boɔ.<verse eid="JOB 28:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 28:16"/>Wɔrentumi mfa Ofir sikakɔkɔɔ ntɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:16">apopobibirieboɔ anaa aboɔdemmoɔ nso saa ara.<verse eid="JOB 28:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 28:17"/>Wɔrentumi mfa ahwehwɛ anaa sikakɔkɔɔ ntoto ho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:17">na wɔrentumi mfa sikakɔkɔɔ nnwinneɛ nsesa.<verse eid="JOB 28:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 28:18"/>Ɛnsɛ sɛ yɛbɔ ahwene panin ne ahwehwɛboɔ din;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:18">nyansa boɔ sene nhwene pa.<verse eid="JOB 28:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 28:19"/>Etiopia akarateboɔ ne no nsɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:19">wɔrentumi mfa sikakɔkɔɔ kronn ntɔ.<verse eid="JOB 28:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 28:20"/>Ɛnneɛ na ɛhe na nyansa firie?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:20">Ɛhe na nteaseɛ teɛ?<verse eid="JOB 28:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 28:21"/>Wɔde asie abɔdeɛ biara ani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:21">wɔde asie ewiem nnomaa mpo.<verse eid="JOB 28:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 28:22"/>Ɔsɛeɛ ne Owuo ka sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:22">“Yɛate no huhuhuhu kɛkɛ.”<verse eid="JOB 28:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 28:23"/>Onyankopɔn te ɛkwan a ɛkɔ hɔ ase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:23">na ɔno nko ara na ɔnim baabi a ɛteɛ,<verse eid="JOB 28:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 28:24"/>ɛfiri sɛ ɔhwɛ kɔduru nsase ano</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:24">na ɔhunu biribiara a ɛwɔ ɔsoro ase.<verse eid="JOB 28:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 28:25"/>Ɛberɛ a ɔhyɛɛ mframa ano den too hɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:25">na ɔsusuu nsuwa no,<verse eid="JOB 28:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 28:26"/>ɛberɛ a ɔkaa no ɔhyɛ so kyerɛɛ osutɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:26">na ɔtwaa ɛkwan maa aprannaa no,<verse eid="JOB 28:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 28:27"/>afei ɔhwɛɛ nyansa na ɔkarii no hwɛeɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:27">na ɔgyee no too mu na ɔsɔɔ no hwɛeɛ.<verse eid="JOB 28:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 28:28"/>Na ɔka kyerɛɛ onipa sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:28">“<char style="nd">Awurade</char> suro, ɛno ne nyansa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:28">na sɛ wɔkyiri bɔne a, wowɔ nteaseɛ.”<verse eid="JOB 28:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 28"/>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="JOB 29"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 29:1"/>Hiob toaa so sɛ,<verse eid="JOB 29:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 29:2"/>“Mafe abosome a atwam no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:2">nna a Onyankopɔn hwɛɛ me soɔ no,<verse eid="JOB 29:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 29:3"/>ɛberɛ a ne kanea hyerɛn mʼatifi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:3">na mede ne kanea menantee esum mu no!<verse eid="JOB 29:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 29:4"/>Ao, ɛnna a mesii soɔ no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:4">ɛberɛ a Onyankopɔn adamfofa a emu yɛ den hyiraa me fie,<verse eid="JOB 29:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 29:5"/>ɛberɛ a na Otumfoɔ da so ka me ho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:5">na me mma atwa me ho ahyia,<verse eid="JOB 29:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 29:6"/>ɛberɛ a na nufosuo mu sradeɛ afɔ mʼakwan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:6">na abotan hwiee ngo sɛ nsuo maa me.<verse eid="JOB 29:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 29:7"/>“Ɛberɛ a na mekɔ kuropɔn ɛpono ano</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:7">mekɔtena mʼadwa so wɔ ɔmanfoɔ adwaberem,<verse eid="JOB 29:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 29:8"/>mmeranteɛ hunu me a, wɔgyina nkyɛn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:8">na mpanimfoɔ sɔre gyina hɔ;<verse eid="JOB 29:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 29:9"/>atitire gyae kasa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:9">na wɔde wɔn nsa kata wɔn ano;<verse eid="JOB 29:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 29:10"/>mmapɔmma tɛm dinn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:10">na wɔn tɛkrɛma ka wɔn dodom.<verse eid="JOB 29:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 29:11"/>Wɔn a wɔte me nka nyinaa ka me ho asɛmpa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:11">na wɔn a wɔhunu me nyinaa kamfo me,<verse eid="JOB 29:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 29:12"/>ɛfiri sɛ, meboaa ahiafoɔ a wɔsu pɛɛ mmoa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:12">ne nwisiaa a wɔnni aboafoɔ.<verse eid="JOB 29:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 29:13"/>Onipa a na ɔrewuo no hyiraa me;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:13">na memaa akunafoɔ ani gyee wɔn akoma mu.<verse eid="JOB 29:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 29:14"/>Mede tenenee firaa sɛ mʼaduradeɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:14">atɛntenenee yɛɛ me nkatasoɔ ne mʼabotire.<verse eid="JOB 29:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 29:15"/>Meyɛɛ aniwa maa anifirafoɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:15">ne ɛnan maa abubuafoɔ.<verse eid="JOB 29:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 29:16"/>Meyɛɛ ahiafoɔ agya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:16">na mekaa ahɔhoɔ asɛm maa wɔn.<verse eid="JOB 29:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 29:17"/>Mebubuu amumuyɛfoɔ se</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:17">na mehwim wɔn a wɔdi wɔn nya no firii wɔn anom.<verse eid="JOB 29:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 29:18"/>“Medwenee sɛ, ‘Mɛwu wɔ mʼankasa me fie mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:18">na me nna adɔɔso sɛ anwea.<verse eid="JOB 29:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 29:19"/>Me nhini bɛduru nsuo ano,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:19">na obosuo agugu me mman so anadwo mu nyinaa.<verse eid="JOB 29:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 29:20"/>Mʼanimuonyam bɛkɔ so ayɛ frɔmm wɔ me so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:20">na mʼahoɔden ayɛ foforɔ.’<verse eid="JOB 29:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 29:21"/>“Nnipa hwehwɛɛ sɛ wɔtie me,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:21">wɔyɛɛ dinn, twɛnee mʼafotuo.<verse eid="JOB 29:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 29:22"/>Sɛ mekasa wie a wɔnnkasa bio,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:22">ɛfiri sɛ me nsɛm tɔɔ wɔn asom yie.<verse eid="JOB 29:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 29:23"/>Wɔtwɛnee me sɛdeɛ wɔtwɛne osutɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:23">na wɔmenee me nsɛm sɛ osutɔ berɛ nsuo.<verse eid="JOB 29:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 29:24"/>Wɔn abasa mu buiɛ no, mesere kyerɛɛ wɔn;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:24">mʼanimteɛ som bo ma wɔn.<verse eid="JOB 29:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 29:25"/>Mebɔɔ ɛkwan maa wɔn na metenaa ase sɛ wɔn ɔhene;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:25">metenaa ase sɛ ɔhene a ɔwɔ nʼakodɔm mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:25">meyɛɛ sɛ obi a ɔkyekyere agyaadwotwafoɔ werɛ.<verse eid="JOB 29:25"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="JOB 29"/>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="JOB 30"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 30:1"/>“Nanso seesei wɔsere me,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:1">nnipa a manyini sene wɔn,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:1">na wɔn agyanom mfata sɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:1">wɔne me nnwan ho nkraman tena.<verse eid="JOB 30:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 30:2"/>Mfasoɔ bɛn na wɔn nsa mu ahoɔden wɔ ma me,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:2">ɛberɛ a wɔn ahoɔden afiri wɔn mu?<verse eid="JOB 30:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 30:3"/>Ohia ne ɛkɔm ama wɔn ho atete,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:3">wɔnante asase wesee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:3">ne asase bonini so anadwo.<verse eid="JOB 30:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 30:4"/>Wɔboaboaa nkyenhahan ano wɔ nkyɛkyerɛ mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:4">na wɔde ɛserɛ so nnua nhini yɛɛ wɔn aduane.<verse eid="JOB 30:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 30:5"/>Wɔn mfɛfoɔ pamoo wɔn firii wɔn mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:5">na wɔhuroo wɔn sɛ akorɔmfoɔ.<verse eid="JOB 30:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 30:6"/>Wɔhyɛɛ wɔn ma wɔtenaa nsuka a emu awo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:6">abotan ne ɛfam ntokuro mu.<verse eid="JOB 30:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 30:7"/>Wɔsuu sɛ mfunumu wɔ wiram</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:7">na wɔfoforee so wɔ ɔdɔtɔ ase.<verse eid="JOB 30:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 30:8"/>Ekuo a wɔmfra na wɔnni din,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:8">wɔpam wɔn firii asase no so.<verse eid="JOB 30:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 30:9"/>“Na ɛnnɛ yi wɔn mmammarima de dwom bɔ me akutia;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:9">mayɛ abusudeɛ wɔ wɔn mu.<verse eid="JOB 30:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 30:10"/>Wɔkyiri me na wɔnnka mma me ho;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:10">wɔmmfɛre sɛ wɔtete ntasuo gu mʼanim.<verse eid="JOB 30:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 30:11"/>Afei a Onyankopɔn abubu me tadua na ɔde amanehunu aba me so yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:11">wɔyɛ deɛ wɔpɛ wɔ mʼanim.<verse eid="JOB 30:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 30:12"/>Abusuakuo no to hyɛ me so wɔ me nifa so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:12">wɔsum me nan mfidie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:12">na wɔsisi apie tia me.<verse eid="JOB 30:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 30:13"/>Wɔsisi mʼakwan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:13">na wɔnya me sɛe me</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:13">na obiara mmoa me.<verse eid="JOB 30:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 30:14"/>Wɔba te sɛ deɛ wɔfiri ntokuro a ano abae mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:14">wɔnam mmubuiɛ no mu munimuni ba.<verse eid="JOB 30:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 30:15"/>Ahunahuna ma me ho dwiri me;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:15">mʼanimuonyam atu kɔ sɛdeɛ mframa abɔ agu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:15">me banbɔ atu ayera sɛ omununkum.<verse eid="JOB 30:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 30:16"/>“Na seesei, me nkwa resa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:16">na amanehunu nna akyekyere me.<verse eid="JOB 30:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 30:17"/>Anadwo wowɔ me nnompe mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:17">ɔyea a ɛwe me no nnyae.<verse eid="JOB 30:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 30:18"/>Onyankopɔn firi ne tumi mu yɛ sɛ aduradeɛ ma me;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:18">ɔmia me te sɛ mʼatadeɛ kɔn.<verse eid="JOB 30:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 30:19"/>Ɔto me twene atɛkyɛ mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:19">na ɔma me yɛ sɛ mfuturo ne nsõ.<verse eid="JOB 30:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 30:20"/>“Ao Onyankopɔn, mesu mefrɛ wo, nanso wommua me.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:20">Mesɔre gyina, nanso wohwɛ me kɛkɛ.<verse eid="JOB 30:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 30:21"/>Woba me so anibereɛ so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:21">wode wʼabasa mu tumi to hyɛ me so.<verse eid="JOB 30:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 30:22"/>Wohwim me na wode mframa pia me;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:22">wodankyidankyi me wɔ ahum mu.<verse eid="JOB 30:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 30:23"/>Menim sɛ wode me bɛkɔ owuo mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:23">baabi a woahyɛ ama ateasefoɔ nyinaa.<verse eid="JOB 30:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 30:24"/>“Ampa ara obiara mfa ne nsa nka onipa a ɔrebrɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:24">ɛberɛ a ɔresu pɛ mmoa wɔ nʼamanehunu mu.<verse eid="JOB 30:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 30:25"/>Mansu amma wɔn a wɔwɔ ɔhaw mu anaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:25">Me kra werɛ anho amma ahiafoɔ anaa?<verse eid="JOB 30:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 30:26"/>Nanso ɛberɛ a mʼani da papa so no, bɔne baeɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:26">ɛberɛ a mepɛɛ hann no, esum na ɛduruuɛ.<verse eid="JOB 30:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 30:27"/>Meyafunu mu a ɛwowɔ me no nnyae da;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:27">na nna a amanehunu wɔ mu da mʼanim.<verse eid="JOB 30:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 30:28"/>Menenam a mabiri a ɛnyɛ sɛ owia na ahye me;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:28">megyina adwaberem na mesu pɛ mmoa.<verse eid="JOB 30:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 30:29"/>Madane nnompo nuabarima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:29">me ne apatuo na ɛbɔ.<verse eid="JOB 30:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 30:30"/>Me honam ani abiri na ɛhwanehwane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:30">huraeɛ ama me ho adɔ.<verse eid="JOB 30:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 30:31"/>Me sankuo bɔ kwadwom,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:31">na mʼatɛntɛbɛn ma agyaadwotwa nnyegyeɛ.<verse eid="JOB 30:31"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="JOB 30"/>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="JOB 31"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 31:1"/>“Me ne mʼani yɛɛ apam sɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:1">meremfiri akɔnnɔ mu nhwɛ ababaawa.<verse eid="JOB 31:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 31:2"/>Ɛdeɛn ne onipa kyɛfa a ɛfiri ɔsoro Onyankopɔn nkyɛn?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:2">Ɛdeɛn ne nʼagyapadeɛ a ɛfiri ɔsoro Otumfoɔ no nkyɛn?<verse eid="JOB 31:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 31:3"/>Ɛnyɛ ɔsɛeɛ mma amumuyɛfoɔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:3">Ɛnyɛ asiane mma wɔn a wɔyɛ bɔne?<verse eid="JOB 31:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 31:4"/>Ɔnhunu mʼakwan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:4">na ɔnkan anammɔn biara a metuo anaa?<verse eid="JOB 31:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 31:5"/>“Sɛ manante wɔ nkontompo mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:5">anaasɛ matu mmirika adi nnaadaasɛm akyi a,<verse eid="JOB 31:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 31:6"/>ma Onyankopɔn nkari me wɔ nsania papa so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:6">na ɔbɛhunu sɛ me ho nni asɛm.<verse eid="JOB 31:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 31:7"/>Sɛ mʼanammɔntuo afom ɛkwan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:7">sɛ mʼakoma adi mʼani akyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:7">anaasɛ me nsa ho agu fi a<verse eid="JOB 31:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 31:8"/>ɛnneɛ ma afoforɔ nni deɛ madua,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:8">na ma wɔntutu me mfudeɛ ngu.<verse eid="JOB 31:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 31:9"/>“Sɛ ɔbaa bi atɔ mʼakoma so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:9">anaasɛ matɛ me yɔnko bi ɛpono akyi a,<verse eid="JOB 31:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 31:10"/>ɛnneɛ, me yere nyam ɔbarima foforɔ aduane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:10">na mmarima afoforɔ ne no nna.<verse eid="JOB 31:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 31:11"/>Ɛfiri sɛ, anka ɛno na ɛbɛyɛ aniwusɛm</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:11">ne bɔne a ɛsɛ sɛ wɔtwe aso wɔ so.<verse eid="JOB 31:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 31:12"/>Ɛyɛ ogya a ɛhye kɔduru ɔsɛeɛ mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:12">na ɛbɛtumi atutu mʼagyapadeɛ nyinaa ase.<verse eid="JOB 31:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 31:13"/>“Sɛ mabu mʼasomfoɔ mmarima ne mmaa ntɛnkyea</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:13">ɛberɛ a wɔ ne me nyaa asɛm,<verse eid="JOB 31:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 31:14"/>na sɛ Onyankopɔn de si mʼanim a, ɛdeɛn na mɛyɛ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:14">Sɛ wɔfrɛ me akontabuo a, mmuaeɛ bɛn na mɛma?<verse eid="JOB 31:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 31:15"/>Ɛnyɛ deɛ ɔbɔɔ me wɔ yafunu mu no na ɔbɔɔ wɔn?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:15">Ɛnyɛ onipa korɔ no na ɔbɔɔ yɛn nyinaa wɔ yɛn maamenom yafunu mu?<verse eid="JOB 31:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 31:16"/>“Ohiani bi wɔ hɔ a ɔhia mmoa a mammoa no?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:16">Anaa mabu akunafoɔ bi abasa mu?<verse eid="JOB 31:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 31:17"/>Mabɔ mʼaduane ho atirimuɔden a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:17">mamma nwisiaa bi?<verse eid="JOB 31:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 31:18"/>Dabi, ɛfiri me mmeranteberɛ mu, matete wɔn sɛdeɛ agya bɛyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:18">na me nkwa nna nyinaa mu, mahwɛ akunafoɔ.<verse eid="JOB 31:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 31:19"/>Sɛ mahunu obi a ɔnni aduradeɛ na ɔrebrɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:19">anaa ohiani bi a ɔnni atadeɛ,<verse eid="JOB 31:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 31:20"/>na sɛ wamfiri akoma mu anhyira me</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:20">wɔ ɛberɛ a mede me nnwan ho nwi kaa no hye,<verse eid="JOB 31:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 31:21"/>sɛ mama me nsa so atia awisiaa bi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:21">ɛsiane sɛ mewɔ tumi wɔ asɛnniiɛ enti a,<verse eid="JOB 31:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 31:22"/>ɛnneɛ ma mʼabasa mpan mfiri mʼabatiri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:22">ma ɛmmubu mfiri ne pɔ so.<verse eid="JOB 31:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 31:23"/>Mesuroo ɔsɛeɛ a ɛfiri Onyankopɔn nkyɛn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:23">na nʼanimuonyam ho suro enti mantumi anyɛ saa nneɛma yi.<verse eid="JOB 31:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 31:24"/>“Sɛ mede me werɛ ahyɛ sikakɔkɔɔ mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:24">anaasɛ maka akyerɛ sikakɔkɔɔ amapa sɛ, ‘Wo na wobɔ me ho ban,’<verse eid="JOB 31:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 31:25"/>sɛ masɛpɛ me ho wɔ mʼahodeɛ bebrebe enti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:25">ahodeɛ a me nsa aka yi,<verse eid="JOB 31:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 31:26"/>sɛ mahwɛ owia a ɛhyerɛn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:26">anaa ɔsrane a ɛnam animuonyam mu,<verse eid="JOB 31:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 31:27"/>ama aka mʼakoma a obiara nnim</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:27">na me nsa yɛɛ wɔn atuu de anidie maa wɔn a,<verse eid="JOB 31:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 31:28"/>ɛnneɛ na yeinom nso bɛyɛ bɔne a wɔbu ho atɛn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:28">ɛfiri sɛ na manni Onyankopɔn a ɔte ɔsoro no nokorɛ.<verse eid="JOB 31:28"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 31:29"/>“Mʼani nnyee wɔ me ɔtamfoɔ amanehunu ho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:29">anaa menseree no wɔ ɔhaw a aba ne so.<verse eid="JOB 31:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 31:30"/>Memmaa mʼano nyɛɛ bɔne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:30">sɛ mɛdome obi nkwa.<verse eid="JOB 31:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 31:31"/>Mʼasomfoɔ a wɔwɔ me fidua mu nkaa da sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:31">‘Ɔma ɛkɔm de yɛn.’<verse eid="JOB 31:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 31:32"/>Ɔhɔhoɔ biara anna abɔntene so da,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:32">ɛfiri sɛ me ɛpono ano daa hɔ da biara maa akwantufoɔ,<verse eid="JOB 31:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 31:33"/>Makata me bɔne so sɛdeɛ nnipa yɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:33">de mʼafɔdie ahyɛ mʼakoma mu?<verse eid="JOB 31:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 31:34"/>Suro a mesuro nnipadɔm</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:34">ne ahohora a ɛfiri mmusua hɔ no enti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:34">meyɛɛ komm a mamfiri adi?<verse eid="JOB 31:34"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 31:35"/>(“Ao, sɛ anka mewɔ obi a ɔbɛtie me.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:35">Mede me din ahyɛ mʼanoyie ase, ma Otumfoɔ no mmua me;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:35">ma deɛ ɔbɔ me kwaadu no ntwerɛ ne soboɔbɔ.<verse eid="JOB 31:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 31:36"/>Ampa ara, anka mede bɛhyɛ mʼabatiri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:36">anka mede bɛhyɛ sɛ ahenkyɛ.<verse eid="JOB 31:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 31:37"/>Anka mɛbu mʼanammɔntuo biara ho akonta akyerɛ no;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:37">anka mɛkɔ nʼanim sɛ ɔheneba.)<verse eid="JOB 31:37"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOB 31:38"/>“Sɛ mʼasase team tia me</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:38">na nisuo fɔ nʼakofie nyinaa,<verse eid="JOB 31:38"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOB 31:39"/>sɛ madi so aba a mentuaa ka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:39">anaasɛ mabu ɛso apaafoɔ no abamu a,<verse eid="JOB 31:39"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOB 31:40"/>ma nkasɛɛ mfifiri nsi ayuo anan mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:40">na wira mfu nsi atokoɔ anan mu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 31:40">Hiob nsɛm no asi.<verse eid="JOB 31:40"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="JOB 31"/>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="JOB 32"/>
  <para style="s1">Elihu Adwenkyerɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 32:1"/>Enti saa mmarima baasa yi ammua Hiob bio, ɛfiri sɛ, na ɔtene wɔ ɔno ara ani so. <verse eid="JOB 32:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 32:2"/>Na Busini Barakel babarima Elihu a ɔfiri Ram abusua mu no bo fuu Hiob yie sɛ ɔbu ne ho bem na ɔmmu Onyankopɔn mmom bem. <verse eid="JOB 32:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 32:3"/>Ne bo fuu nnamfonom baasa no sɛ wɔantumi anya nnyinasoɔ bi ammɔ Hiob nsɛm no angu, nanso wɔbuu no fɔ. <verse eid="JOB 32:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 32:4"/>Elihu twɛnee sɛ afoforɔ no bɛkasa akyerɛ Hiob, ɛfiri sɛ, na wɔanyinyini sene no. <verse eid="JOB 32:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 32:5"/>Na ɔhunuu sɛ nnipa baasa no nni asɛm biara ka bio no, nʼabufuo sɔreeɛ.<verse eid="JOB 32:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 32:6"/>Enti Busini Barakel babarima Elihu kaa sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:6">“Meyɛ abɔfra,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:6">na moyɛ mpanimfoɔ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:6">ɛno enti na mesuroo sɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:6">mɛka deɛ menim akyerɛ mo.<verse eid="JOB 32:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 32:7"/>Medwenee sɛ, ‘Ɛsɛ sɛ mpanimfoɔ kasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:7">ɛsɛ sɛ wɔn a wɔn ani afire kyerɛ nyansa.’<verse eid="JOB 32:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 32:8"/>Nanso honhom a ɛte onipa mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:8">Otumfoɔ no ahomeɛ no na ɛma nteaseɛ.<verse eid="JOB 32:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 32:9"/>Ɛnyɛ mpanimfoɔ nko na wɔyɛ anyansafoɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:9">ɛnyɛ wɔn a wɔn ani afire nko na wɔte deɛ ɛyɛ ase.<verse eid="JOB 32:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 32:10"/>“Enti mese: Montie me;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:10">me nso mɛka mʼadwene.<verse eid="JOB 32:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 32:11"/>Metwɛneeɛ wɔ ɛberɛ a morekasa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:11">metiee mo adwenkyerɛ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:11">ɛberɛ a na monhunu deɛ monka no,<verse eid="JOB 32:11"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 32:12"/>meyɛɛ aso maa mo pa ara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:12">nanso mo mu biara antumi ankyerɛ sɛ Hiob ayɛ mfomsoɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:12">mo mu biara anyi nʼanosɛm ano.<verse eid="JOB 32:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 32:13"/>Monnka sɛ, ‘Ɔnim nyansa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:13">Onyankopɔn nko ara na ɔbɛtumi asesa nʼadwene.’<verse eid="JOB 32:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 32:14"/>Sɛ Hiob ne me kasaeɛ a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:14">anka merennyina mo adwenkyerɛ no so mmua no.<verse eid="JOB 32:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 32:15"/>“Mo ho adwiri mo, monni hwee ka bio;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:15">mo nsɛm asa.<verse eid="JOB 32:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 32:16"/>Ɛsɛ sɛ metwɛn wɔ ɛberɛ a moayɛ komm yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:16">saa ɛberɛ a mo monni mmuaeɛ biara de ma yi?<verse eid="JOB 32:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 32:17"/>Me nso mɛka bi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:17">me nso mɛka mʼadwene.<verse eid="JOB 32:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 32:18"/>Ɛfiri sɛ, nsɛm ahyɛ mʼanomu ma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:18">na honhom a ɛte me mu no hyɛ me sɛ menka;<verse eid="JOB 32:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 32:19"/>Me mu no, mete sɛ nsa a ɛhyɛ toa mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:19">Me te sɛ nsã kotokuo foforɔ a ɛrebɛpae.<verse eid="JOB 32:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 32:20"/>Ɛsɛ sɛ mekasa na me ho tɔ me;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:20">ɛsɛ sɛ mebue mʼano na me ma mmuaeɛ.<verse eid="JOB 32:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 32:21"/>Merenyɛ animhwɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:21">na merenkorɔkorɔ obiara.<verse eid="JOB 32:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 32:22"/>Na sɛ makwadare akorɔkorɔ mu a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:22">anka me Yɛfoɔ bɛyi me afiri hɔ ntɛm so.<verse eid="JOB 32:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="JOB 32"/>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="JOB 33"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 33:1"/>“Na afei, Hiob, tie me nsɛm;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:1">yɛ aso ma biribiara a mɛka.<verse eid="JOB 33:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 33:2"/>Merebɛbue mʼano;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:2">me nsɛm aba me tɛkrɛma so.<verse eid="JOB 33:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 33:3"/>Me nsɛm firi akoma a ɛtene mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:3">na mʼano de ahonim pa ka deɛ menim.<verse eid="JOB 33:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 33:4"/>Onyankopɔn Honhom na abɔ me;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:4">Otumfoɔ no ahome ma me nkwa.<verse eid="JOB 33:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 33:5"/>Sɛ wobɛtumi a, ma me mmuaeɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:5">siesie wo ho, na ka si mʼanim.<verse eid="JOB 33:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 33:6"/>Wo ne me nyinaa yɛ pɛ wɔ Onyankopɔn anim;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:6">me nso wɔbɔɔ me firii dɔteɛ mu.<verse eid="JOB 33:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 33:7"/>Ɛnsɛ sɛ wosuro me,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:7">na ɛnsɛ sɛ me nsa yɛ den wɔ wo so.<verse eid="JOB 33:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 33:8"/>“Nanso woaka ama mate,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:8">metee saa nsɛm no, na wokaa sɛ,<verse eid="JOB 33:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 33:9"/>‘Meyɛ kronn na menni bɔne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:9">me ho te na afɔdie biara nni me ho.<verse eid="JOB 33:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 33:10"/>Nanso Onyankopɔn anya me ho mfomsoɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:10">wafa me sɛ ne ɔtamfoɔ.<verse eid="JOB 33:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 33:11"/>Ɔde me nan ahyɛ mpɔkyerɛ mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:11">na nʼani wɔ mʼakwan nyinaa so.’<verse eid="JOB 33:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 33:12"/>“Nanso meka mekyerɛ wo sɛ, yei mu deɛ, woayɛ mfomsoɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:12">ɛfiri sɛ Onyankopɔn so sene ɔdasani.<verse eid="JOB 33:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 33:13"/>Na adɛn enti na wonwiinwii hyɛ no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:13">sɛ ɔmmua onipa nsɛm biara anaa?<verse eid="JOB 33:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 33:14"/>Nanso, Onyankopɔn kasa wɔ akwan ahodoɔ so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:14">na ebia nnipa nte.<verse eid="JOB 33:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 33:15"/>Ɔkasa wɔ daeɛso ne anadwo anisoadehunu mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:15">ɛberɛ a nna afa nnipa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:15">na wɔretu nkorɔmo wɔ wɔn mpa so,<verse eid="JOB 33:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 33:16"/>ɔtumi kasa gu wɔn asom</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:16">na ɔde kɔkɔbɔ yi wɔn hu,<verse eid="JOB 33:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 33:17"/>sɛ ɔbɛdane onipa afiri nneyɛɛ bɔne ho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:17">na watwe no afiri ahantan ho,<verse eid="JOB 33:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 33:18"/>sɛ ɔmma ne ɔkra nnkɔ amena mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:18">na ɔnhwere ne nkwa wɔ akofena ano.<verse eid="JOB 33:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 33:19"/>Onyankopɔn tumi de yea twe onipa aso ɛberɛ a ɔda mpa so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:19">na ne nnompe mu yea nnyae da,<verse eid="JOB 33:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 33:20"/>kɔsi sɛ ne kɔn nnɔ aduane</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:20">na ne ɔkra nso po aduane a ɛyɛ akɔnnɔ pa ara;<verse eid="JOB 33:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 33:21"/>ɔfɔn yɛ basaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:21">na ne nnompe a anka ɛho akata no ho da hɔ.<verse eid="JOB 33:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 33:22"/>Ne ɔkra bɛn damena,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:22">na ne nkwa bɛn owuo abɔfoɔ.<verse eid="JOB 33:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 33:23"/>“Nanso sɛ abɔfoɔ apem no mu baako wɔ nʼafa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:23">sɛ ɔdimafoɔ a ɔbɛkyerɛ no deɛ ɛyɛ ma no a,<verse eid="JOB 33:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 33:24"/>ɔbɛhunu no mmɔbɔ na waka sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:24">‘Monnyaa no na wankɔ damena mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:24">na manya mpatadeɛ ama no,’<verse eid="JOB 33:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 33:25"/>afei ne wedeɛ bɛyɛ foforɔ sɛ abɔfra deɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:25">na asi ne dada mu sɛ mmeranteberɛ mu deɛ.<verse eid="JOB 33:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 33:26"/>Sɛ ɔbɔ Onyankopɔn mpaeɛ a, ɔbɛnya adom afiri ne hɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:26">ɔbɛhunu Onyankopɔn anim na ɔde ahosɛpɛ ateam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:26">na Onyankopɔn agye no bio sɛ ɔteneneeni.<verse eid="JOB 33:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 33:27"/>Afei ɔbɛba nnipa mu abɛka sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:27">‘Meyɛɛ bɔne na mekyeaa deɛ ɛtene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:27">nanso wantwe mʼaso sɛdeɛ ɛfata me.<verse eid="JOB 33:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 33:28"/>Ɔgyee me ɔkra na wamma no ankɔ damena mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:28">enti mɛtena ase na madi hann no mu dɛ.’<verse eid="JOB 33:28"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 33:29"/>“Onyankopɔn yɛ yeinom nyinaa ma onipa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:29">mprɛnu ne ne mprɛnsa so,<verse eid="JOB 33:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 33:30"/>sɛdeɛ onipa kra renkɔ damena mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:30">na nkwa hann no ahyerɛn ne so.<verse eid="JOB 33:30"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 33:31"/>“Yɛ aso, Hiob, na tie me;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:31">yɛ dinn na menkasa.<verse eid="JOB 33:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 33:32"/>Na sɛ wowɔ biribi ka a, bua me;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:32">kasa, na mepɛ sɛ wɔbu wo bem.<verse eid="JOB 33:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 33:33"/>Sɛ ɛnte saa nso a, ɛnneɛ tie me.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:33">Yɛ dinn na mɛkyerɛ wo nyansa.”<verse eid="JOB 33:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 33"/>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="JOB 34"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 34:1"/>Afei Elihu kaa sɛ,<verse eid="JOB 34:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 34:2"/>“Mo anyansafoɔ, montie me nsɛm;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:2">mo animdefoɔ monyɛ aso mma me.<verse eid="JOB 34:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 34:3"/>Ɛfiri sɛ aso sɔ nsɛm hwɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:3">sɛdeɛ tɛkrɛma ka aduane hwɛ no.<verse eid="JOB 34:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 34:4"/>Momma yɛnsese nhunu deɛ ɛyɛ ma yɛn.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:4">Momma yɛn nyinaa mmɔ mu nsua deɛ ɛyɛ.<verse eid="JOB 34:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 34:5"/>“Hiob kaa sɛ, ‘Me ho nni asɛm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:5">nanso Onyankopɔn abu me ntɛnkyea.<verse eid="JOB 34:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 34:6"/>Ɛwom sɛ mʼasɛm da ɛkwan mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:6">nanso, wɔbu me ɔtorofoɔ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:6">ɛwom sɛ menyɛɛ bɔne biara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:6">nanso ne bɛmma no ama me apirakuro a ɛnnwu da.’<verse eid="JOB 34:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 34:7"/>Onipa bɛn na ɔte sɛ Hiob</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:7">a ɔnom animtiabuo sɛ nsuo?<verse eid="JOB 34:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 34:8"/>Ɔne amumuyɛfoɔ nante;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:8">na ɔne atirimuɔdenfoɔ nso bɔ.<verse eid="JOB 34:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 34:9"/>Ɛfiri sɛ ɔka sɛ, ‘Sɛ onipa bɔ mmɔden sɛ ɔbɛsɔ Onyankopɔn ani a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:9">ɔnnya ho mfasoɔ biara.’<verse eid="JOB 34:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 34:10"/>“Enti mo mmarima a mowɔ nteaseɛ montie me.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:10">Ɛmpare Onyankopɔn sɛ ɔbɛyɛ bɔne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:10">sɛ Otumfoɔ no bɛyɛ mfomsoɔ.<verse eid="JOB 34:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 34:11"/>Nnipa nneyɛeɛ so na ɔhwɛ tua wɔn ka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:11">deɛ ɛfata ne nneyɛeɛ na ɔma ɛba ne so.<verse eid="JOB 34:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 34:12"/>Ɛmfata sɛ wɔde mfomsoɔ susu Onyankopɔn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:12">na ɛmfata sɛ wɔde ntɛnkyea susu Otumfoɔ.<verse eid="JOB 34:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 34:13"/>Hwan na ɔde no sii asase so?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:13">Hwan na ɔde ewiase nyinaa hyɛɛ ne nsa?<verse eid="JOB 34:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 34:14"/>Sɛ ɛyɛɛ ne pɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:14">na ɔyii ne Honhom ne nʼahome a,<verse eid="JOB 34:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 34:15"/>anka adasamma nyinaa bɛbɔ mu ayera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:15">na onipa bɛsane akɔ mfuturo mu.<verse eid="JOB 34:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 34:16"/>“Sɛ mowɔ nhunumu a, montie yei;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:16">montie deɛ meka.<verse eid="JOB 34:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 34:17"/>Obi a ɔkyiri atɛntenenee bɛtumi adi nnipa so?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:17">Mobɛtumi abu Ɔteneneeni kɛseɛ no fɔ anaa?<verse eid="JOB 34:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 34:18"/>Ɛnyɛ Ɔno na ɔka kyerɛ ahemfo sɛ, ‘Mo ho nni mfasoɔ,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:18">na ɔka kyerɛɛ atitire sɛ, ‘Moyɛ atirimuɔdenfoɔ’?<verse eid="JOB 34:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 34:19"/>Ɔnhwɛ mmapɔmma anim</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:19">na ɔnyiyi adefoɔ ne ahiafoɔ mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:19">ɛfiri sɛ wɔn nyinaa yɛ ne nsa ano adwuma.<verse eid="JOB 34:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 34:20"/>Wɔwuwu mmerɛ tiawa bi mu, wɔ anadwo dasuo mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:20">nnipa no ho woso na wɔsene kɔ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:20">ahoɔdenfoɔ totɔ a ɛmfiri onipa.<verse eid="JOB 34:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 34:21"/>“Nʼani hwɛ nnipa akwan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:21">na ɔhunu wɔn anammɔntuo biara.<verse eid="JOB 34:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 34:22"/>Baabiara nni hɔ a aduru sum, esum kabii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:22">a amumuyɛfoɔ bɛtumi ahinta.<verse eid="JOB 34:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 34:23"/>Ɛho nhia Onyankopɔn sɛ ɔbɛhwehwɛ nnipa mu bio,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:23">a enti ɛsɛ sɛ wɔba nʼanim bɛgye atemmuo.<verse eid="JOB 34:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 34:24"/>Ɔbobɔ aberempɔn gu a ɔnyɛ nhwehwɛmu biara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:24">na ɔde afoforɔ sisi wɔn ananmu.<verse eid="JOB 34:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 34:25"/>Ɛfiri sɛ ɔhunu wɔn nneyɛeɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:25">ɔtu wɔn gu anadwo na wɔdwerɛ wɔn.<verse eid="JOB 34:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 34:26"/>Ɔtua wɔn amumuyɛsɛm so ka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:26">wɔ baabi a obiara bɛtumi ahunu wɔn,<verse eid="JOB 34:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 34:27"/>ɛfiri sɛ, wɔmane firii nʼakyi kɔeɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:27">na wɔampɛ nʼakwan biara anhwɛ.<verse eid="JOB 34:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 34:28"/>Wɔmaa ahiafoɔ sufrɛ duruu nʼanim</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:28">na ɛma ɔtee mmɔborɔni su.<verse eid="JOB 34:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 34:29"/>Nanso sɛ ɔyɛ komm a, hwan na ɔbɛtumi abu no fɔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:29">Sɛ ɔde nʼanim hinta nso a, hwan na ɔbɛhunu no?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:29">Nanso ɔdi onipa ne ɔman so pɛpɛɛpɛ,<verse eid="JOB 34:29"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 34:30"/>ɔmma onipa a ɔnnim Onyame nni ɔhene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:30">sɛdeɛ wɔnnsum nnipa no mfidie.<verse eid="JOB 34:30"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 34:31"/>“Adɛn enti na onipa nka nkyerɛ Onyankopɔn sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:31">‘Mayɛ bɔne na merenyɛ bɔne bio.<verse eid="JOB 34:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 34:32"/>Kyerɛ me na menhunu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:32">na sɛ mayɛ bɔne a, merenyɛ saa bio.’<verse eid="JOB 34:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 34:33"/>Ɛsɛ sɛ Onyankopɔn gyina deɛ wode wʼano aka so tua wo ka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:33">wɔ ɛberɛ a woayɛ sɛ worennu wo ho anaa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:33">Ɛsɛ sɛ wosi gyinaeɛ, ɛnyɛ me;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:33">enti ka deɛ wonim kyerɛ me.<verse eid="JOB 34:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 34:34"/>“Nnipa a wɔwɔ nteaseɛ pae mu ka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:34">animdefoɔ a wɔtie me ka kyerɛ me sɛ,<verse eid="JOB 34:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 34:35"/>‘Hiob nnkasa nimdeɛ kwan so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:35">aba biara nni ne kasa mu.’<verse eid="JOB 34:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 34:36"/>Ao, sɛ wɔsɔɔ Hiob hwɛeɛ kɔɔ akyiri a anka ɛyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:36">ɛfiri sɛ ɔyiyii nsɛm ano sɛ omumuyɛfoɔ!<verse eid="JOB 34:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 34:37"/>Ɔde atuateɛ ka ne bɔne ho;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:37">ɔde ahantan bɔ ne nsam gu yɛn so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:37">na ɔma ne nsɛm a ɔka tia Onyankopɔn no dɔɔso.”<verse eid="JOB 34:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 34"/>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="JOB 35"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 35:1"/>Afei, Elihu kaa sɛ:<verse eid="JOB 35:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 35:2"/>“Wogye di sɛ yei fata?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:2">Woka sɛ, ‘Onyankopɔn bɛtwitwa agye me.’<verse eid="JOB 35:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 35:3"/>Nanso wobisa no sɛ, ‘Mfasoɔ bɛn na mɛnya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:3">na sɛ manyɛ bɔne a, mfasoɔ bɛn na mɛnya?’<verse eid="JOB 35:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 35:4"/>“Mepɛ sɛ mebua wo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:4">ne wo nnamfonom nyinaa.<verse eid="JOB 35:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 35:5"/>Ma wʼani so kyerɛ ɔsoro na hwɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:5">hwɛ omununkum a ɛwɔ wʼatifi ɔsorosoro nohoa. <verse eid="JOB 35:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 35:6"/>Sɛ woyɛ bɔne a, ɛkwan bɛn so na ɛsakyera Onyankopɔn?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:6">Mpo sɛ wo bɔne dɔɔso a, nsunsuansoɔ bɛn na ɛnya wo ne so?<verse eid="JOB 35:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 35:7"/>Sɛ wotene a, ɛdeɛn na wode ma noɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:7">anaasɛ ɛdeɛn na ɔnya firi wo nsam?<verse eid="JOB 35:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 35:8"/>Wʼamumuyɛ pira onipa a ɔte sɛ wo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:8">na wo tenenee pira nnipa mma nko ara.<verse eid="JOB 35:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 35:9"/>“Nnipa su ɛberɛ a wɔwɔ nhyɛsoɔ ase;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:9">na wɔsrɛ mmoa firi deɛ ɔwɔ tumi nsam.<verse eid="JOB 35:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 35:10"/>Nanso, obi mmisa sɛ, ‘Ɛhe na Onyankopɔn, me Yɛfoɔ no wɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:10">deɛ ɔma nnwom anadwo no,<verse eid="JOB 35:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 35:11"/>deɛ ɔkyerɛ yɛn nimdeɛ bebree sene asase so mmoa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:11">na ɔma yɛhunu nyansa sene ewiem nnomaa?’<verse eid="JOB 35:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 35:12"/>Sɛ nnipa su team a, ɔmmua,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:12">amumuyɛfoɔ ahantan enti.<verse eid="JOB 35:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 35:13"/>Ampa ara Onyankopɔn rentie wɔn nkotosrɛ hunu no;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:13">na Otumfoɔ remmu.<verse eid="JOB 35:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 35:14"/>Woka sɛ wonhunu no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:14">nanso sɛ wotwɛn no a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 35:14">ɔde atɛntenenee bɛba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:14">enti ɛsɛ sɛ wotwɛn no.<verse eid="JOB 35:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 35:15"/>Bio, woka sɛ nʼabufuo mmfa asotweɛ mma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:15">na nʼani nni amumuyɛsɛm akyi pii.<verse eid="JOB 35:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 35:16"/>Enti Hiob bue nʼano ka nsɛm hunu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:16">nimdeɛ a ɔnni enti, ɔkeka nsɛm bebree.”<verse eid="JOB 35:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 35"/>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="JOB 36"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 36:1"/>Elihu toaa ne kasa so sɛ,<verse eid="JOB 36:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 36:2"/>“Monto mo bo ase kakra mma me, na mɛkyerɛ mo sɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:2">aka bebree a ɛsɛ sɛ yɛka ma Onyankopɔn.<verse eid="JOB 36:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 36:3"/>Menya me nimdeɛ firi akyirikyiri;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:3">mɛka sɛ me Yɛfoɔ bu atɛntenenee.<verse eid="JOB 36:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 36:4"/>Monnye ntom sɛ me nsɛm yɛ nokorɛ turodoo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:4">na meyɛ obi a ne nimdeɛ so wɔ mo mu.<verse eid="JOB 36:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 36:5"/>“Onyankopɔn so, nanso, ɔntwiri nnipa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:5">ɔkorɔn na ɔnhinhim ne botaeɛ mu.<verse eid="JOB 36:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 36:6"/>Ɔmma amumuyɛfoɔ ntena nkwa mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:6">na ɔde amanehunufoɔ kyɛfa ma wɔn.<verse eid="JOB 36:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 36:7"/>Ɔnnyi nʼani mfiri ɔteneneeni so.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:7">Ɔma wɔne ahemfo di adeɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:7">na ɔma wɔn so afebɔɔ.<verse eid="JOB 36:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 36:8"/>Na sɛ wɔde mpokyerɛ gu nnipa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:8">na amanehunu ahoma akyekyere wɔn papee a,<verse eid="JOB 36:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 36:9"/>ɔka deɛ wɔayɛ kyerɛ wɔn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:9">sɛ wɔnam ahantan so ayɛ bɔne.<verse eid="JOB 36:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 36:10"/>Ɔma wɔtie ntenesoɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:10">na ɔhyɛ wɔn sɛ wɔnnu wɔn ho wɔn bɔne ho.<verse eid="JOB 36:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 36:11"/>Sɛ wɔyɛ ɔsetie na wɔsom no a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:11">wɔbɛdi yie wɔ wɔn ɛnna a aka no mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:11">na wɔn mfeɛ nyinaa ayɛ anisɔ ama wɔn.<verse eid="JOB 36:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 36:12"/>Na sɛ wɔantie no a, wɔbɛyera wɔ akofena ano,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:12">na wɔawuwu a wɔnni nimdeɛ.<verse eid="JOB 36:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 36:13"/>“Wɔn a wɔnnim Onyame no kora abufuo so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:13">mpo sɛ ɔgu wɔn nkɔnsɔnkɔnsɔn a, wɔnsu mpɛ mmoa.<verse eid="JOB 36:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 36:14"/>Wɔwuwu wɔn mmabunuberɛ mu wɔ adwaman mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:14">wɔ mmarima adwamanfoɔ a wɔtete abosonnan mu mu.<verse eid="JOB 36:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 36:15"/>Nanso, wɔn a wɔhunu amane no, ɔgye wɔn;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:15">na ɔkasa kyerɛ wɔn wɔ wɔn haw mu.<verse eid="JOB 36:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 36:16"/>“Ɔregye wo afiri ahohiahia mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:16">de wo akɔ petee mu a ahokyere nnie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:16">deɛ wowɔ asomdwoeɛ, na nnuane pa ayɛ wo ɛpono so ma.<verse eid="JOB 36:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 36:17"/>Nanso seesei, atemmuo a ɛfata amumuyɛfoɔ na aba wo so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:17">atemmuo ne atɛntenenee asɔ wo mu.<verse eid="JOB 36:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 36:18"/>Hwɛ yie na obi amfa ahonya annaadaa wo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:18">mma adanmudeɛ kɛseɛ bi ntwe wo.<verse eid="JOB 36:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 36:19"/>Wʼahonya anaasɛ mpo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:19">wʼahohaw bebrebe nyinaa enti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:19">worenkɔ amanehunu mu anaa?<verse eid="JOB 36:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 36:20"/>Mpere anadwo ho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:20">sɛ ɛmmɛpra nnipa mfiri wɔn afie mu.<verse eid="JOB 36:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 36:21"/>Hwɛ na woannane ankɔ bɔne ho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:21">deɛ ayɛ sɛ wopɛ sene amanehunu.<verse eid="JOB 36:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 36:22"/>“Onyankopɔn yɛ kɛseɛ wɔ ne tumi mu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:22">Hwan na ɔyɛ ɔkyerɛkyerɛfoɔ sɛ ɔno?<verse eid="JOB 36:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 36:23"/>Hwan na wahyehyɛ nʼakwan ama no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:23">anaa waka akyerɛ no sɛ, ‘Woayɛ mfomsoɔ.’<verse eid="JOB 36:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 36:24"/>Kae na kamfo nʼadwuma a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:24">nnipa de nnwontoɔ akamfo no.<verse eid="JOB 36:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 36:25"/>Adasamma nyinaa ahunu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:25">nnipa hwɛ haa firi akyirikyiri.<verse eid="JOB 36:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 36:26"/>Onyankopɔn yɛ kɛseɛ, ɛboro yɛn nteaseɛ so!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:26">Ne mfeɛ dodoɔ mu nni hwehwɛbea.<verse eid="JOB 36:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 36:27"/>“Ɔtwetwe nsuo a ɛsosɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:27">ma ɛdane osutɔ gu asutene mu;<verse eid="JOB 36:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 36:28"/>na omununkum tɔ bosuo gu fam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:28">na osutɔ bebree gu adasamma so.<verse eid="JOB 36:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 36:29"/>Hwan na ɔbɛtumi ate sɛdeɛ ɔtrɛtrɛ omununkum mu ase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:29">sɛdeɛ ɔbobɔ mu firi nʼatenaeɛ?<verse eid="JOB 36:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 36:30"/>Hwɛ sɛdeɛ ɔhwete nʼanyinam mu wɔ ne ho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:30">ma ɛkɔ ɛpo bunu mu.<verse eid="JOB 36:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 36:31"/>Yei ne ɛkwan a ɔfa so di amanaman no so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:31">na ɔma aduane bu wɔn so.<verse eid="JOB 36:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 36:32"/>Ɔde anyinam hyɛ ne nsam ma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:32">na ɔhyɛ no sɛ ɛnsi nʼagyiraeɛ.<verse eid="JOB 36:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 36:33"/>Nʼaprannaa bɔ ahum a ɛreba no ho nkaeɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:33">na anantwie mpo ma wɔhunu sɛ ɛreba.<verse eid="JOB 36:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="JOB 36"/>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="JOB 37"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 37:1"/>“Yei ma mʼakoma bɔ paripari</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:1">na ɛbɔ denden pa ara.<verse eid="JOB 37:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 37:2"/>Tie! Tie ne nne mmobom,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:2">ne hooyɛ a ɛfiri nʼanom reba.<verse eid="JOB 37:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 37:3"/>Ɔgyaa nʼanyinam mu wɔ ɔsoro ase nyinaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:3">na ɔma ɛkɔduru asase ano.<verse eid="JOB 37:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 37:4"/>Ɛno akyi na ne mmobom no ba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:4">ɔde nne kɛseɛ bobom.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:4">Sɛ ɔkasa a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:4">biribiara nsianka no.<verse eid="JOB 37:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 37:5"/>Onyankopɔn nne bobom ma no yɛ nwanwa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:5">ɔyɛ nneɛma akɛseɛ a ɛboro yɛn adwene so.<verse eid="JOB 37:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 37:6"/>Ɔka kyerɛ sukyerɛmma sɛ, ‘Tɔ gu asase so,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:6">ne osutɔ nso sɛ, ‘Yɛ osutɔ kɛseɛ.’<verse eid="JOB 37:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 37:7"/>Sɛdeɛ nnipa a wabɔ wɔn nyinaa bɛhunu nʼadwuma enti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:7">ɔma obiara gyae nʼadwuma.<verse eid="JOB 37:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 37:8"/>Wiram mmoa kɔtetɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:8">wɔkɔhyehyɛ wɔn abɔn mu.<verse eid="JOB 37:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 37:9"/>Ahum tu firi ne pia mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:9">na awɔ nso firi mframa a ɛrebɔ mu.<verse eid="JOB 37:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 37:10"/>Onyankopɔn ahome de nsukyeneeɛ ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:10">na nsuo hahanaa no kyene.<verse eid="JOB 37:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 37:11"/>Ɔde fɔnwuni hyɛ omununkum ma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:11">na ɔtwa nʼanyinam fa mu.<verse eid="JOB 37:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 37:12"/>Ɔhyɛ ma wɔkyinkyini</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:12">fa asase so nyinaa so hyia</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:12">yɛ deɛ ɔkyerɛ sɛ wɔnyɛ biara.<verse eid="JOB 37:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 37:13"/>Ɔde omununkum ba de bɛtwe nnipa aso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:13">anaasɛ ɔma ɛtɔ gu asase so de kyerɛ nʼadɔeɛ.<verse eid="JOB 37:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 37:14"/>“Tie yei, Hiob;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:14">gyae na dwene Onyankopɔn anwanwadeɛ ho.<verse eid="JOB 37:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 37:15"/>Wonim sɛdeɛ Onyankopɔn danedane omununkum,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:15">na ɔma anyinam tete firi mu?<verse eid="JOB 37:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 37:16"/>Wonim sɛdeɛ omununkum sensɛn ewiem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:16">deɛ ɔyɛ nyansaboakwa no anwanwadeɛ?<verse eid="JOB 37:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 37:17"/>Mo a mote fifire wɔ mo ntadeɛ mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:17">ɛberɛ a anafoɔ mframa ma asase no yɛ dinn no,<verse eid="JOB 37:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 37:18"/>wobɛtumi aboa no ama watrɛ ewiem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:18">a ɛyɛ dene sɛ kɔbere mfrafraeɛ ahwehwɛ?<verse eid="JOB 37:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 37:19"/>“Kyerɛ yɛn deɛ ɛsɛ sɛ yɛka kyerɛ no;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:19">yɛrentumi nka yɛn asɛm, ɛsiane sɛ yɛnnim enti.<verse eid="JOB 37:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 37:20"/>Ɛsɛ sɛ wɔbɔ Onyankopɔn nkaeɛ sɛ mepɛ sɛ me ne no kasa anaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:20">Onipa bi wɔ hɔ a ɔbɛpɛ sɛ wɔbɛmene no anaa?<verse eid="JOB 37:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 37:21"/>Obiara rentumi nhwɛ owia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:21">sɛdeɛ ɛhyerɛn wɔ ewiem</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:21">ɛberɛ a mframa abɔ ama ewiem ateɛ.<verse eid="JOB 37:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 37:22"/>Ɔfiri atifi fam ba wɔ animuonyam sononko mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:22">Onyankopɔn ba wɔ surokronkron tumi mu.<verse eid="JOB 37:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 37:23"/>Yɛnhunu Otumfoɔ deɛ, nanso ne tumi yɛ kɛseɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:23">nʼatɛntenenee ne teneneeyɛ kɛseɛ akyi mpo ɔnyɛ nhyɛsoɔ.<verse eid="JOB 37:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 37:24"/>Ɛno enti nnipa de anidie ma no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:24">na ɔmmu akoma mu anyansafoɔ biara.”<verse eid="JOB 37:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 37"/>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="JOB 38"/>
  <para style="s1">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> Bisa Hiob Nsɛm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 38:1"/>Afei, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> firi ahum mu buaa Hiob sɛ,<verse eid="JOB 38:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 38:2"/>“Hwan ne deɛ ɔde nsɛm a nimdeɛ nni mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:2">katakata mʼafotuo so?<verse eid="JOB 38:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 38:3"/>Hyɛ wo ho den sɛ ɔbarima;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:3">mɛbisa wo nsɛm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:3">na wobɛyi mʼano.<verse eid="JOB 38:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 38:4"/>“Ɛberɛ a metoo asase fapem no, na wowɔ he?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:4">Sɛ wonim a, ka ɛ.<verse eid="JOB 38:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 38:5"/>Hwan na ɔsusuu ne tenten ne ne tɛtrɛtɛ? Ampa ara wonim!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:5">Hwan na ɔtwee susuhoma faa ani?<verse eid="JOB 38:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 38:6"/>Ɛdeɛn so na ɛgyina,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:6">anaasɛ hwan na ɔtoo ne tweatiboɔ no,<verse eid="JOB 38:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 38:7"/>ɛberɛ a anɔpa nsoromma bɔɔ mu too dwom,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:7">na abɔfoɔ nyinaa de anigyeɛ teaam no?<verse eid="JOB 38:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 38:8"/>“Hwan na ɔkaa ɛpo hyɛɛ apono akyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:8">ɛberɛ a ɛpue firii yafunu mu,<verse eid="JOB 38:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 38:9"/>ɛberɛ a mede omununkum yɛɛ nʼaduradeɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:9">na mede esum kabii kyekyeree noɔ,<verse eid="JOB 38:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 38:10"/>ɛberɛ a metoo hyeɛ maa noɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:10">na mesisii nʼapono ne nʼadaban,<verse eid="JOB 38:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 38:11"/>ɛberɛ a mekaa sɛ, ‘Ɛha ara na wobɛduru, ɛntra ha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:11">ɛha na wʼahantan asorɔkyeɛ no mmɛso’?<verse eid="JOB 38:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 38:12"/>“Woahyɛ mmara ama adekyeeɛ da?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:12">Anaa woakyerɛ no nʼafa,<verse eid="JOB 38:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 38:13"/>sɛ ɛnkɔka asase ano</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:13">na ɛntu amumuyɛfoɔ mfiri so?<verse eid="JOB 38:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 38:14"/>Asase fa ne bɔberɛ sɛ dɔteɛ a ɛhyɛ nsɔano ase;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:14">na ɛso tebea da adi te sɛ atadeɛ.<verse eid="JOB 38:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 38:15"/>Wɔde amumuyɛfoɔ hann akame wɔn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:15">na wɔn abasa a wɔapagya no mu abu.<verse eid="JOB 38:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 38:16"/>“Woapɛɛpɛɛ mu ahunu nsutire a ɛpo firi mu ba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:16">anaa woanante ne bunu mu?<verse eid="JOB 38:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 38:17"/>Wɔde owuo apono akyerɛ wo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:17">Woahunu owuo sunsumma apono anaa?<verse eid="JOB 38:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 38:18"/>Woate ewiase a ɛda hɔ hahanaa no ase anaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:18">Sɛ wonim yeinom nyinaa a, ka kyerɛ me.<verse eid="JOB 38:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 38:19"/>“Ɛhe na hann firi ba?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:19">Na ɛhe na esum nso kɔ?<verse eid="JOB 38:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 38:20"/>Wobɛtumi de wɔn akɔ wɔn siberɛ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:20">Wonim akwan a ɛkɔ wɔn atenaeɛ?<verse eid="JOB 38:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 38:21"/>Ampa ara wonim, ɛfiri sɛ na woawo wo dada.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:21">Woanyini yie!<verse eid="JOB 38:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 38:22"/>“Woakɔ sukyerɛmma adekoradan mu da,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:22">anaa woahunu asukɔtweaa adekoradan<verse eid="JOB 38:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 38:23"/>a makora so ama ahohiahia berɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:23">ɔsa ne akodie nna?<verse eid="JOB 38:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 38:24"/>Ɛkwan bɛn na ɛkɔ baabi a anyinam firi ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:24">anaa baabi a apueeɛ mframa firi na ɛbɔ fa asase so?<verse eid="JOB 38:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 38:25"/>Hwan na ɔtwaa ɛka maa osubransam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:25">ne ɛkwan maa aprannaa mmobom,<verse eid="JOB 38:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 38:26"/>sɛ ɛbɛtɔ agu asase a obiara nte soɔ so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:26">anweatam a obiara nni soɔ,<verse eid="JOB 38:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 38:27"/>na ama asase bonini a ɛyɛ wesee yi afɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:27">na ɛserɛ afifiri so?<verse eid="JOB 38:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 38:28"/>Osutɔ wɔ agya anaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:28">Hwan na ɔyɛ agya ma obosuo?<verse eid="JOB 38:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 38:29"/>Hwan yafunu mu na nsukyeneeɛ fire?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:29">Hwan na ɔwoo nsukyeneeɛ mporoporowa firi soro<verse eid="JOB 38:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 38:30"/>ɛberɛ a nsuo kyene dane sɛ ɛboɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:30">na ebunu ani kyene?<verse eid="JOB 38:30"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 38:31"/>“Wobɛtumi de ahoma akyekyere Akokɔbaatan ne ne mma?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:31">Wobɛtumi asane Nwenwenente nhoma anaa?<verse eid="JOB 38:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 38:32"/>Wobɛtumi de anɔpa nsoromma aba wɔ ne berɛ mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:32">anaasɛ wobɛtumi ayi sisire ne ne mma afiri hɔ?<verse eid="JOB 38:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 38:33"/>Wonim mmara a ɛfa ewiem ho?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:33">Wobɛtumi de Onyankopɔn ahennie aba asase so?<verse eid="JOB 38:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 38:34"/>“Wobɛtumi ama wo nne aduru omununkum so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:34">na wode nsuo akata wo ho anaa?<verse eid="JOB 38:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 38:35"/>Wobɛtumi ama anyinam atwa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:35">Wɔbɛka akyerɛ wo sɛ, ‘Yɛnnie anaa’?<verse eid="JOB 38:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 38:36"/>Hwan na ɔde nyansa ma akoma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:36">anaasɛ ɔde nteaseɛ hyɛ adwene mu.<verse eid="JOB 38:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 38:37"/>Hwan na ɔwɔ nyansa a wɔde kan omununkum?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:37">Hwan na ɔbɛtumi akyea ɔsoro nsuo nkotokuo,<verse eid="JOB 38:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOB 38:38"/>ɛberɛ a mfuturo ayɛ den</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:38">ama dɔteɛ atɔatɔ keka bɔ mu.<verse eid="JOB 38:38"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOB 38:39"/>“Wokɔ ahayɔ ma gyatabereɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:39">ma agyata didi mee<verse eid="JOB 38:39"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOB 38:40"/>ɛberɛ a wɔbutubutu wɔn abɔn ano</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:40">anaasɛ wɔtetɛ nnɔtɔ ase?<verse eid="JOB 38:40"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOB 38:41"/>Hwan na ɔma anene aduane</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:41">ɛberɛ a ne mma su frɛ Onyankopɔn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:41">na wɔkyinkyini pɛ aduane?<verse eid="JOB 38:41"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="JOB 38"/>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="JOB 39"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 39:1"/>“Wonim ɛberɛ a bepɔ so mmirekyie wowoɔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:1">Woahwɛ, ahunu ɛberɛ a ɔforoteɛ nyinsɛn ne ba?<verse eid="JOB 39:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 39:2"/>Woakane abosome dodoɔ a wɔde nyinsɛn?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:2">Wonim ɛberɛ a wɔwoɔ anaa?<verse eid="JOB 39:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 39:3"/>Wɔkoto wowo wɔn mma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:3">na wɔn awokoɔ yea to twa.<verse eid="JOB 39:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 39:4"/>Wɔn mma nyini ahoɔden so wɔ wiram;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:4">na wɔgya wɔn awofoɔ hɔ a wɔnnsane nkɔ wɔn nkyɛn bio.<verse eid="JOB 39:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 39:5"/>“Hwan na ɔma wiram afunumu fa ne ho die?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:5">Hwan na ɔsanee ne nhoma?<verse eid="JOB 39:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 39:6"/>Mede asase bonini maa no sɛ ne fie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:6">ne nkyene asase tamaa sɛ nʼatenaeɛ.<verse eid="JOB 39:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 39:7"/>Ɔsere kurom gyegyeegyeyɛ no;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:7">na ɔnte ɔkafoɔ nteateam.<verse eid="JOB 39:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 39:8"/>Ɔkyinkyini mmepɔ no so sɛ nʼadidibea;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:8">ɛhɔ na ɔkyin hwehwɛ wira mono biara.<verse eid="JOB 39:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 39:9"/>“Ɛkoɔ bɛpene sɛ ɔbɛsom wo anaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:9">Ɔbɛtena wo mmoa adididaka nkyɛn anadwo anaa?<verse eid="JOB 39:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 39:10"/>Wobɛtumi asa no wɔ fentemfidie so?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:10">Ɔbɛfentem mmɔnhwa a ɛda wʼakyi anaa?<verse eid="JOB 39:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 39:11"/>Wobɛtumi de wo ho ato no so ɛsiane nʼahoɔden dodoɔ nti?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:11">Wobɛgya wʼadwuma a ɛyɛ den ama no anaa?<verse eid="JOB 39:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 39:12"/>Wogye di sɛ ɔde wʼaburo bɛba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:12">na waboa ano de akɔ ayuporobea anaa?<verse eid="JOB 39:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 39:13"/>“Sohori bɔ nʼataban mu anigyeɛ so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:13">nanso wɔntumi mfa ntoto asukɔnkɔn deɛ ho.<verse eid="JOB 39:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 39:14"/>Ɔto ne nkosua gu asase so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:14">ma mfuturo ka no hye,<verse eid="JOB 39:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 39:15"/>ɛmfa ne ho sɛ ɛnan bi bɛpɛkyɛ no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:15">sɛ wiram aboa bi bɛtiatia so.<verse eid="JOB 39:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 39:16"/>Ɔbɔ ne mma atirimuɔden sɛdeɛ wɔnnyɛ ne dea;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:16">ɛmfa ne ho sɛ nʼadwuma bɛyɛ kwa,<verse eid="JOB 39:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 39:17"/>ɛfiri sɛ Onyankopɔn amma no nyansa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:17">wamma no nhunumu biara.<verse eid="JOB 39:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 39:18"/>Nanso sɛ ɔtrɛ ne ntaban mu tu mmirika a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:18">ɔsere ɔpɔnkɔ ne ne sotefoɔ.<verse eid="JOB 39:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 39:19"/>“Wo na woma ɔpɔnkɔ no nʼahoɔden</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:19">anaa wode ne kɔn mu nwi kuhaa no ma no?<verse eid="JOB 39:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 39:20"/>Wo na woma no huri te sɛ ntutummɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:20">na ɔde ne nkorɔmo hunahuna anaa?<verse eid="JOB 39:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 39:21"/>Ɔde ne nan tintim fam denden, na nʼani gye nʼahoɔden mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:21">na afei ɔbɔ wura ɔko mu.<verse eid="JOB 39:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 39:22"/>Ɔmmɔ hu, na ɔnsuro biribiara;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:22">ɔhunu akofena a ɔnnwane.<verse eid="JOB 39:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 39:23"/>Bɛmma woso wɔ ne nkyɛn mu bɔha mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:23">na pea ne pɛmɛ nso di ahim wɔ ne ho.<verse eid="JOB 39:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 39:24"/>Ɔfiri ahopereɛ mu de nʼano sisi fam;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:24">na sɛ wɔhyɛn totorobɛnto a, ɔntumi nnyina faako.<verse eid="JOB 39:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 39:25"/>Sɛ totorobɛnto hyɛne a ɔka sɛ, ‘Wiɛɛ!’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:25">ɔte ɔko ho hwa firi akyirikyiri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:25">ɔsahene no nteamu ne ɔko mu osebɔ.<verse eid="JOB 39:25"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 39:26"/>“Wo nyansa na ɛma akorɔma tuo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:26">na ɔtrɛ ne ntaban mu fa anafoɔ?<verse eid="JOB 39:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 39:27"/>Wo na wohyɛ ɔkɔdeɛ ma no tu kɔ sorosoro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:27">kɔyɛ ne pirebuo wɔ hɔ?<verse eid="JOB 39:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 39:28"/>Ɔbotan mu na ɔteɛ na ɛhɔ na ɔda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:28">ɔbotan sorɔnsorɔn yɛ nʼabandenden.<verse eid="JOB 39:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 39:29"/>Ɛhɔ na ɔfiri kɔpɛ nʼaduane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:29">nʼani hunu adeɛ a ɛwɔ akyirikyiri.<verse eid="JOB 39:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 39:30"/>Mogya yɛ ne mma aduane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:30">na baabi a atɔfoɔ wɔ no, ɛhɔ na ɔwɔ.”<verse eid="JOB 39:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 39"/>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="JOB 40"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 40:1"/>Afei <char style="nd">Awurade</char> buaa Hiob sɛ,<verse eid="JOB 40:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 40:2"/>“Deɛ ɔne Otumfoɔ no wɔ asɛm no bɛtene ne so anaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:2">Ma deɛ ɔbɔ Onyankopɔn kwaadu no mmua no ɛ!”<verse eid="JOB 40:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 40:3"/>Na Hiob buaa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> sɛ,<verse eid="JOB 40:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 40:4"/>“Mensɛ na memfata, ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na matumi anya mmuaeɛ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:4">Mede me nsa memua mʼano.<verse eid="JOB 40:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 40:5"/>Makasa baako, nanso menni mmuaeɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:5">mprenu so, na merenkasa bio.”<verse eid="JOB 40:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 40:6"/>Afei, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> firi ahum mu buaa Hiob sɛ,<verse eid="JOB 40:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 40:7"/>“Hyɛ wo ho den sɛ ɔbarima;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:7">mɛbisa wo nsɛm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:7">na ɛsɛ sɛ wobua me.<verse eid="JOB 40:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 40:8"/>“Wobɛka mʼatemmuo ho asɛm bɔne anaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:8">Wobɛbu me fɔ de abu wo ho bem?<verse eid="JOB 40:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 40:9"/>Wowɔ abasa te sɛ Onyankopɔn deɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:9">na wo nne bɛtumi abobom sɛ ne deɛ?<verse eid="JOB 40:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 40:10"/>Ɛnneɛ fa animuonyam ne ɔhyerɛn hyehyɛ wo ho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:10">na fira anidie ne kɛseyɛ.<verse eid="JOB 40:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 40:11"/>Hwie wʼabufuhyeɛ mmoroso no gu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:11">hwɛ ɔhantanni biara na brɛ no ase,<verse eid="JOB 40:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 40:12"/>hwɛ ɔhantanni biara na si no fam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:12">na tiatia amumuyɛfoɔ so wɔ faako a wɔgyina hɔ.<verse eid="JOB 40:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 40:13"/>Sie wɔn nyinaa bɔ mu wɔ mfuturo mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:13">kata wɔn anim wɔ damena mu.<verse eid="JOB 40:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 40:14"/>Na afei mʼankasa mɛgye atom sɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:14">wo ara wo basa nifa bɛtumi agye wo nkwa.<verse eid="JOB 40:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 40:15"/>“Hwɛ susono,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:15">deɛ meyɛɛ no kaa wo ho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:15">na ɔwe ɛserɛ te sɛ ɔnantwie.<verse eid="JOB 40:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 40:16"/>Hwɛ ahoɔden a ɔwɔ wɔ nʼasene mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:16">ne ahoɔden fufuo a ɛwɔ ne yafunu so wedeɛ mu!<verse eid="JOB 40:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 40:17"/>Ne dua hinhim sɛ ntweneduro;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:17">ne srɛ mu ntini yɛ peperee.<verse eid="JOB 40:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 40:18"/>Ne nnompe te sɛ kɔbere mfrafraeɛ nnorobɛn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:18">nʼabasa ne ne nan te sɛ nnadeɛ praban.<verse eid="JOB 40:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 40:19"/>Ɔdi Onyankopɔn nsa ano adwuma mu kan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:19">nanso ne Yɛfoɔ bɛtumi de akofena akɔ ne so.<verse eid="JOB 40:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 40:20"/>Nkokoɔ fifiri wɔn nnɔbaeɛ ma no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:20">na wiram mmoa nyinaa goro bɛn hɔ.<verse eid="JOB 40:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 40:21"/>Nkasɛɛ nkasɛɛ nnua ase na ɔda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:21">na atɛkyɛ mu demmire akata no so.<verse eid="JOB 40:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 40:22"/>Nkasɛɛ nkasɛɛ nwunu no hata ne so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:22">na nsunoa nnua atwa ne ho ahyia.<verse eid="JOB 40:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 40:23"/>Nsuo nworosoɔ nha no;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:23">mpo sɛ Yordan bobɔ ba nʼano a, ɔnni ɔhaw.<verse eid="JOB 40:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 40:24"/>Obi bɛtumi akye no animono;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:24">anaa obi bɛtumi de afidie ayi no na wabɔne ne hwene mu?<verse eid="JOB 40:24"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="JOB 40"/>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="JOB 41"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 41:1"/>“Wobɛtumi de darewa atwe ɔdɛnkyɛmmirampɔn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:1">anaa wobɛtumi de ahoma akyekyere ne tɛkrɛma?<verse eid="JOB 41:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 41:2"/>Wobɛtumi de ahoma afa ne hwenemu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:2">anaasɛ wobɛtumi de darewa asɔ nʼapantan mu?<verse eid="JOB 41:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 41:3"/>Ɔbɛkɔ so asrɛ wo sɛ hunu no mmɔbɔ anaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:3">Ɔne wo bɛkasa brɛoo?<verse eid="JOB 41:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 41:4"/>Ɔbɛpene ne wo ayɛ apam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:4">ama wode no ayɛ wʼakoa afebɔɔ anaa?<verse eid="JOB 41:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 41:5"/>Wobɛtumi de no ayɛ ayɛmmoa te sɛ anomaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:5">anaa wobɛtumi asa no ahoma de no ama wo mmammaa?<verse eid="JOB 41:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 41:6"/>Adwadifoɔ bɛpɛ sɛ wobɛtɔ no de no adi dwa anaa?<verse eid="JOB 41:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 41:7"/>Wobɛtumi de mpea awowɔ ne wedeɛ mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:7">anaasɛ wode mpataa pɛmɛ bɛwowɔ ne tiri ho?<verse eid="JOB 41:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 41:8"/>Wode wo nsa ka no a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:8">wobɛkae sɛdeɛ ɔbɛwoso ne ho, enti worenyɛ saa bio!<verse eid="JOB 41:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 41:9"/>Ɛkwan biara nni hɔ a wobɛfa so akye no;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:9">ani a ɛbɔ ne so kɛkɛ no ma nnipa dwodwo.<verse eid="JOB 41:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 41:10"/>Obiara ntumi nsi ne bo nhwanyane no.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:10">Afei hwan na ɔbɛtumi ne me adi asie?<verse eid="JOB 41:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 41:11"/>Hwan na mede no ka a ɛsɛ sɛ metua?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:11">Biribiara a ɛhyɛ ɔsoro ase wɔ me.<verse eid="JOB 41:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 41:12"/>“Me werɛ remfiri sɛ mɛka nʼakwaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:12">nʼahoɔden ne ne bɔberɛ fɛfɛ no ho asɛm.<verse eid="JOB 41:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 41:13"/>Hwan na ɔbɛtumi aworɔ ne ho nwoma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:13">na hwan na ɔde nnareka bɛkɔ ne ho?<verse eid="JOB 41:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 41:14"/>Hwan na ɔbɛtumi abue nʼapantan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:14">a ɛse a ɛyɛ hu ayɛ no ma no?<verse eid="JOB 41:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 41:15"/>Nʼakyi wɔ abona a ɛsesa soɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:15">ɛpipi so a ɛkwan nna mu koraa;<verse eid="JOB 41:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 41:16"/>sɛdeɛ ɛpipi so fa no enti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:16">mframa biara mfa ntam.<verse eid="JOB 41:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 41:17"/>Ɛtoatoa mu dendeenden a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:17">emu ntumi ntete.<verse eid="JOB 41:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 41:18"/>Sɛ ɔnwansi a, ɛtete ogya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:18">nʼaniwa aba te sɛ ahemadakye hann.<verse eid="JOB 41:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 41:19"/>Egyatɛn turi firi nʼanom</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:19">na nsramma turituri firi mu.<verse eid="JOB 41:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 41:20"/>Wisie tene firi ne hwene mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:20">te sɛ ɛsɛn a ɛsi ogya soɔ.<verse eid="JOB 41:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 41:21"/>Nʼahomeɛ ma gyabidie ano sɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:21">na egyadɛreɛ tu firi nʼanom.<verse eid="JOB 41:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 41:22"/>Ne kɔn mu wɔ ahoɔden ankasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:22">wɔn a wɔhunu no no abasa mu tu.<verse eid="JOB 41:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 41:23"/>Ne wedeɛ a abubu agu soɔ no yɛ peperee;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:23">ayɛ pemee a ɛnkeka ne ho.<verse eid="JOB 41:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 41:24"/>Ne koko so yɛ dene sɛ ɔbotan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:24">ɛyɛ dene sɛ ayuoyammoɔ.<verse eid="JOB 41:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 41:25"/>Sɛ ɔsɔre a, ahoɔdenfoɔ bɔ huboa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:25">sɛ ɔporo ne ho a, wɔdwane.<verse eid="JOB 41:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 41:26"/>Akofena wɔ no a, ɛnka no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:26">pea, pɛmɛ ne agyan nso saa ara.<verse eid="JOB 41:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 41:27"/>Ɔfa dadeɛ sɛ wira bi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:27">na kɔbere mfrafraeɛ te sɛ dua a awuo bi ma no.<verse eid="JOB 41:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 41:28"/>Agyan mma no nnwane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:28">ahwimmoɔ mu aboa yɛ ntɛtɛ ma no.<verse eid="JOB 41:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 41:29"/>Aporibaa te sɛ ɛserɛ wɔ nʼani so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:29">na ɔsere pɛmɛ nnyegyeɛ.<verse eid="JOB 41:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 41:30"/>Abon a ano yɛ nnam tuatua ne yafunu so.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:30">Ɔtwe ne ho ase wɔ fam fa atɛkyɛ mu a, ɛyiyi akam.<verse eid="JOB 41:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 41:31"/>Ɔma ebunu mu huru sɛ nsuo a ɛwɔ ɛsɛn mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:31">na ɔnunu ɛpo mu sɛ sradeɛ a ɛwɔ kukuo mu.<verse eid="JOB 41:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 41:32"/>Deɛ ɔbɛfa no, ɛhɔ nsuo no pa yerɛyerɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:32">na obi bɛsusu sɛ ɛpo bunu adane ayɛ dwono.<verse eid="JOB 41:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 41:33"/>Biribiara a ɛwɔ asase so ne no nsɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:33">Ɔyɛ abɔdeɛ a ɔnsuro hwee.<verse eid="JOB 41:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 41:34"/>Ɔmmu wɔn a wɔyɛ ahantan no mu biara;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:34">ɔyɛ wɔn a wɔyɛ ahomasoɔ no nyinaa so ɔhene.”<verse eid="JOB 41:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 41"/>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="JOB 42"/>
  <para style="s1">Hiob Bua <char style="nd">Awurade</char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 42:1"/>Na Hiob buaa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> sɛ,<verse eid="JOB 42:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 42:2"/>“Menim sɛ wotumi yɛ nneɛma nyinaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:2">obiara rentumi nsɛe wo nhyehyɛeɛ.<verse eid="JOB 42:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 42:3"/>Wobisa sɛ, ‘Hwan ni a ɔnni nimdeɛ nso ɔsi mʼafotuo ho ɛkwan?’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:3">Ampa ara mekaa nneɛma a mente aseɛ ho nsɛm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:3">nneɛma a ɛyɛ nwanwa ma me.<verse eid="JOB 42:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 42:4"/>“Wokaa sɛ, ‘Tie na menkasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:4">mɛbisa wo nsɛm</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:4">na ɛsɛ sɛ woma me mmuaeɛ.’<verse eid="JOB 42:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 42:5"/>Mate wo nka pɛn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:5">na seesei deɛ, mʼani ahunu wo.<verse eid="JOB 42:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 42:6"/>Ɛno enti mebu me ho animtiaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:6">na mete mfuturo ne nsõ mu de kyerɛ mʼahonu.”<verse eid="JOB 42:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Awieeɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 42:7"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> kaa nsɛm yi kyerɛɛ Hiob wieeɛ no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Temanni Elifas sɛ, “Me bo afu wo ne wo nnamfonom baanu no, ɛfiri sɛ, moanka me ho asɛm a ɛyɛ nokorɛ sɛdeɛ me ɔsomfoɔ Hiob kaeɛ no. <verse eid="JOB 42:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 42:8"/>Afei, momfa anantwie nson ne nnwennini nson, na monkɔ me ɔsomfoɔ Hiob nkyɛn, na monkɔbɔ ɔhyeɛ afɔdeɛ mma mo ho. Me ɔsomfoɔ Hiob bɛbɔ mpaeɛ ama mo, na mɛtie ne mpaeɛbɔ no na merenyɛ mo sɛdeɛ ɛfata mo nkwaseasɛm no. Nsɛm a moka faa me ho no nyɛ nokorɛ sɛdeɛ me ɔsomfoɔ Hiob yɛeɛ no.” <verse eid="JOB 42:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 42:9"/>Enti, Temanni Elifas ne Suhini Bildad ne Naamani Sofar yɛɛ sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hyɛɛ wɔn no, na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> tiee Hiob mpaeɛbɔ.<verse eid="JOB 42:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 42:10"/>Hiob bɔɔ mpaeɛ maa ne nnamfonom akyi no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> sane yɛɛ no ɔdefoɔ bio na ɔde nʼahodeɛ a na ɔwɔ kane no mmɔho mmienu maa no. <verse eid="JOB 42:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 42:11"/>Afei, ne nuammarima, ne nuammaa nyinaa ne obiara a na ɔnim no dada no baa ne fie ne no bɛdidiiɛ. Wɔkyekyeree ne werɛ wɔ amanehunu a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ma ɔkɔɔ mu no ho, na wɔn mu biara brɛɛ no dwetɛ ne sikakɔkɔɔ kawa.<verse eid="JOB 42:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 42:12"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hyiraa Hiob nkwa awieeɛ senee ne ahyɛaseɛ. Ɔnyaa nnwan ɔpedunan, nyoma mpem nsia, anantwinini mpamho apem ne mfunumu abereɛ apem. <verse eid="JOB 42:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 42:13"/>Bio ɔnyaa mmammarima baason ne mmammaa baasa. <verse eid="JOB 42:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 42:14"/>Ɔtoo ne babaa piesie no edin Yemima, na deɛ ɔdi soɔ no Kesia na deɛ ɔtɔ so mmiɛnsa no de Keren-Hapuk. <verse eid="JOB 42:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 42:15"/>Asase no so nyinaa, na mmaa biara nni hɔ a wɔn ho yɛ fɛ sɛ Hiob mmammaa no, na wɔn agya de wɔn kaa wɔn nuammarima no ho maa wɔn agyapadeɛ.<verse eid="JOB 42:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 42:16"/>Yei akyiri no, Hiob dii mfirinhyia ɔha aduanan; ɔhunuu ne mma ne ne mmanana awoɔ ntoatoasoɔ ɛnan. <verse eid="JOB 42:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 42:17"/>Afei ɔwuiɛ a na wayɛ akora pa ara.<verse eid="JOB 42:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 42"/>
</usx>
